 bedrooms sit on the left side of the hallway along with a full bathroom and two sit on the right side of the hallway? one of which features extra closet space and an en-suite, three-quarter bathroom. A dedicated laundry room with extra storage sits between the kitchen and the two-car garage. The two-car garage has a built-in work bench and extra storage space. A large driveway capable of parking several vehicles rounds out the ample parking on the property. The home also features double paned windows, wood flooring in the main living areas, tile in the entry, and carpet in the bedrooms.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","First showings Thursday, April 9 11a - 1p. 48 hours notice to show. Call Bill for appointment 310-877-2374. Do NOT use showingtime. Broker / Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, zoning, permits, use code, schools and / or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to verify the accuracy of all information through inspection and with appropriate professionals.","","None","False","","1816","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Acana","","28031","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25107","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/4c245e60-45ce-4d31-a885-8d9ef370b5f4?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&utm_source=dashboard","","","1962","90275","",""
