cean views. The home features a bright, open floor plan enhanced by multiple skylights, creating light-filled living spaces throughout. The spacious living room with fireplace flows into the open kitchen and dining area, where a center island, ample cabinetry, and an eat-in dining space create an ideal layout for both everyday living and entertaining. Multiple windows throughout the home showcase serene views of the pool and surrounding hillside. The residence offers five bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two primary suites, providing flexible living arrangements ideal for multi-generational living, guests, or a private office. Most living spaces and bedrooms are conveniently located on the main level, offering comfortable and functional single-level living. The backyard is designed for relaxation and entertaining, featuring a pool, patio areas, and tranquil hillside surroundings that create a private outdoor retreat. Conveniently located near the Palos Verdes Shopping Center, top-rated Palos Verdes schools, Los Verdes Golf Club, scenic coastal trails, and Terranea Resort, this property combines privacy, space, and location?an exceptional opportunity to create your dream home in one of Rancho Palos Verdes?s most desirable neighborhoods.","Composition","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","PLEASE TEXT YOUR BUSINESS CARD AND CODE FOR LOCK BOX WILL BE PROVIDED. THANK YOU FOR SHOWING.","False","","","True","2539","Assessor","","CA","Active","One, Multi/Split ","","","Santona","","28068","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract","","25107","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo, Pool","True","","","Screens, Skylight(s)","1962","90275","3234","RPRS10000*"
