o a front veranda where ocean breezes drift through, offering a refreshing place to unwind. The entertainer?s kitchen is designed to bring people together, featuring a complement of appliances, a breakfast nook ideal for sipping morning coffee, and a striking waterfall island that anchors the layout with flair. Whether preparing weeknight meals, midnight snacks, or hosting formal get-togethers, the abundant cabinetry and luminous countertops keep everything within easy reach. Retreat to the generous primary suite, where wood-style flooring, a walk-in closet, and a rejuvenating ensuite with dual sinks and a shower and tub combination create a soothing environment to recharge. The adjoining open flex space can be adapted to fit any need, while a shared hall bath with a rainfall shower delivers a touch of luxury. Your remaining three bedrooms provide versatility for guests, hobbies, or remote work, including one with its own exterior access. Venture outdoors to a vibrant backyard framed by tall trees and layered greenery, where a raised garden bed and fence provide both beauty and privacy. The rear patio offers shaded seating for afternoon relaxation alongside open areas ready for you to soak up the sun or host weekend BBQs. An attached 2-car garage with ample storage opens directly to the dedicated laundry room and its adjacent guest bath for added convenience.  Enjoy its proximity to the Peninsula Shopping Center, scenic hiking trails, golf courses, nearby beaches, and local schools, including Palos Verdes Peninsula High School, along with easy access to Long Beach and iconic LA destinations. Come experience a home that blends elegance, function, and location seamlessly!","","Entry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Contact LA","True","None","False","True","2237","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Hawkhurst","