set, and a ensuite bathroom, creating a peaceful retreat. One of the additional bedrooms also enjoys peekaboo city and harbor views, while the secondary bathroom has been tastefully updated with modern finishes. The light-filled living area provides a welcoming space to relax, watch TV, or gather with friends and family. Outside, the elevated sundeck is perfect for al fresco dining and lounging, while the grassy backyard and side yard, enclosed with a wooden fence, offer space for entertaining, pets, or kids to play. Additional conveniences include an attached garage, along with driveway and street parking for guests. Located within the highly sought-after Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, the Jaybrook Residence combines comfort, views, and location in one of the South Bay's most desirable coastal communities. Come experience the Jaybrook Residence before this move-in-ready home is gone!","","Entry, Formal Entry, Living Room, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Text/call (424) 419-1422 your biz card and desired day/time of showing Showing Information: Text LA 1 ","True","None","False","","1221","Assessor","","CA","Active","One","","","Jaybrook","","1836","Drive","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Harbor, Ocean","True","","","","1950","90275","2030","RPRS-4*"
