Real Estate","310-266-1649","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.318886","","123","5943","0-1 Unit/Acre","Curbs, Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","DW26055782","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","56","","None","False","","773.07","VIEWS, VIEWS, VIEWS! Welcome to this beautifully RENOVATED 3 bedroom, 2-bathroom home located in prime South Shores neighborhood.  This home has an inviting curb appeal featuring gorgeous new landscaping, a 2-car garage with epoxy floors and large driveway offering off street parking for multiple cars.  This home has a bright open floor plan with the downstairs living area opening to the kitchen and dining area.  The kitchen has been updated with new cabinets, sleek Maldivi Quartzite counter tops, tile backsplash, stylish fixtures, stainless-steel appliances, and large center island with additional countertop seating.  The spacious primary bedroom has 2 closets with custom built-ins, an ensuite bathroom and access to the back yard patio.  Both the primary and hall bathroom feature new vanities, stylish new fixtures, and custom tile work.  Other features include freshly painted interior and exterior, new luxury flooring throughout the living area, bedrooms and family room, tile flooring in the bathrooms, new energy efficient vinyl windows, new roof, plumbing and light fixtures, upgraded 200 AMP electrical panel, HVAC, new exterior fencing, new ceiling fans and spacious indoor laundry room with built in cabinets for additional storage. The upstairs flex room features and abundance of windows with PANORAMIC OCEAN AND CATALINA VIEWS, vaulted ceilings, decorative fireplace and AC split system.    The accordion glass door in the living room offers the perfect blend of indoor outdoor living and leads to the private enclosed backyard with a large  patio and manicured yard perfect for outdoor fun and entertainment.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False