"None","0.1988","Owners are moving to the UK and will need time to plan moving. Will most likely need a rent back. Call Jake with any other questions!","Dishwasher, Electric Range, Electric Cooktop, Refrigerator","True","179 - South Shores","None","False","7562025049","","0","","False","3","","","2","1","4","","San Pedro","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","VDYERSUZ","","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Offers Email","Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","20","1675000","#ERR","03/17/2026 10:52:24 AM","","","","03/31/2026 6:18:34 AM","","","03/17/2026 12:00:00 AM","","03/17/2026 10:52:24 AM","","03/17/2026 12:00:00 AM","","South","20","","False","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","","","","","Living Room, Gas, Wood Burning","True","Wood","True","Central","True","2 Staircases, Ceiling Fan(s), Granite Counters, In-Law Floorplan, Wet Bar","True","True","Front Door","Supra","False","","","","33.72817","In Garage","True","False","","","1675000","","","1675000","#ERR","3109844608","","jakesullivanhomes@gmail.com","","Jake","310-514-8021","","Sullivan","","PVSULLJAK","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.324668","","6","8661","0-1 Unit/Acre","Curbs, Hiking , Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","PV26057872","","2","4","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage, Street","","Concrete","True","70","","Private, Heated","True","Negotiable","661.79","Imagine starting your day with the sunrise toward Dana Point and ending with the golden sun melting into the Pacific behind Santa Barbara Island, with Catalina Island perfectly centered on the horizon. That is the everyday backdrop at this South Shores home, where breathtaking ocean views unfold from nearly every room and from the front-row pool overlooking the coastline. From morning coffee overlooking the water to watching the clouds transform the sky throughout the day, no two days are ever the same ? offering the kind of scenery most people only experience on vacation. This home was designed to embrace natures incredible vistas, beginning with the entry level that welcomes you with a versatile dining area or den complete with a wet bar and direct access to the garage. Downstairs, the living room opens toward the view, centered around a fireplace with sliding glass doors that lead directly to the backyard and pool. The living room flows into a sitting room facing the ocean and a kitchen featuring granite countertops, natural-tone cabinetry, and a breakfast nook with a second set of sliding doors to the yard. There is one bedroom on this level, currently used as an office, with glass French doors that enjoy the views, along with a nearby three-quarter bathroom and storage room. The thoughtful tri-level layout continues upstairs, where the remaining three bedrooms capture elevated views. The primary suite serves as a peaceful retreat, highlighted by a large picture window framing the coastline and a remodeled ensuite bathroom with a spacious walk-in shower showcasing a custom angled glass design. Step outside and the backyard becomes the showstopper. The ocean-facing pool and expansive patio create a dreamlike setting to relax and entertain. Whether hosting sunset dinners, enjoying warm afternoons by the pool, or simply unwinding as the sky changes over the Pacific, this outdoor space was designed to be enjoyed! Additional upgrades include hardwood floors, central HVAC, remodeled kitchen and bathrooms completed between 2014-2016. Conveniently located near stunning hiking trails, shopping, restaurants, and the exciting new West Harbor development. Whether you like to entertain or prefer peace and privacy, this home offers a front-row seat to the very best of coastal living ? where breathtaking ocean scenery, a poolside retreat, and a once in a lifetime opportunity come together in one exceptional property. This is refined living at its best. Welcome home!","","Den, Entry, Family Room, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call Jake for all showings. Listing Agent must attend. Multiple cats on dogs on property so please allow a heads up of at least 2 hours.","True","None","False","","2531","Assessor","","CA","Active","Multi/Split ","","","Grenadier","","2225","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27054","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=pEodFNWvL2H","https://youtu.be/7paxoF8sSv0","Double Pane Windows","1964","90732","",""
