Garage - Three Door, Gated","True","Brick, Patio Open","True","62","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1024.59","DO YOU WANT TO BE THE PRIVILEGE FEW WHO LIVE ON A BLUFF PROPERTY ALONG THE MOST BEAUTIFUL CALIFORNIA COASTLINE? This may be your once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to do so! View! View!! View!!! Live the finest California coastal lifestyle in this premier estate with sweeping panoramic ocean, Catalina Island and white-water views. Ideally positioned on the exclusive front row of Paseo Del Mar in the coveted South Shore community, this property sits high above the bluff, offering an unmatched vantage point of the Pacific and endless horizon. This split-level residence is ideal as a primary residence or a vacation home.  From the moment you enter through the front gate, a spacious paved courtyard and three-car garage set the tone for the grandeur beyond. Once Inside, breathtaking ocean views unfold from the great room, kitchen, two family rooms, primary suite, and a secondary bedroom. Meanwhile, the sound of crashing waves and refreshing ocean breezes enhance the serene atmosphere. Vaulted ceilings and expansive windows fill the home with natural light, amplifying the open, airy feel. ON THE MAIN LEVEL, a stunning great room with a cozy fireplace and a full-width balcony captures unobstructed ocean vistas. The open kitchen offers generous cabinetry and allows you to cook while enjoying the view, flowing seamlessly into a family room ideal for gatherings and everyday use. A 4th bedroom is added for guest/in-laws/creative use with a bathroom nearby. THE MID LEVEL features a Primary Suite with expansive windows/door and high ceiling, a walk-in closet with a vanity area, and sliding doors opening to a private view deck. The en-suite bath includes dual sinks and a shower. Nearby, a conveniently located powder room adds ease and functionality. THE LOWER LEVEL offers an additional family room with backyard access, a view bedroom, another bedroom, and a shared hallway bath. A laundry room is also included in this level for everyday use. Once outside, the paved backyard becomes your private oceanfront retreat?perfect for entertaining, relaxing in the ocean breeze, listening to the waves below, and spotting passing sea life. Durable metal shutters are installed on all ocean-facing windows and sliding doors for enhanced safety and protection. With easy access to scenic coastal trails, the setting offers both privacy and natural beauty.  An extraordinary blufftop setting with unparalleled views and limitless potential, don?t miss this rare opportunity to make it your own.","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Los Angeles Unified","","San Pedro","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME. No Supra Lockbox. For all showings, please contact my team member, Cindy Carter, at 310-388-2533, to set it up and she will meet you and your client at the property.","True","","","","3172","Assessor","","CA","Active","Multi/Split ","W","","Paseo Del Mar","","2105","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","19457","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, White Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/490026","","Garden Window(s), Skylight(s), Storm Window(s)","1973","90732","",""
