e oak floors lend warmth throughout, while the chef?s kitchen completes with dual islands, Statuario Venato marble, and premium stainless-steel appliances to strikes a perfect balance between form and function. Aluminum-clad windows and doors flood the interiors with natural light and define the home?s clean architectural lines. Upstairs, a family lounge captures beautiful coastline views, and the primary suite provides a serene retreat with a spa-inspired bath, expansive walk-in closet, and a private balcony overlooking the ocean and coastline. Integrated home technology further enhances daily living, including a comprehensive AV system, in-ceiling speakers, mesh Wi-Fi, integrated cameras, smart thermostat, a three-zone Lennox heat pump HVAC system, and Navien tankless water heaters. Equally impressive, the exterior showcases an American Slate Cupa50 roof, natural Saint Barts mosaic stone walling, and thoughtfully designed landscape lighting that brings the property to life at night. A gated entry and spacious motor court add both privacy and presence. Ideally positioned just steps from the Ocean Bluff and moments from award-winning Palos Verdes schools and premier local amenities, this exceptional residence stands as a definitive expression of inspired design, refined comfort, and the pinnacle of coastal living.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text 310-544-7301 for showing.","True","","","","4953","Appraiser","","CA","Active Under Contract","Two","","","Apsley","","704","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean","True","","","","1967","90274","",""
"","0.9615","Please send offers to Ken@KenConant.com and Jackie@KenConant.com","Electric Cooktop, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7541004017","","0","","False","6","1","","1","4","6","1170","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Text Message","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Direct Ph","","","None","False","Los Angeles","56","10400000","#ERR","02/09/2026 6:43:32 PM","","03/11/2026 12:49:51 PM","","04/01/2026 5:43:20 PM","","","02/09/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/31/2026 12:00:00 AM","02/09/2026 6:43:32 PM","","03/31/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","56","Double Door Entry","True","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room, In Kitchen, Separated, See Remarks","Balcony","","","","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, See Remarks","True","Central","True","Balcony, Bar, Elevator, Living Room Balcony, Stone Counters","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.783428","In Kitchen","True","False","","","10400000","","","11800000","#ERR","3107299659","","Ken@KenConant.com","","Ken","","","Conant","","SCONAKEN","","","","","S4164","310-378-2745","Estate Properties","310-378-9889","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.420738","","2","41883","Back Yard, Front Yard, Lot Over 40000 Sqft","Suburban","Automatic Gate","Assessor","","","SB26029458","","3","3","","1","Vacant","","","","Guest House","Direct Garage Access, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Two Door, See Remarks","True","Patio, See Remarks, Stone","True","75","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","2013.16","Iconic Bluff-Front Estate, Resort-Style Coastal Living !!   A rare generational opportunity to own a landmark, gated bluff-front estate on an extraordinary 41,883 sq ft mostly flat lot with sweeping whitewater, coastline, and Pacific Ocean views. This private, resort-style property offers over 5,100 sq ft with 6 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms, family room and expansive living spaces designed to capture the ever-changing ocean vistas. Gated and exceptionally private, this serene coastal retreat delivers every amenity expected of an iconic California estate?pool, tennis court, shuffleboard, pool house, bluff-front gazebo, and ever-changing sunsets accompanied by the soothing sound of waves below.  Built in 1973 and offered for the first time since construction, the home features classic architectural elements and presents an exceptional opportunity to reimagine a truly irreplaceable coastal residence. Ocean views are enjoyed from most rooms, including the formal living room, family room, kitchen, and upstairs en-suite bedrooms with balcony access. The grounds are reminiscent of a private retreat, featuring mature landscaping, pool, tennis court, shuffleboard, pool house, bluff-front gazebo, and multiple patios ideal for entertaining or quiet reflection. Watch whales, surfers, pelicans, and diving boats below while enjoying unforgettable sunsets and the soothing sound of waves. After entering through private gates and a long driveway, you are transported to a serene setting that feels worlds away from the city below?yet close to everything the Peninsula offers. Many stately homes grace the Peninsula, but few possess this property?s rare combination of proximity to the water where you feel the connection to the ocean, expansive flat grounds, architectural presence, and soul. Created from a blank canvas, this beloved estate has been a home filled with decades of family, gatherings, and celebrations?now awaiting its next notable owner to carry its legacy forward. A once-in-a-generation opportunity to own an iconic piece of the California coastline. Enjoy whales swimming by, surfers on the waves below, pelicans flying pass, and diving boats anchored nearby.   The pictures are spectacular, but they cannot capture the feelings you will experience.  You will never tire of watching the everchanging sunsets over the majestic Pacific Ocean.","","Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor 