outdoor flow. The kitchen features a breakfast nook and connects conveniently to the adjacent laundry room, while the generously scaled formal dining room is well positioned between the kitchen and living areas, a natural extension of the home?s entertaining spaces.  The expansive backyard remains largely untouched creating a blank canvas ready for landscaping, a pool, or a reimagined outdoor retreat. A three-car garage with direct access into the home, along with an oversized driveway, provides abundant parking and storage.  Set in Montemalaga, this is an opportunity to shape the next chapter of a timeless home.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Vacant with a lockbox on the railing near the front doo.","True","None","False","","3062","Assessor","","CA","Active Under Contract","Two","","","Via Cataluna","","1309","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1966","90274","",""
