el in prestigious Palos Verdes Estates, this beautifully reimagined single-level residence captures panoramic coastal views stretching from Malibu all the way to the Hollywood Sign. Framed in timeless ranch architecture, the home offers four bedrooms?one ideally suited as an executive office?and five well-appointed bathrooms, all thoughtfully designed for comfort and functionality. Walls of French doors open to a breathtaking backyard sanctuary where lush landscaping takes center stage. Whether hosting sunset gatherings on the ?Queen?s Necklace? view deck or enjoying a quiet morning in the enchanting rose garden and storybook gazebo, the setting feels both grand and intimate. The oversized grounds also offer ample space to envision a future pickleball court, resort-style pool, or private putting green. Inside, natural light pours into two generous living areas overlooking the coastline and gardens, while a formal dining room sets the stage for elegant entertaining. The serene primary suite features dual vanities, a soaking tub, and a separate shower?creating a spa-like escape. Two additional guest suites enjoy their own private baths, and the flexible fourth bedroom/office adapts seamlessly to your needs. 6 interior windows look out to the Queen's Necklace view plus the ""view deck"" out back.  Hardwood floors run throughout, complemented by beautifully crafted wood fireplace mantles and and crown moldings at the ceilings. Other amenities include a sweeping circular driveway running past the attached two-car garage, two zone HVAC and water heater systems. Recently refreshed and meticulously restored, this move-in-ready home pairs classic charm with modern ease. Located within the award-winning Palos Verdes school district and just moments from beaches, hiking trails, and local amenities, this coastal estate embodies the very best of the Palos Verdes lifestyle.","","Entry, Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Palos Verdes","Pal