Los Angeles define this exquisitely custom-remodeled 2-bedroom, 3-bath home in sought-after Malaga Cove?a truly rare offering. The home features a thoughtfully designed open floor plan with stunning views from most rooms, complemented by custom cabinetry throughout that adds both beauty and functionality. The gourmet kitchen is a showpiece, featuring an oversized center island with white marble countertops and seating for six, top-of-the-line appliances including a Wolf 6-burner range and oven, Dacor refrigerator and freezer, Bosch dishwasher, hand-forged brass fixtures, and oak hardwood floors. A spacious dining and family room flows seamlessly from the kitchen, with doors opening to an ocean-view balcony. The inviting living room includes a fireplace and opens to an outdoor patio?perfect for entertaining and enjoying the coveted Malaga Cove lifestyle. The generous primary suite offers direct access to the rear patio and a beautifully remodeled bath with marble countertops, shower, and flooring. The second bedroom is currently used as an office, 2nd bathroom is a full with tub and shower, white marble counters, and finishes. A separate utility room with laundry, built-in workspace, 1/2 bath, and convertible daybed provides flexibility for overnight guests. The private backyard serves as a peaceful retreat?an ideal refuge to unwind, relax, and take in the serene surroundings. The home also has a  finished two-car garage currently converted into a private at-home gym, which can be enjoyed in its current form,  A rare opportunity to own a move-in-ready home with iconic views, refined updates, and an exceptional Malaga Cove location.","Spanish Tile, Tile","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing by appointment only. Contact listing agent Mike Mackenbach for showing information. (310)701-0224","True","None","False","True","1613","Assessor","","