g elegance.  Stepping through the solid wood front door, a view unfolds from the intimate foyer to the light-filled courtyard, where a covered outdoor loggia extends the living spaces seamlessly.  Designed for privacy and tranquility, this central gathering space creates the perfect area for entertaining.  Inside, nine-foot-tall steel windows and doors blur the lines between interior and exterior, creating both drama and warmth.  The living room, anchored by French Oak floors and a Town-and-Country fireplace, flows effortlessly into the chef?s kitchen, where a French Lacanche range, Calacatta marble countertops, and a butler?s pantry with a checkerboard marbled floor create the ultimate culinary experience.  The Primary Suite is a private retreat with motorized window treatments, a marble-slab shower, and custom cabinetry.  Additional bedrooms are spacious and inviting with designer finishes and built-in storage.  Created to entertain with ease, the basement boasts a temperature-controlled wine cellar, a home theater with a 120? projector and Dolby surround sound, and a lounge finished in Roman clay.  Outside, a saltwater plaster pool, fire pit, an outdoor kitchen, and French limestone patios were created to enjoy year-round. State-of-the-art amenities include a Savant Smart Home system, Lutron lighting, and distributed audio across multiple music zones, as well as a water filtration system and a natural gas-powered generator, ensuring smooth functionality.  This extraordinary estate blends consummate craftsmanship with modern innovation, offering refined luxury in an idyllic setting.","","Basement, Family Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call/text Jen at 310-200-5900 for appointment. Please do not use ShowingTime. No showings until after broker's open on 3/3.","","","","","