6","Priced to sell! Charming Mid-Century Ranch House on a Rare 13,291 SF Lot in Rolling Hills Estates. Welcome to your own private retreat in the heart of Rolling Hills Estates. Situated on an expansive tree-lined lot, this charming mid-century ranch house blends warmth, character, and incredible indoor-outdoor living spaces in one of the area's most desirable neighborhoods. Inside, the house welcomes you with a spacious, warm and inviting living room featuring a fireplace and original hardwood floors, with an expansive view out to incredible mature trees. The generous family room offers a second fireplace and plenty of space for gathering, play, or movie nights. At the center of the home, a large remodeled kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining area, making everyday living and entertaining effortless. Step outside and you'll discover multiple outdoor spaces designed for year-round enjoyment. Gather with friends in the Mediterranean-style side yard under the olive tree, enjoy al fresco dining on the partially covered back patio, or unwind with a glass of wine on the whimsical treehouse wine deck overlooking the spacious backyard. The property offers endless privacy and room for play, gardening, entertaining, or future expansion. Located in the coveted Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District and just a short walk to Rancho Vista Elementary, a California Distinguished School, this home is ideally suited for young families looking to plant roots in an exceptional community that's just a seven minute drive to the beach, and surrounded by miles of lush walking and equestrian trails. The home is move-in ready, while still offering an exciting possibility for personalization,  particularly in the vintage bathrooms, which invite the next owner to add their own style and build equity over time. Opportunities like this are rare: a charming home on a huge lot, in an award-winning, top-tier school district, and the chance to own one of the most affordable homes in the 