ills Estates showcases an ideal open floor plan with a spacious family room that flows effortlessly to the resort-style backyard. Step outside to your own retreat featuring a sparkling pool, hot tub, and expansive patio areas, perfect for hosting gatherings or enjoying peaceful afternoons surrounded by lush greenery. Multiple outdoor sitting areas, including a tranquil fountain with waterfall, create a serene ambiance rarely found in Rolling Hills Estates homes for sale. Inside, the home is highlighted by beautiful hardwood floors, multiple fireplaces, and a warm, inviting atmosphere throughout. The gourmet kitchen features granite countertops, a center island, and an indoor BBQ?ideal for entertaining year-round. The thoughtful layout offers multiple living and sitting areas, maximizing both space and comfort while capturing peaceful garden views from nearly every room. The spacious primary suite serves as a private retreat, complete with a large walk-in closet and a luxurious bathroom featuring both a soaking tub and separate shower. Additional highlights include ample storage, generously sized secondary bedrooms, and well-appointed bathrooms throughout.  Ample room to add an ADU in the yard, ask for plans.  Located in a highly desirable and tranquil neighborhood, this property offers rare privacy with direct adjacency to the open green space of Chandler Park, including access to a grass area and horse riding ring. Enjoy close proximity to scenic horse trails and walking paths that make Palos Verdes Peninsula real estate so sought-after.  This is a rare chance to own a luxury estate in Rolling Hills Estates that combines space, privacy, and an incredible indoor-outdoor lifestyle, perfect for those seeking the finest in Southern California living.","","Family Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call first - go direct Cat in bathroom - Dont let it out.","True","Private, In Ground","True"