untry traditions, creating a home that feels both refined and inviting. The spacious layout includes four bedrooms?three with private ensuite baths?and a flexible fourth room ideal for guests, an office, or creative space. Five thoughtfully designed bathrooms feature imported tile and quality finishes. A gracious double-door entry opens to a central staircase with artisan detail. The family room?s stone fireplace and the dining room?s limestone hearth anchor the main living areas, while the chef?s kitchen is outfitted with premium appliances, including a brand-new Sub-Zero refrigerator/freezer. Other recent improvements?new roof, two new A/C units, and fresh interior paint?provide comfort and peace of mind. Outside, a Moroccan-inspired veranda overlooks the pool and lush landscaping. Terraced English gardens lead to inviting outdoor seating areas, and a charming red barn with matching chicken coop offers direct access to the neighborhood?s bridle trails. Life in Dapplegray Lanes is defined by miles of riding trails, a community arena, and a tranquil, close-knit atmosphere. 79 Dapplegray Lane is a home with substance, warmth, and enduring appeal.","Composition","Den, Family Room, Formal Entry, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please Text 24 hours in advance for showings. Name, DRE to Chrissy 310-991-5926 Alexia- 310-902-8304","True","","","","3692","Assessor","","CA","Active Under Contract","One, Three Or More ","","","Dapplegray","","79","Lane","","","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","","Hills, Pool","True","","","","1999","90274","4239","RERA2L"
