"","2.0737","SHOWING BY APPOINTMENT ONLY. For questions/showings, please contact Sabrina Pazirandeh 213.247.4090 or  Sam McColgan 213-705-4694. Seller has renderings for an incredible infinity pool. Seller, broker, and broker's agents do not represent or guarantee the accuracy of the square footage, bedroom/bathroom count, lot size or lot lines/dimensions, permitted or unpermitted spaces, school boundary lines or eligibility, or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information. AGENT MUST HAVE A GATE PASS, NO EXCEPTIONS. HOA dues are based on $.20 per $100 of assessed value.","Barbecue, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Water Purifier","True","166 - Rolling Hills","","False","7567015016","Tennis Court(s), Hiking Trails, Horse Trails, Trash, Security","800","","False","6","2","0","0","4","5","","Rolling Hills","#ERR","213-247-4090","","sabrina@thealligoodgroup.com","","Sabrina","","","Pazirandeh","CLW-C144928","","","","","","CLW-X80715","310-595-3888","Douglas Elliman","310-595-3888","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","17","5998000","#ERR","03/20/2026 4:48:13 PM","","","","03/31/2026 6:18:34 AM","","","03/20/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/30/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/20/2026 9:37:32 AM","","03/30/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","17","Sliding Doors","","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","","","","","","Den, Dining Room, Living Room, Patio, Gas, Fire Pit, Great Room","True","Wood","","Central","True","Bar, Beamed Ceilings, High Ceilings, Home Automation System, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting, Wet Bar","True","True","","","","","False","","33.756994","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","False","","","5998000","","","5998000","#ERR","","","Trey@TheAlligoodGroup.com","310-482-2201","Trey","","","Alligood","","CLW-C133085","","","","","CLW-X80715","310-595-3888","Douglas Elliman","310-595-3888","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.345201","232x400","","90332","Back Yard, Front Yard, Horse Property, Landscaped, Lawn, Secluded, Yard","","24 Hour Security, Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Gated Community, Gated with Guard, Guarded","Assessor","","","26666329","","3","9","","","Owner","","","","Guest House","Driveway, Garage - Three Door, Private, Uncovered","True","","","62","","Heated, In Ground, Waterfall","","Close Of Escrow","1178.62","Behind the gates of the prestigious city of Rolling Hills on the Palos Verdes Peninsula, this five-bedroom, six-bathroom estate spans more than two acres of manicured grounds, where mornings begin in stillness and evenings are framed by sweeping, unobstructed views from Redondo Beach across the South Bay and Los Angeles skyline to Long Beach. Designed for both retreat and gathering, the estate offers a resort-style, wellness-driven lifestyle with amenities rarely found together in Rolling Hills, including a pickleball court, fully equipped home gym, pool, spa, hot tub, putting green, outdoor kitchen, and detached guest house. Inside, natural light fills expansive living spaces as oversized windows frame the surrounding landscape. The floor plan flows effortlessly from living and dining areas into the kitchen, creating an environment equally suited for quiet mornings or lively evenings with guests. A custom saltwater aquarium feature introduces a distinctive architectural moment, adding depth and character to the interiors. The chef's kitchen, appointed with premium Thermador appliances, marble countertops, custom cabinetry, and generous storage, connects seamlessly to a temperature-controlled wine room and wet bar, designed for both everyday use and entertaining. The primary suite is positioned as a tranquil retreat with soaring ceilings, expansive proportions, and a spa-inspired bath. An oversized loft provides flexibility for a home office, lounge, or wardrobe expansion, while a patio just beyond the sliding glass doors offers a peaceful outdoor escape. Three additional guest bedrooms in the main residence each feature newly renovated ensuite bathrooms, while a detached guest house near the pool offers comfortable accommodations for visitors, a movie theater, or live-in staff. Outdoors, the grounds take on the feeling of a resort retreat. A waterfall cascades into the pool and spa, while multiple areas for dining and lounging invite time spent under the open sky. The outdoor kitchen, complete with grill, oven, refrigerator, and retractable awning, creates a natural extension of the home for hosting. Recreation and wellness are woven into daily living. The newly updated pickleball court, putting green, and home gym offer an elevated lifestyle centered around activity, balance, and ease. A fully paid Tesla solar system with backup batteries supports energy efficiency and long-term sustainability. Life in Rolling Hills offers a rare balance of space, security, and connection to nature, with 26 miles of equestrian trails, tennis courts, and scenic hiking paths, all just minutes from the beaches of the South Bay, Palos Verdes golf courses, and everyday conveniences. This is a dream where views and lifestyle come together in a way that feels both grounded and elevated.","","Bonus Room, Den, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Home Theatre, Living Room, Loft, Office, Recreation, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Agent or Owner to be Present,Text LA 2,Text LA 3,24-hr Notice,Appointment Only ","False","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","5089","","","CA","Active Under Contract","One","","","Buckboard","","4","Lane","","","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, P