uch of coastal flair. The spacious living room features a beautiful fireplace with a rustic tile surround and original oak floors. The adjacent dining room provides plenty of room to entertain family and friends, and both spaces open to the private backyard?complete with a covered patio and built-in barbecue?perfect for enjoying the spring and summer weather that coastal living offers. The kitchen is open and well laid out, featuring distressed cabinetry, butcher block countertops, and stainless steel appliances, including an upgraded range, French-door refrigerator, and dishwasher. Nearby you?ll find a convenient laundry room and a powder room for guests. Down the hall are three spacious bedrooms. The generous primary suite includes an ensuite bathroom with a large walk-in shower featuring dual shower heads and a double-sink vanity. Crisp white tile with cobalt accents enhances the coastal vibe found throughout the home. Just off the bedroom is a perfect space for a reading nook or home office, which also opens to the backyard. The two additional bedrooms are well-sized with full closets and share a large hall bathroom with a brand-new tub and shower combination, dual sinks, and a dedicated vanity area. Additional features include a two-car garage with a 220 outlet for an electric vehicle, a wide driveway, and RV parking. For those who love outdoor living, this property truly shines. A charming ?crow?s nest? deck offers sweeping ocean views from the backyard. Ideally located near many of the South Bay?s coastal highlights, including Trump National Golf Club, Terranea Resort, Abalone Cove Shoreline Park, scenic walking trails, and endless ocean views, this home captures the very best of coastal living.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Mira Catalina","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service