 Stone","True","72","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","980","Perched on the bluffs with sweeping, unobstructable ocean views, this extraordinary single-story estate offers approximately 5,000 square feet of refined coastal living.  Vaulted ceilings and expansive windows capture natural light and endless blue horizons, while sand-colored stone flooring and stunning marble fireplaces anchor this home with timeless elegance throughout. Designed for effortless flow, the open-concept living and dining spaces transition seamlessly into a chef?s kitchen appointed with a huge center island, marble counters, premium WOLF and Sub-Zero appliances, two separate sink stations and a double oven?perfect for both intimate dinners and grand entertaining. Each of the 4 bedrooms is a private sanctuary complete with warm, wide-plank hardwood flooring, ensuite bathroom with multiple shower heads and generous walk-in closets. The primary suite is a true retreat, offering tranquil ocean vistas, a cozy fireplace, a huge walk-in closet, and a spa-inspired bathroom featuring a soaking tub and an oversized grand shower with 3 shower heads.  Resort-style living continues outdoors where spectacular dining and lounge areas await featuring an exceptionally large stone patio, built-in BBQ station, outdoor fireplace and a pool/spa combo ideal for enjoying coastal sunsets and ocean breezes year-round. Modern conveniences include zoned heating and cooling, integrated surround sound, CAT 6 wiring, custom automated shades, a spacious 3-car garage and 24 hour security - blending privacy, elegance and contemporary sophistication.  Additionally, the ease of access to nearby hiking & biking trails, parks, nature preserves, sports clubs and freeways provides the perfect balance of lifestyle and natural beauty.  This is bluff-top living at its finest?where panoramic ocean views and thoughtful design create a welcome haven from a bustling world.  Such a special place!","Tile","All Bedro