amilies and those seeking effortless, stair-free living. A light-filled open floor plan creates a natural flow between spaces, anchored by a striking marble fireplace framed by a custom slatted feature wall?an architectural focal point that adds warmth and sophistication to the living area. Wide-plank white oak flooring runs throughout, complementing the home?s clean lines and cohesive palette. The dining area overlooks the enclosed backyard, offering a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living; ideal for both daily life and entertaining. At the heart of the home, the kitchen reflects a no-expense-spared approach, combining form and function with elevated style. A striking split-tone design pairs a wall of crisp white cabinetry with a white oak island, topped in dramatic black marble countertops. High-end appliances, including an undercounter microwave drawer, complete a space designed for both beauty and performance. The primary suite serves as a private retreat, featuring a bold black-and-white palette, contemporary lighting and fixtures, and a spa-inspired bathroom with a freestanding soaking tub?a serene space to unwind at the end of the day. Throughout the home, modern black hardware, lighting, and plumbing fixtures provide a cohesive and polished aesthetic. Enhancing the home?s versatility is a detached bonus living space, complete with a bathroom ? ideal as a private home office, guest suite, flex space, or additional bedroom. This rare feature offers exceptional adaptability for today?s evolving lifestyles, from remote work to multigenerational living. Additional highlights include a two-car garage, modern low-maintenance landscaping, an enclosed backyard, and excellent curb appeal that reflects the quality and intention found throughout the home. Designed for how people live today?and how they will live tomorrow?this turnkey property offers a rare combination of architectural style, thoughtful layout, and flexible living in one of Rancho Palos V