ies are endless. The expansive lot includes a giant, flat backyard that offers a unique opportunity to build the outdoor space of your dreams. A beautiful tree-lined trail directly backs up to the bottom of the property and no homes are across the street. These special features add to the peace, privacy and serenity you immediately sense. To top it off, the lot is nestled next to lush open space with mature trees and a gently rolling hill that ?hugs? the property, making an already expansive backyard feel enormous. With hardly any houses in sight, an ocean view and a perfect sea breeze, it feels like your very own coastal hamlet. This is a rare chance to bring your vision and TLC to a property with outstanding upside in a premier location. Set on one of the best streets in Lunada Bay, just moments from scenic coastal trails, Lunada Bay plaza, award-wining schools and the unparalleled cliffside paths of lower Lunada Bay, the location truly speaks for itself. Whether you choose to renovate, expand, or build new, this property presents an exceptional opportunity to create something truly special in one of the South Bay?s most coveted coastal communities.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please text the L/A and go direct.","True","","","","2407","Assessor","","CA","Pending","One","","","Via Rivera","","2817","","","","Trust Conveyance","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1956","90274","",""
