 with distinct seating areas.  Surrounded by lush landscaping and thoughtfully curated details, the space feels private and intimate.  The home offers five spacious bedrooms, including a large primary suite with a gorgeous primary bathroom and walk-in closet.  Set on an expansive, flat lot with manicured grounds and mature trees, this desirable single-level, Lunada Bay home has timeless appeal and sophistication.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","True","None","False","","3200","Estimated","","CA","Pending","One","","","Via Buena","","3001","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5699924528001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6391688162112","","","1970","90274","",""
