 Driveway, Driveway - Brick, Driveway - Combination, Concrete, Driveway Level, Garage - Three Door, Garage Door Opener","True","Brick, Concrete, Patio","True","69","","None","False","","1120.52","Set behind an electric gate on a quiet cul-de-sac, is an exquisite, extensively remodeled 3,211 sq. ft. single-level residence on a secluded 17,503 sq ft lot, offering 4 bedrooms, 4 baths, and a refined indoor-outdoor lifestyle framed by four fountains, multiple patios and a large grass backyard with a herb-vegetable planter. The 2007 high-end remodel also introduced new Marvin doors and windows, raised ceilings, central A/C and heating, and walnut hardwood floors. At the heart of the home, a reimagined open-concept kitchen with antique white travertine floors, Calacatta honed marble counters, custom cabinetry, and four skylights flows to a large family room with a grand fireplace and French doors to an expansive entertaining patio. Culinary features include a Wolfe 48-inch range with griddle, Thermador refrigerator/freezer with custom panels, 3 dishwasher, warming and microwave drawers, wine fridge, wet bar with sink, and built-in desk. Outdoors, enjoy a spacious entertainment area with fireplace and ocean and some coastline view, plus a built-in bar with granite top, Wolfe BBQ, refrigerator, and smart storage with pullout shelving and custom cushion storage. The primary suite offers two closets with built-ins and a remodeled bath with custom cabinets, marble counters, spa tub, and separate shower, while the large living room and dining room extend the experience with fireplaces, built-ins, and French doors to lushly landscaped patios. A 3-car garage with storage adds practical flexibility, supported by a 75-gallon water heater with a recirculating pump for everyday convenience. Designed for effortless living and elevated entertaining, this one-level home pairs a refined 2007 renovation with a rare blend of privacy, views, and inviting gathering spaces. From everyday comfort to weekend hosting, every detail is focused on convenience, flexibility, and the kind of ease luxury homeowners value most.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palo Verde Unified","","Peninsula","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Subject to cancellation of existing escrow. Buyer had bad news on her health at Cedars this morning so needs to deal with her health.  appointment only. Text Patricia @ 310-936-5875 to schedule","True","None","False","True","3211","Assessor","","CA","Pending","One","","","Via Mateo","","1419","","","Mediterranean","Conventional","","28957","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Coastline, Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","https://california-realty-sites.seehouseat.com/2376262?idx=1","","French/Mullioned, Plantation Shutters, Skylight(s)","1974","90274","",""
