"None","0.2435","To see seller disclosures follow this link: https://app.disclosures.io/link/4149-Va-Solano-cy4rcdf9","Dishwasher, Gas Range","True","164 - Valmonte","Unknown","True","7537016002","","0","","False","3","","","1","2","4","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","11","3298000","#ERR","03/12/2026 3:10:19 PM","","","03/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/31/2026 6:18:34 AM","","","02/07/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","03/12/2026 3:17:09 PM","","03/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","11","","True","Area, Breakfast Counter / Bar","","","","","","","Family Room, Living Room","True","Wood","True","Central","True","High Ceilings, Open Floorplan","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.80261","Individual Room","True","False","","","3298000","","","3298000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.360844","","2","10605","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft","Biking , Golf, Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB26029837","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","","","29","","None","False","Close Plus 2 Days","1166.61","Tucked along one of Valmonte?s most desirable streets, this home offers a rare blend of charm, privacy and beautiful city light views in a setting that feels both peaceful and connected to nature. Set back from the street behind lush landscaping, the home immediately welcomes with warmth and character, while its location backing to the trail creates a wonderfully private backdrop with no neighbors behind. Inside, the remodeled interior is filled with natural light and timeless style. Warm wood floors run throughout the main living spaces, creating a foundation for everyday living and entertaining alike. The kitchen is both functional and beautifully designed, featuring a quartz-topped peninsula with a wood base and open shelving, a farmhouse sink, crisp white cabinetry, pantry storage with a mix of closed cabinets and display shelving, and a garden window perfectly positioned to take in the city light views. A skylight brightens the space, while a Zellige tile backsplash and a striking accent tile wall behind the industrial-style stainless steel stove add texture and personality. The living room is rich with charm thanks to its fireplace and paned windows that frame the treetops outside. Upstairs, two secondary bedrooms share a remodeled bath finished with marble subway tile, plaster walls, a newer wood vanity and a skylight above the shower. The primary suite is a retreat, complete with a full wall of built-in closets, corner windows that capture the mature trees outside, and a beautifully remodeled bath with dual floating vanities, a soaking tub, velvet-finish stone tile walls and an oversized glass-enclosed shower. The lower level adds even more flexibility, centered around a spacious family room with a second fireplace and a bar area with seating for easy entertaining. French doors open directly to the backyard, where indoor-outdoor living truly shines. A large deck with built-in seating and room for a generous dining table overlooks the private yard, while a pergola-covered in-ground spa creates a tucked-away escape. The lower yard offers an additional gathering area, ideal for a fire pit and lounge seating beneath the shade of mature trees. Also on this level is a private bedroom with an adjoining bonus room, perfect for a home office, gym or creative space, along with a full bathroom nearby. With its tasteful updates, multiple living spaces, enchanting outdoor areas and sought-after Valmonte location, this is a home that feels special at every turn.","Tile","F