er. The home features 4 spacious bedrooms & 3 bathrooms, with an ideal one-level layout designed for easy living. The living room, dining room, family room, & primary suite all capture stunning views?perfect for enjoying incredible sunrises, golden hour over the city, and even snow-capped mountains in the winter. In the evenings, enjoy fireworks displays from San Pedro, Long Beach, & beyond, and on especially clear nights, even the Disneyland fireworks in the distance. Located on the sunny, warm side of the hill, the home is tucked into the hillside and naturally protected from some weather-related concerns. Outdoor living is exceptional, highlighted by a welcoming front patio designed as a true outdoor living room?complete with a BBQ, fireplace, wet bar, & beautiful flowering plants. It?s the perfect setting for year-round dining, entertaining, and gatherings with friends & family. Inside, the home features beautiful tile flooring with accent medallions throughout the main living areas & primary suite, with newer carpet in the three additional bedrooms. The primary bedroom offers three closets and a spacious ensuite bath with double sinks, a walk-in shower, & a relaxing spa tub. The charming kitchen features a gas stove, double ovens, an elegant range hood, & a sleek black refrigerator. A separate laundry room provides abundant cabinetry and generous counter space. Additional highlights include a large 3-car garage, a beautifully paver-lined driveway, abundant storage throughout, & a backyard filled with charm. The outdoor space features a quaint lawn, a rose garden, multiple fruit trees, a storage shed, exterior shelving for gardening supplies, & a welcoming front yard. Miraleste Hills is beloved for its scenic surroundings & access to excellent local hiking trails, shopping, medical services, & many dining options, as well as the renowned Terenea Resort, while also offering convenient freeway access for commuting or exploring the greater LA area. This special property combines spectacular views, thoughtful outdoor living spaces, & a warm sense of home in one of Rancho Palos Verdes? most desirable neighborhoods.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","please text LA with your information and date and time of showing. A confirmation and a CBS code will be given.","True","None","False","True","2634","Assessor","","CA","Pending","One","","","Crownview","","2960","Drive","","","Cash, Conventional","","28321","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Bay, Bridge(s), Canyon, City Lights, Coastline, Harbor, Hills, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Vincent Thomas Bridge, Water","True","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=184024IDX","","","1972","90275","",""
