odernist work including the celebrated California Bicentennial House. This single-level 3-bedroom, 2-bath Santa Fe style Mid-Century Modern captures ocean and Catalina Island views from the living room and primary bedroom. The light-filled living room has a classic mid-century fireplace, beamed ceilings, and seamless indoor?outdoor flow. The kitchen and bathrooms are original and awaiting your upgrades. Originally built as a two bedroom, the den off of the dining room can become a third bedroom.  The patio offers exceptional privacy with ocean and Catalina Island views. Located in the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, this home is close to Golden Cove shopping and restaurants, Terranea Resort, Trump National Golf Course and hiking in the Forrestal Nature Reserve. Experience coastal living at its finest!","","Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Supra is located on the hose bib by the garage door. Text Jack Fleming at 310-748-5206 for cbs code. DO NOT LOCK DEAD BOLT!!","","None","False","True","1999","Public Records","","CA","Pending","One","","","Gulfcrest","","3426","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","29057","","Single Family Residence","","Underground Utilities","Catalina, Hills, Neighborhood, Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Plantation Shutters, Screens, Skylight(s)","1969","90275","",""
