ular panoramic ocean views. The spacious living room impresses with soaring ceilings, a custom stone fireplace, wide-plank hardwood floors, and sleek, modern finishes ? all enhancing the home's inviting, seamless indoor-outdoor flow. At the heart of the home, the custom chef?s kitchen boasts high-end appliances, quartz countertops, stylish cabinetry, and a large center island, ideal for gathering, entertaining, and sharing with family and friends. The serene primary suite serves as a luxurious retreat, complete with a spa-inspired bathroom featuring a standalone soaking tub, a walk-in shower adorned with custom tilework, dual vanities, and a spacious walk-in closet. The additional bathroom is equally refined, offering designer fixtures, standalone tub, walk-in shower, and double sinks. Step outside to your private, enclosed backyard ? a perfect oasis for relaxation and recreation. Enjoy the panoramic view patio, a lower-level concrete pad ideal for sports and outdoor activities, and the beauty of mature fruit trees that enhance the serene setting. Perfectly positioned near the extensive Palos Verdes trail system, you?ll enjoy access to miles of scenic hiking paths through protected nature preserves, all while savoring sweeping coastal views. This prime location also places you close to the luxurious Terranea Resort, and Golden Cove Shopping Center (home to Trader Joe?s, Starbucks, and dining), and the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula school district. Palos Verdes offers an unparalleled lifestyle with beautiful parks, four picturesque golf courses with ocean and wooded views, and countless opportunities to enjoy the outdoors. 8 Clipper Road invites you to live the coastal dream ? where natural beauty, refined design, and an active lifestyle meet.","","Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Call first - Go direct","True","None","False","True","2791","Assessor","","CA","Pending","O