ws the horizon into the main living spaces and opens to an expansive, flat backyard. The effect is easy and relaxed, with the indoor and outdoor experience blending naturally as light moves through the home throughout the day. At the center of the home, the kitchen is anchored by a sculptural Dolomite stone island, balanced by clean lined cabinetry, a Thermador six burner range, wine fridge, and a generous butler?s pantry. The layout opens seamlessly to the living and dining areas, creating one expansive gathering space with uninterrupted sightlines toward the ocean. Five bedrooms provide flexibility for a range of living arrangements. One bedroom and full bath are positioned privately on the opposite side of the home, well suited for guests, extended family, or a quiet work from home space. Four additional bedrooms extend down the main hallway, including two that capture west facing ocean views. The primary suite offers a calm retreat with sliding doors that open to the backyard and sunset views beyond, while the ensuite bath features dual sinks and a spacious walk in shower. The bathrooms throughout the home have been tastefully updated to match the home?s fresh coastal palette. Outside, the backyard offers a rare stretch of flat lawn and patio space, ideal for outdoor dining, gatherings with friends, or simply taking in the wide open view of the Pacific. Located in the heart of the Palos Verdes Peninsula, residents enjoy close proximity to coastal parks, scenic hiking and riding trails, golf courses, and everyday conveniences. Vista Grande Elementary, Fred Hesse Community Park, and the Palos Verdes Promenade are all just minutes away.","","Kitchen, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Please use ShowingTime to schedule a showing. Reach out to showings@nickphillipsproperties.com for any questions. For Offers: Submit to offers@nickphillipsproperties