nd half a flight down are the family room, bedroom, bathroom, and laundry area. The updated kitchen Has freshly painted cabinets with new hardware, new stainless steel appliances including French door refrigerator, cooktop with downdraft, dishwasher, built-in microwave, sink, faucet, garbage disposal, newer double oven, LED lighting, island seating, and a breakfast nook with sliding door to a charming patio overlooking the lush backyard and fruit trees.  The expansive living room boasts cathedral ceilings, PV stone fireplace, slider to the alfresco patio, and a dramatic floor-to-ceiling wall of glass framing the backyard.  The open dining room is ideally located and has a new chandelier. The huge family room downstairs offers a large glass slider to the patio and grassy yard, a white brick fireplace with bench/hearth, and recessed LED lighting, with an adjacent bedroom, remodeled bathroom, and laundry area.  Upstairs, the primary suite features a generous bedroom with bay window overlooking trees and yard, plus a tastefully remodeled bathroom with white granite countertops and dual sinks; two additional light-filled bedrooms are perfect for kids or a home office.  The hallway bathroom is also remodeled with white granite and tile. Located on a hilltop just minutes from Peninsula Center, Promenade Mall, Ralph?s on Hawthorne, Golden Cove Shopping Center, and scenic coastal spots. This home also enjoys access to award-winning schools including Soleado Elementary, Ridge Crest Middle (less than ? mile), and Peninsula High. There are multiple grocery options only a few minutes away.  Additional highlights include a 2-car garage with direct access, auto roll-up door, 220V for easy EV charging setup, and new steel side door.  Recent upgrades feature a new Presidential lifetime roof, new interior paint, gorgeous glued-down LVP flooring with lifetime warranty, new air conditioning unit, new interior wrought iron railing, all-new LED lighting, and new electrical switches and outlets with screwless cover plates.","Shingle","Entry, Family Room, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","BROKER'S OPEN Tuesday 3/3 11am-2pm OPEN HOUSE SAT & SUN March 7th & 8th 3-5pm  Please call Norm on cell phone at 310-809-8815 to setup a showing appointment. If no answer, please text your name, cell #, time, & date you want to show. Thank You!","True","None","False","True","2374","Assessor","","CA","Pending","Multi/Split ","","","Scotwood Dr.","","5702","","","","Conventional","","27789","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://tour.caimagemaker.com/l/?id=183904IDX","","Double Pane Windows","1963","90275","",""
