 Front, Garage - Single Door","True","Concrete, Patio Open","True","46","","None","False","","1074.46","View! View!! View!!! Perched in the heart of Palos Verdes, this beautifully remodeled home showcases unobstructed, panoramic ocean view stretching from Catalina Island to Malibu, including a view of the iconic Queen?s Necklace. Enjoy breathtaking sunsets and twinkling coastline lights from both the interior and the private backyard, views that are truly rare and captivating. Meticulously renovated in 2021 and over the years, this turn-key residence boasts a new kitchen, 3 bathrooms, hardwood French Oak floor, double pane windows/sliding doors, modern barn doors, interior paint, lightings, a reimagined backyard and much more. These improvements spare the next owner the time and effort of remodeling, allowing immediate enjoyment of the home. A landscaped front lawn and inviting walkway lead to a high-ceiling foyer, opening to a living room with a cozy fireplace and an intentionally raised cathedral ceiling that enhances the sense of openness. The living room flows seamlessly into the dining room that connects to the remodeled kitchen, creating an ideal layout for both daily living and entertaining. The kitchen is thoughtfully designed with quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, and a large dining counter positioned to take in the ocean view. Nearby is a spacious family room, perfect for gatherings, relaxation, and enjoying the view, complete with a second fireplace and direct access to the backyard. A former fourth bedroom was incorporated to expand the family room and can easily be converted back into a bedroom or home office. A full bathroom on this level adds flexibility and convenience. ON THE UPPER LEVEL, the primary suite showcases large garden windows that capture the vista, a wall of closet, and a beautifully remodeled bathroom. Two additional bedrooms, one of which also enjoys an ocean view, share a hallway bath. All bathrooms are finished with quartz countertops, shaker cabinetry, and rain shower heads. Designed for effortless outdoor living, the private backyard offers an open patio, gazebo with seating area, fire pit, and jacuzzi, all set against the stunning ocean backdrop. Even the garage has been upgraded with an EV charger, built-in storage cabinets, wall organizers, and an epoxy floor. Ideally located near award-winning Palos Verdes schools, shops & restaurants, this move-in-ready home delivers panoramic views, modern comfort, and exceptional coastal setting. A rare opportunity not to be missed!","","Converted Bedroom, Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Ridgecrest","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","Open houses this weekend on Sat and Sun, 3/28 and 3/29, at 1-4 pm. The property is still occupied by Seller. Overnight notice is preferred. During the weekdays, Seller prefer to have showings before 3 pm. Please text your business card to co-listing agent, Betty, at 310-293-3319, to arrange for showing. PLEASE DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME.","","","","","2122","Assessor","","CA","Pending","Two","","","Seamount DR","","28317","","","","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan","","28450","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/490910","","Double Pane Windows, Drapes, Garden Window(s), Screens","1971","90275","",""
