ed in a serene and secluded cul-de-sac, this residence boasts spectacular views, providing you with the opportunity to relish in the beauty of dazzling city lights. Spanning a spacious lot of 16,683 square feet, this property offers a multitude of possibilities. Upon entering the home, you are greeted by an impressive foyer featuring high ceilings. Adjacent to the foyer, there is a generous living room perfect for both entertaining guests and daily activities. Next to the living room is a first-floor bedroom and a full bathroom with a shower, perfect for a mother-in-law suite or guest accommodation. As you ascend to the dining room, a picturesque glass slider offers stunning views of the city lights. The kitchen is well-equipped, featuring a dishwasher, oven, cooktop, and refrigerator. This space also includes a charming breakfast nook, along with plenty of counter space and storage. The cozy family room boasts a gas fireplace and overlooks the lush backyard greenery and landscaping. The master suite is wonderfully spacious, complete with a walk-in closet and an en-suite bathroom featuring a Toto toilet and dual vanities. On this floor, you'll also find two additional bedrooms and an a office (or potential 5th Bedroom), along with a Full Bathroom in the hallway. The lower yard features a covered patio and expansive flat grassy area, while the upper yard includes a deck for enjoying sweeping city and downtown views. The home is upgraded with a Central Heat & A/C system. Fully-paid solar panels on the roof keeps utility costs remarkably low, and includes a Generac Generator. 2-Car Garage with Direct Access, and Full Laundry Room for added convenience. This prime location is conveniently situated just a short distance from Chadwick Academy, Soleado Elementary, Peninsula High School, and the Peninsula Shopping Center!","Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified"