un through bright living spaces with high ceilings, skylights and a layout that keeps everyone connected. The updated kitchen features new quartz counters and a subway tile backsplash, along with plenty of prep space, stainless appliances and instant hot water. The dining area looks straight out to the pool, while the family room enjoys leafy views through large windows and plantation shutters. Two spacious bedrooms share a spa-style bath with a jetted tub and stone-tile shower. The third bedroom, a private suite, is filled with natural light. Practical improvements include remote skylights, surround sound, a tankless water heater, new HVAC (including A/C) and a long-lasting DaVinci roof. And the location is hard to beat: top-rated Silver Spur Elementary is mere steps away in this wonderful family neighborhood, with Peninsula High just minutes down the road.","Slate","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","","","","","","","","","False","Full Service","MARCH 18-22, not able to show due to pre-arrangement with tenants. ** Tenant-occupied, with dogs. 24 hrs. notice preferred ** Will be delivered VACANT. (Tenants bought.) ** For a visit, please TEXT to Dave @ (310) 386-2952. Listing agent accompanies.","True","Private","True","","1404","Assessor","","CA","Pending","One","","","Ironwood","","5352","Street","","Ranch","Conventional","","21169","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected","Trees/Woods","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=Mui1huBY9GL&brand=0","","","1956","90275","1758","RPRS8000*"
