"","0.1557","The property will be vacant by August 1st. Tenants are in the process of relocating. Escrow shall close after tenant vacates or the buyer may close sooner and assume the tenant until they vacate. Call or text Edward Barrios at 310-200-1507 for any questions. All offers shall be submitted with verification of funds, letter of approval or pre-approval from lender with direct contact to lender. A preliminary seller disclosure package will be provided upon request. Email all offers to Edward Barrios, edward.barrios@vistasir.com. Seller to select title and escrow services. All showings will be by Appointment Only, please call me to confirm showings this weekend: - July 5th - Saturday, 10AM-11:30AM - July 6th - Sunday, 9AM - 10AM","Dishwasher, Electric Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","None","False","7541033022","","0","","False","2","","","","2","3","1376","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Direct Ph","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","22","1620000","#ERR","06/17/2025 12:03:20 AM","","06/30/2025 6:12:11 PM","07/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/12/2025 10:08:34 AM","","","06/17/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/03/2025 10:39:07 AM","08/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","","South","22","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","Stucco","Stucco Wall, Wood, Wrought Iron","True","","Conventional","Dining Room, Family Room, Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","Brick Walls, Tile Counters","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.782634","In Garage","True","False","","","1675000","","","1749000","#ERR","310-541-8271","6221","edward.barrios@vistasir.com","","Edward","","","Barrios","","VBARREDW","","","","","v8491","310-375-9616","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","310-375-0583","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.40917","","23","6781","0-1 Unit/Acre","Preserve/Public Land, Suburban","","Assessor","","","PV25135296","","1","1","","1","Tenant","Edward Barrios","","3102001507","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Paved","True","Brick, Concrete, Patio, Patio Open","True","57","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1023.37","Tucked away on the elevated curve of Espinosa Circle, this inviting 3-bedroom, 2-bath home offers serenity and comfort in the vibrant and lively Lunada Bay neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates. Set on a generous 6,781 square foot lot, this 1,583 square foot residence sits above the street, providing a peaceful retreat while remaining close to the best of the community. A welcoming front courtyard sets the stage to the entry that leads into the heart of the home, where rich wood-style flooring, recessed lighting, and an impressive fireplace add warmth and character to the living room. Both the living room and dining area open directly to the backyard, creating a seamless flow for indoor-outdoor living and filling the space with natural light. The bright and spacious kitchen features solid wood cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, timeless tile work, and recessed lighting, ready to enjoy or personalize to suit your taste. The dining area sits as the centerpoint of the home, offering easy connection to the kitchen, living room, and outdoor living spaces. The primary bedroom suite offers a restful escape with its own en-suite bathroom, while two additional bedrooms provide comfortable accommodations with thoughtful details and ample storage. From the serene front courtyard, an ideal spot for morning coffee in the cool seaside air, a quiet read, or greeting neighbors passing by, to the backyard?s grassy lawn with two patio areas, the outdoor spaces provide varied settings for relaxation, entertaining, and everyday enjoyment. Whether savoring quiet mornings, hosting weekend gatherings, or enjoying evenings under the stars, these thoughtfully designed areas extend the home's comfort beyond its interior. Situated close to excellent Palos Verdes schools, Lunada Bay Plaza with its shopping and community events, and just a short distance from the bluffs overlooking the Pacific Ocean. Palos Verdes is celebrated for its wonderful weather, peaceful community, lush landscapes, and extensive nature trails. With nearby beaches and a strong connection to nature, this location offers an exceptional lifestyle combining tranquility and beauty. This is more than just a house, it?s a wonderful place to call home in one of Palos Verdes? most sought-after neighborhoods.","Composition","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","XZACH","William","Messori","nonmember","NONMEMBERMRML","","","William David Messori","1620000","False","Full Service","The property is tenant occupied. Please do not disturb the occupants.  This weekend available showing times:  - July 5th - Saturday, 10AM-11:30AM - July 6th - Sunday, 9AM - 10AM","","None","False","","1583","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Espinosa","","1709","Circle","","Ranch","Contract","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood","True","","","","1956","90274","1980","PVR1YY"
