for the perfect al fresco gathering spot. Once inside, revel in the special details of this circa 1941 gem: custom built-ins, wood burning fireplace, leaded glass, polished wood floors. With a pleasing sense of openness, the main level flows from the living room through to the spacious dining and breakfast areas, and then on to the heart of this home, the fully renovated kitchen with its vaulted beam ceiling and skylights. An expanse of windows frame the vistas of horizon, ocean, sunset and sky, while the large viewing balcony and deck extends all of this wonderful indoor space to the outdoors. From this perch, watch the fun taking place on your very own sports court or hang out on the sunny rear patio below. Life at 2025 PV Dr West is also enhanced by its proximity to the many acres of natural, wide open PVE parkland, walking trails, and magnificent ocean bluffs and coves. Best of all, it is just minutes away to 3 award winning schools (Lunada Bay Elementary, PV Intermediate, PV High), a quick stroll across the road to the Little League playing fields, and just down the block to Lunada Bay Plaza with its picturesque fountain, shops, services, and concerts in the park.","","Den, Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Patti","Howell","SBHOWEPAT","s5316","2.5","%","Bayside","1700000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Agent at  310-430-3883 for CBS code and with your desired showing date & time.","True","None","False","","2156","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","W","Palos Verdes","","2025","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available","Ocean","True","","","Bay Window(s), Blinds, Plantation Shutters, Skylight(s)","1941","90274","2703","PVR1*"
