ith a gas-log fireplace and a partial ocean view includes a dining area and hardwood floors. The kitchen is roomy with an eating area overlooking the fully enclosed back yard and opens to a family room with slider doors to a large patio. The master bedroom is in the back of the house with it's own bath and double closets, one of the three bedrooms also has double closest. The backyard is fenced and gated and private on a 8,203 square foot lot. It will be a wonderful family home with your remodel touches. So go by and view the property, today!","","Family Room, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Kurt","Allen","SALLEKUR","SB1379380","2.5","%","Compass","1775000","False","Full Service","To Show text Duston the listing broker @ 310-753-1748.  Please do not use Showingtime.","True","None","False","True","1952","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Rivera","","2536","","","","1031 Exchange","","7141","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1957","90274","2730","PVR1YY"
