he top-rated elementary, intermediate and high schools. The property features an open floor plan and  is bathed in natural light, highlighting the gleaming wood floors and clean architectural lines. The heart of the home features a floor-to-ceiling fireplace that stylishly separates the living and family rooms.  The expansive backyard has a sparkling pool and is ideal for entertaining and al fresco dining. The updated kitchen boasts granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and plenty of workspace for culinary creativity.  The detached garage was converted to a large (approx. 450 sq ft) recreation room and features new carpeting and paint. All of this is just a short stroll to the Lunada Bay Plaza, where you?ll find charming shops and restaurants. Walk a few more minutes and you?ll reach the dramatic bluffs of Paseo Del Mar, the perfect spot to take in unforgettable sunsets, surfers and sailboats. Don?t miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of Mid-Century modern elegance in one of the Peninsula?s most cherished neighborhoods.","","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sep","Ebrahimi","pvebrasep","V7804","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","1795000","False","Full Service","Property is vacant and easy to show. First Broker's Open will be on 6/3/25 from 11am to 1:30pm. First Public Open house will be on Sat/Sun (6/7 and 6/8) from 1 to 4pm. Please remember to lock all the doors and windows and make sure that the side gate is secured. Thank you for showing it.","True","None","False","","2220","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","W","Palos Verdes","","2552","Drive","","Mid Century Modern","Contract, Conventional","","16945","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=85e52f7XADZ&brand=0","","","1956","90274","2711","PVR1YY"
