, with Lunada Bay Elementary, Palos Verdes Intermediate, and Palos Verdes High School all just a short stroll away. This prime setting is also a quick walk to the charming Lunada Bay Plaza, where you'll find local shops and restaurants. Classic design and comfortable living: The home features a traditional and inviting design, offering a cozy yet spacious feel. The living room provides a comfortable gathering space, while an updated kitchen is adjacent to the family room and ready for meals and entertaining. Both living areas feature fireplaces and hardwood floors to add to the charm. Step outside to discover a serene backyard, perfect for relaxation or play. Mature trees and lush landscaping provide privacy and a peaceful retreat for enjoying the mild coastal weather..and taking in sunset views over the ocean!!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Richard","Haynes","SBHAYNRIC2","SB1292440","","","Haynes Real Estate","1800000","False","Full Service","Call agent to show. Charlie- 310.377.4932 2 Car garage is uses as a workout room. Showings begin at open house, noon on Saturday, November 15th.","True","None","False","","1428","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Carrillo","","2541","","","Craftsman","Cash to New Loan","","7141","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Water","True","","","","1958","90274","",""
