 this charming. Palos Verdes Intermediate School is .3M away and Palos Verdes High School is .5M away. It is close to hiking, biking, restaurants and shops. Hurry, this one won't last!","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","Palos Verdes","","Heidi","Agid-Mackenbach","VAGIDHEI","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1815000","False","Full Service","PLEASE READ ALL INSTRUCTIONS! Access 9:00am-6:00pm daily with a 1 hour notice via text to owners. Two large dogs. MUST RECEIVE SHOWING CONFIRMATION FROM SELLERS SO THEY CAN TAKE THE DOGS OUT!  Text Ann first at 310-433-2245.  If no response text Jeff at 310-486-2666. If no response text agent 310-994-4848, Go Direct from 12:00pm April 4, 2025 through April 8, 2025. Owners and dogs will not be at the house.","True","None","False","True","1631","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Coronel","","1105","","","Ranch, Traditional","Cash, Conventional, Trust Deed","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, Neighborhood, Trees/Woods","True","","","Double Pane Windows, French/Mullioned, Insulated Windows, Screens, Wood Frames","1955","90274","1977","PVR1YY"
