h","True","44","","None","False","","833.71","Welcome to 2541 Palos Verdes Drive West, this traditional home is perfectly situated on a great lot in lower Lunada Bay. This home features an enchanting courtyard with a fountain and built-in BBQ which leads you to the front door. As you enter, you are impressed with an open and bright living room with fireplace, hardwood floors, crown moldings throughout, and an elegant dining room, walking into the kitchen. The kitchen is spacious and has plenty of cabinetry and counter space for preparing those gourmet meals. Downstairs you find two bedrooms one of which is set up as an office with built-in bookshelves and French doors to the cute grassy backyard and one bathroom to share. Upstairs is the spacious primary suite and the fourth bedroom with the bathroom in the hallway. Outdoor spaces abound including a large, covered patio, garden areas, and privacy galore! The circular driveway and the great location within walking distance of shops and restaurants, and highly ranked PV schools (K-12), makes this property very desirable. This is where friends and family gatherings are a way of life. Enjoy afternoon walks that provide breathtaking views and magnificent sunsets. If you love nature, nature is practically in your backyard. If you just want to relax and breathe in the beauty of Palos Verdes Estates, this is the home for you. Don't miss out on this extremely well-priced property!","Composition, Shingle","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Rupesh","Singh","sbsingrup","SB1364840","","","South Bay Agents, Inc.","1830000","False","Full Service","DO NOT GO DIRECT!!!  Call/Text Anthony Todora 310-738 6775 for appointments, wait for confirmation before you access the property. Supra Lockbox on the front gate. Thank you for showing! DO NOT USE SHOWING TIME!!!","True","None","False","True","2195","Assessor","","CA"