set Views from this SINGLE LEVEL Home. The living room features a wall of windows to take in the beautiful views from outside. A fireplace connects it with the family room and adjoins the dining area & spacious kitchen with lots of cabinet space. There are 2 bedroom ensuites: the primary bedroom en-suite has a walk-in closet while the 2nd en-suite has a door to the backyard. The 3rd bedroom has a bay window that overlooks the view, while the 4th bedroom is of good size. There is a deck in front from which to enjoy the ocean and sunset views or the football, soccer or lacrosse games at PV High. A lovely terraced backyard has a large grassy area for play or outdoor living. This house is a trust sale, and the property is priced accordingly to be sold ""As Is"" in its present condition. Capture the extraordinary opportunity to update this remarkable property to your exact preferences and create your dream home in one of the most desirable communities in Palos Verdes. Indulge in luxury living, embrace the views, and elevate your lifestyle with this home. The time is now to make this extraordinary property your very own.","","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","w72577","XIN SU","WANG","WS83594","9657","2.5","%","HARVEST REALTY DEVELOPMENT","1840000","False","Full Service","No showing until weekend open houses, 6/1 and 6/2, at 1-4 pm.  After that, supra lockbox shall be installed for you to show it at any time. Please make sure that you lock up all doors before leaving.","","","","","2118","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Pacheco","","2112","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/465521","","Bay Window(s), Blinds","1959","90274","2639","PVR1YY"
