ard that is perfect for entertaining ? from an 8 person spa tub on deck, to the concrete entertaining area under the shade of loquat trees to the gazebo furnished with lighting, ceiling fan and bathroom! Beautiful sunshine in the morning floods through the wall of windows to living room and sunsets that take your breath away in the evening. In the morning, drink your coffee on the balcony while gazing at the ocean. Pecan wood flooring, remodeled kitchen with granite counters/island and built-in appliances, electric sunshades, retractable awning for afternoon sun, recessed lights,2 fireplaces, dining room with wall of built-in cabinets (some with pull out shelves, cork lined doors), additional family room downstairs. Giant gazebo in backyard with additional bathroom, built-in TV, electric lighting, ceiling fan and screens so it?s perfect for a gym, mancave, game room, or even guest quarters! Large play yard with sand, swings, and a clubhouse. Built-in basketball net next to a quiet retreat area. New 8 person spa tub on deck with drop down flat screen TV built-in to have a cocktail and watch movies! Outdoor shower with warm water. Outdoor oasis seating area perfect for couch and firepit seating with built-in speakers and lighting. From the upstairs balcony, you can see the entire backyard with towering palm trees. Enjoy your dinner each night as the sun sets either in the dining room or on this amazing new wood deck that overlooks the backyard. Outdoor lighting and sprinklers feed lush fruit trees: 4 giant loquat, 4 lemon, orange, olive, pomegranate, almond, fig, tangerine, banana, and nectarine. The backyard is completely fenced and surrounded by privacy trees. Quiet A/C unit for those few hot days. Freshly painted. Walking trails are everywhere. Highly rated PV schools within walking distance. Don?t miss this unique opportunity!","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office, Retreat, Workshop","","Palo