"No Interior Steps","0.1959","OFFER DEADLINE 4/3/24 5pm. Home is in need of REPAIRS and is being sold in its "" AS-IS"" conditions with NO REPAIRS and NO CREDITS. If I had to guess few items that may be in need of repairs: Roof I was told has areas of damage and may need a new roof, areas of skylights may need repairs, in master bedroom ceiling and adjacent wall at entry show signs of water intrusion and one can detect a scent possibly from moisture. The Spa in the yard had some tree roots in one blower so it may or may not be in working condition. Buyer and Buyers Agents are advised to do their OWN thorough inspections. IMPORTANT: NO PRE-INSPECTIONS were done prior to listing.  All info is deemed to be reliable but broker and listing agent or any agents present at open house do not guarantee the accuracy of the info provided, including but not limited to square footage, lot size, permitted or un-permitted spaces, and/or bedroom/bathroom count or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the Seller, broker, agents, contractor or any information obtained from Public Records or other sources. . Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of this information through personal inspection, building permits and/or with appropriate professionals (i.e. attorney, appraiser, architect, contractor, etc.).Buyer and Buyers Agents are responsible to check permits and survey data to verify the accuracy and additional details. Art Jury Rules apply for homes in PVE.","Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Refrigerator, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7542020002","","0","","False","2","","","1","1","3","2317","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","5","1900000","#ERR","03/29/2024 2:53:40 PM","","","04/03/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/29/2024 1:53:08 PM","04/10/2024 