nd is complemented with antiqued cabinets and a beautiful copper sink. The kitchen and dining area is warmed by a double-sided fireplace and can also be enjoyed from the spacious living room. The French doors from the living room lead to the tranquil yard. The backyard has a lighted sports court, jacuzzi, fire pit, and lots of lush greenery. A brick patio with pergola completes the setting for many enjoyable hours. The home is in a highly desirable area offering endless opportunities for outdoor enjoyment with just a short stroll to the bluffs,  scenic hiking  trails nearby and walking paths perfect to take a stroll after dinner down to the picturesque cliffs and gaze at the stunning sunsets day after day.  The home is situated in a great neighborhood with easy access to local amenities, parks as well as is within walking distance to nationally-ranked, award-winning Palos Verdes High School, Top-Ranking Lunada Bay Elementary and Palos Verdes Intermediate School. This location truly caters to every aspect of coastal living. This 1958 charmer has been updated through the years with some very nice upgrades and is in need of some repairs. This lovely home is ready to be transformed so bring your contractor and vision? there are endless opportunities to create your oasis for enjoyment generations to come. Don't let this chance slip by to cultivate your ideal lifestyle in this picture-perfect setting. Seize the opportunity to make this home your own!","See Remarks, Wood","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Library, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Marie","Morgenstern","Pvmorgmar","v8444","2.5","%","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","1900000","False","Full Service","Vacant/ Please feel free to GO DIRECT. If you would just take a moment to please text Listing agent Marie Morgenstern at 310-890-7808 your business card, date and time of showing for CBS CODE. Supra