re greeted by the allure of this beautifully maintained property. Upon entering, the warm embrace of natural light welcomes you, walking through French doors that open seamlessly to reveal a backyard oasis. With views extending from the family room to the kitchen, you'll find yourself drawn to the sparkling pool and bubbling jacuzzi, where relaxation awaits amidst lush, meticulously landscaped surroundings. Inside, the home boasts a seamless blend of modern amenities and timeless charm. Central heating and air ensure year-round comfort, while dual fireplaces offer a cozy ambiance on cooler evenings. The convenience of a dedicated laundry room adds to the effortless flow of daily life, complemented by an office space ideal for remote work or creative pursuits. Whether hosting gatherings or enjoying quiet moments with loved ones, the spacious living and family rooms provide ample space to unwind and entertain. Upgraded bathrooms and bedrooms offer luxurious retreats, while a long hallway flanked by bedrooms creates a sense of privacy and tranquility. Outside, a quaint patio beckons with tall privacy bushes, offering a serene escape for morning coffee or evening stargazing. A dog run along the side yard ensures furry family members have space to roam, while new wood fencing provides security and aesthetic appeal. Beyond the confines of this home is the allure of coastal living. Highly sought-after schools, membership access to the private beach and golf club, and plenty of shopping, dining, and entertainment options are all within reach. Come feel and smell the ocean breeze, soak in the panoramic views, and discover the essence of Palos Verdes Estates living in this extraordinary home. Welcome to your coastal sanctuary.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes","","","Jenny","Yamada-Clayton","syamajen","S4164","2","%","Re/Max Estate Properties","1915000","False","Fu