e home, Serena & Lily wallpaper punctuates several rooms and all kitchen appliances were upgraded with a brand new island. The furnace and water heater were moved to create the interior storage closets that bring functional utility to the floorplan. The second bath was remodeled from three-quarter to full, with upscale fixturing including an en suite pocket door to the front bedroom. To address the ongoing detail of the thoughtful improvements too many to mention in full, even the items that you never get to on the punch list like widening the entire driveway along the 114? deep lot and replacing with pavers have been completed. The entire exterior has been re-landscaped, all interior doors replaced with solid core and the entire property has been repainted. The home is pure retreat and delight.","Other","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SWOODHOW","Gary","Kooba","SKOOBGAR","sb1303660","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1925000","False","Full Service","None.","","None","False","","1686","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Palos Verdes Drive West","","1528","","","Ranch","Cash, Conventional","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","","Park/Greenbelt, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1957","90274","1847",""
