nt door that provides a striking first impression. Step inside to an inviting open floor plan, where vaulted ceilings - a hallmark of its mid-century design - create a sense of spaciousness. This one level home offers three bedrooms, including a primary suite that provides a peaceful sanctuary with its own ocean views and ample closet space. The heart of the home is the meticulously designed kitchen. It's an entertainer's dream, featuring a large center island, gleaming granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a farmhouse sink. A built-in wine fridge is a perfect addition for casual gatherings, and the open access from the kitchen to the backyard, makes hosting seamless. The sunken living room, with its charming fireplace, provides a cozy retreat, while the dedicated laundry room and a bonus office/play area, add to the home's practical and flexible layout. Experience seamless indoor-outdoor living with a private, grassy backyard that's an entertainer's paradise. Complete with a built-in fire pit, outdoor TV, and BBQ area, it's the perfect setting for al fresco dining and relaxing. This turn-key residence also boasts recent upgrades, including newer windows, sliding patio doors, A/C, and copper gutters. The location is truly unbeatable, with Lunada Bay Plaza, Palos Verdes High, and Lunada Bay Park just a short stroll away.","","All Bedrooms Down, Laundry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Charles","Fisher","SFISHCHA","sb1300260","","","Estate Properties","1940000","False","Full Service","Email HELLO@JENNYMORANT.COM include date/time, clients names, your broker info and wait for instructions. Please leave bottom door knob unlocked.","True","None","False","","1943","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","W","Palos Verdes","","2116","Drive","","Mid Century Modern, Ranch","Cash to New Loan","","7141","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1955","90274","2733","PVR1YY"
