 a soothing water fountain, awaits. Marvin picture windows frame picturesque Lunada Bay vistas from the kitchen and living areas, flooding the interior with natural light. Enter the newly renovated gourmet kitchen, equipped with top-notch Wolf and Subzero appliances, complemented by beautiful solid hardwood floors that extend throughout the home. Relax in the brand new master bathroom, boasting double vanities, a large tiled shower and walk-in closet. With three spacious bedrooms with expansive windows, there is ample room for both relaxation and productivity, accommodating large beds and desks. Enjoy the tranquility of a neighborhood with minimal through-traffic, where the open floor plan fosters a sense of spaciousness and flow. Gather around the tumbled brick wood-burning fireplace and immerse yourself in the allure of the sea breeze, accompanied by hummingbirds, songbirds, and majestic peacocks. In ""The Circle,"" every moment is a celebration of coastal living and the peace of home.","","Living Room, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Richard","Haynes","SBHAYNRIC2","SB1292440","2.5","%","Haynes Real Estate","1980000","False","Full Service","Shown by appointment only. Text Tony Puma at (310) 800-7862 to schedule. No showings until after the open house from 11-3pm on  Saturday, May 4th.","","","","","1668","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Espinosa","","1644","Circle","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, See Remarks","True","","","","1956","90274","1920","PVR1YY"
