tainless steel hood and custom cabinetry, it?s a space designed for both beauty and practicality. Just past the kitchen is easy access to the beautiful rear yard which has been recently refreshed with all-new sod, new sprinkler system, guava and avocado trees as well as tall privacy hedges, creating a quiet and serene retreat. A thoughtfully finished garage offers a flexible use space with drywall, epoxy floors, AC unit, new garage door and electrical panel, all complemented by a freshly poured concrete driveway. The spacious primary suite includes sliding doors that open to a charming rear patio, built-in cabinetry and a renovated bathroom with dual sinks, marble countertops, subway tile, marble flooring and skylight. Two additional generously sized bedrooms share a well-appointed bathroom with beautiful original tile and a separate tub and shower. Notable infrastructure improvements include a new tankless water heater (2023), new sewer line (2022), and a new water main line (2024). Full-home A/C and heating systems, fully updated advanced security system with 4 security cameras, ADT sensors on all windows and doors, as well as Google home doorbell round out the features. Located just a block from the charming Lunada Bay Plaza, 10 min walk to the Lunada Bay cliffs and within the acclaimed Palos Verdes school district (walking distance to three schools), this beautiful home is coastal California living at its finest.","","Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cindy","Chew","VCHEWCIN","V7186","","","Estate Properties","1990000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt Austin for showings 310-938-9167","","","","","1639","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Rivera","","2305","","","","Submit","","7141","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1953","90274","2725","PVR1*"
