e, providing the perfect setting for intimate gatherings or larger social events. The sophisticated finishes and attention to detail throughout the home truly elevate the living experience. The generous master suite is a private retreat, offering a tranquil haven to unwind and relax. It features a luxurious en-suite bathroom, complete with updated styles and designer tiles,? a walk-in shower, and a vanity. Additional bedrooms are well-appointed to offer ample space for family or guests. One of the standout features of this property is its exceptional outdoor front space. Step outside onto the sprawling grass area, where you can enjoy the year-round temperate climate, entertain guests, or simply bask in breathtaking surroundings with a peek a boo ocean views.? This residence allows for an active and outdoor lifestyle. Take a leisurely stroll down the beautiful streets 4 blocks walk to the cliffs overlooking the ocean.  Nearby access to A+? public and private schools, fine dining establishments, shopping, close to freeways. Making it  ideal to make a home. Don't miss the opportunity to own this remarkable property that combines luxury, coastal living, and convenience. Experience the best of Palos Verdes Estates.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","","","Christina","Nguyen","OCNGUYCH1","OC16026","2.5","%","eXp Realty of Southern California, Inc","2000000","False","Full Service","Toddlers present at Showings  ok to show home 9am to 1pm and  3pm to 6pm Baby naps between 11 and 3pm no showing during this time. after nap  ok from 3pm to 6pm.  Please  call or text 310-529-2585 with a 3 hour notice. Toddlers at home with toys throughout, watch your step!  -Garage will be closed see pictures to get an idea standard 2 car garage with storage  finished walls access door to backyard.","True","","","True","1569","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Margate","","1701","","","