t upgrades including a remodeled kitchen, newer andersen/pella windows and doors, master ensuite remodel, new paint, new forced air heating, new water heater, water main replacement, new roof insulation, and an EV charging station. The living room has a fireplace for those cozy winter evenings, and there is a built in cocktail cabinet in the family room. The large grassy back yard is fully enclosed and very private, ideal for young children and pets to play safely, and there is lots of patio space for barbecues and entertaining. This is a very comfortable, 3 Bed, 2 Bath single level family home in Lower Lunada Bay, with so much character including original hardwood floors, and the andersen sliders to the back yard are perfect for indoor/outdoor living. Other local amenities include the Terranea Luxury Resort and Trump Golf Course just a short drive along the coast, and just a ten minute drive will take you to the Peninsula Shopping Center at the top of the hill. This really is a special place to live and bring up a family.","Shake","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Cindy","Bandy","PVBANDCIN","V8407","","","Strand Hill Properties","2000000","False","Full Service","Please call for appointment and showing details.","True","","","","1786","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Palos Verdes Drive West","","2112","","","","Conventional","","7141","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Coastline","True","","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows","1957","90274","2733","PVR1*"
