y and immerse yourself in its exceptional ambiance!","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Stephen","Hodgson","SBHODGSTE","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2075000","False","Full Service","No showings until after BO 3/12/24 11-1:30 PM. Thereafter, must have confirmed appt as owner occupied. Appreciate min 1 hrs notice. Open to public Sat & Sun 3/16 and 3/17.","True","None","False","True","1712","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Tyburn","","833","Road","","Ranch","Cash to New Loan","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://california-realty-sites.seehouseat.com/2223307?idx=1","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=WxL3Qja84Hr&mls=1","Blinds, Drapes","1958","90274","2843","PVR1YY"
