lers Timer, Yard","Biking , Fishing, Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Park, Watersports, Preserve/Public Land, Storm Drains, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV24003611","","2","2","","1","Owner","Showing","","4242262147","","Circular Driveway, Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway - Combination, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener, On Site, Parking Space, Private, Electric Vehicle Charging Station(s)","True","Brick, Enclosed, Patio, Tile","True","75","","None","False","","940.14","Nestled within the picturesque enclave of Lunada Bay in Palos Verdes Estates on the cooler side of the Palos Verdes Peninsula lies a truly remarkable living experience at 1545 Palos Verdes Dr West. This beautifully remodeled one-level home offers various features, advantages, and benefits that define the epitome of coastal California living. Feature: Remodeled Elegance Step through the inviting entrance of this exquisite open floor plan with great flow, and the seamless blend of modern design and timeless charm will greet you. Every corner of this remodeled gem exudes elegance, with high-end finishes, thoughtful craftsmanship, and an open floor plan that makes daily living a joy. Beautiful hardwood floors throughout, double skylights let the light shine in, and a wall of windows to showcase the large backyard all add openness and space. Take note of the open great room with a wood-burning fireplace and recessed ceiling beamed in solid wood. The bar area hosts a Subzero wine fridge ready for 147 bottles! No expense is spared in the kitchen, where you will discover ""Esmerelda Granite Counters,"" a prep sink, a Subzero fridge, Thermidor double ovens, a Viking Range, and a built-in microwave. There's a built-in eating table for family breakfasts and a built-in desk that can double as a buffet. The master suite is voluminous and adds to the feeling of space with the vaulted ceiling. Don't miss the walk-in closet and ensuite bathroom.   Site: Convenience for egress and ingress The curved/U-shaped driveway allows for multiple cars to be easily parked. The garage has a Tesla charger installed?Alley behind the house for trash cans and easy access to the neighborhood. Advantage: Effortless Single-Level Living One of the most significant advantages of this home is its single-level layout. Whether you're starting a family, raising children, or simply looking to simplify your daily routine, the ease of navigating a single-level space can't be overstated. There are no stairs to climb, just effortless transitions from room to room, making it accessible and comfortable for all ages. For a full description, ask your real estate agent to print out the two pdf supplements; the first is a floor plan with room dimensions and the 2nd document is the full feature description of this wonderful property; one of the best, if not THE best, values for Palos Verdes Estates homes.  Also play the virtual tour and click the tabs in the upper right for video and more! Thanks","Concrete","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Formal Entry, Great Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sun, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","George","Fotion","vfotigeo","V7404","2.5","%","Call Realty","2089000","False","Full Service","Please text George at 424.226.2147 with your CalDRE# AND email address.  Indicate date/time for showing.  24 hour notice is preferred and will nearly guaranty a ""yes"" to the date/time you request. All that being said, showings start at and after broker open on 1/9/2024.  We're getting some last minute stuff ready for y'all.","True","None","False","True","2222","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","W","Palos Verdes","","1545","Drive","","Ranch, Traditional","Cash, Conventional","","7140","","Single Family Residence","