,"Welcome to this soulful single-level ranch home situated on a flat, over 10,000 square foot lot on one of the best streets in the highly coveted lower Lunada Bay neighborhood, just a block from the bluffs. Walk to the award-winning PV elementary, middle school and high school. Stroll to the bluffs, shops, concerts in the park, hiking trails, and more. This thoughtful, functional floor plan is versatile and appeals to many lifestyles. It exudes grace and light and includes a living room with crackling fireplace and built ins, dining room, kitchen, and separate laundry room. The home is flooded with natural light, skylights, and upgraded dual and triple paned Pella windows and French doors throughout. There are 3 good-sized bedrooms, 2 updated bathrooms, fresh paint and recessed LED lighting.  This single-level home exudes warmth, and you'll discover a backyard where you can relax, entertain, and enjoy the shade of eucalyptus and mature fruit trees. There is a detached garage with ample built ins. The current backyard setting is lovely, or add a pool, pool house, pickleball court or ADU; the opportunities are endless. Don't miss the opportunity to enjoy PVE's A+ school system and experience coastal living at its finest. And be sure to enjoy the benefits joining the PV Beach and Athletic Club, PV Golf Course, PV Tennis and Pickleball, and a friendly and vibrant community.","","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","IMURRROB","Howard","Wood","IGWOODHOW","IGMURR03","","","Vista Sotheby's Int. Realty","2100000","False","Full Service","Thank you for showing! Vacant; go direct.","True","","","True","1653","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Chelsea","","2416","Road","","","Conventional","","6888","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1957","90274","2608","PVR1YY"
