ities, this beautifully maintained residence offers an ideal blend of timeless sophistication, generous scale, and everyday comfort. With five bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, the home is thoughtfully designed to accommodate families, professionals, or multigenerational living?delivering exceptional flexibility and privacy. The main level features a tranquil primary suite, complete with a spacious full bathroom appointed with a soaking tub, separate shower, and ample closet space?providing a private retreat with convenient main-floor access. A separate guest bathroom is also positioned on this level for added comfort and functionality. The lower level encompasses four generously proportioned bedrooms and two full bathrooms, creating a versatile layout that can accommodate additional family members, guest quarters, or dedicated office and recreation spaces. Throughout the home, soaring ceilings and expansive windows flood the interiors with natural light, enhancing the open and welcoming atmosphere. The well-appointed kitchen offers abundant cabinetry, extensive counter space, and an informal dining area?designed to support both daily living and effortless entertaining. The private backyard is a true sanctuary, beautifully landscaped with mature fruit trees and vibrant greenery, and centered around a sparkling heated pool and spa?ideal for outdoor gatherings or peaceful relaxation. Situated in the heart of Palos Verdes Estates, this residence offers access to panoramic ocean vistas, scenic coastal trails, and prestigious amenities, including nearby golf courses, beaches, and boutique shopping. The neighborhood is known for its tranquility, natural beauty, and exceptional community character. Served by the Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District?one of California?s highest-performing public school systems?this home presents an outstanding opportunity to enjoy an elevated lifestyle in a premier location. The seller is highly motivated?bring your best offer and experi