ng a refreshing breeze throughout the home. The property boasts new electric wiring, recessed lighting, a 200 amp panel, and newer Milgard windows. No detail has been overlooked, with a newer roof, driveway, pathway, and a charming flagstone front porch. Additional upgrades include beautifully refinished hardwood floors, a tankless water heater, new interior doors, and a double fireplace. The spacious living room has sliders that seamlessly open to a newly added expansive deck in the rear yard. With soft, overhead caf? lights, it?s a perfect extension of the house and offers an additional space to enjoy the balmy Southern California climate. The primary bedroom provides a serene escape, complete with peekaboo ocean views. The en-suite bathroom has dual sinks, free-standing tub, marble counters and an oversized shower. Located near the charming shops and restaurants of Lunada Bay and the Palos Verdes bluffs, this home offers convenience and natural beauty and hiking paths. Adjacent parkland creates an extension of your own backyard, providing endless enjoyment in nature and stunning ocean vistas. This lovely home is located within the esteemed Palos Verdes School District, with Lunada Bay Elementary just around the corner. Embrace luxury, convenience, and breathtaking surroundings in this meticulously renovated and ideally located home.","","See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Azniv","Goenjian","VGOENAZN","V7186","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2212000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt. Vacant easy to show.","","","","","1870","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via De La Guerra","","2912","","","","Submit","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=cmjoeZpy5Vn","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=cmjoeZpy5Vn","","1956","90274","2835","PVR1YY"
