fers a backyard space and a terraced area that is just waiting for a great idea. Some home features include a freshly painted interior, new carpeting, vaulted ceilings and a new roof. Located just a short distance to the Award Winning Palos Verdes Schools. Enjoy evening strolls, beautiful coastal breezes and the sounds of the surf. Notably, this home has not been listed since 1960, offering a rare opportunity. This is a good one.","Concrete","All Bedrooms Down, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","","Palos Verdes","","Jeff","Amberg","sambejef","S5543","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2220000","False","Limited Service","Supra on after Brokers Open Tuesday 1:00. The Seller and Sellers Broker do not guarantee the information provided here. The Buyer and their agent are advised to check with licensed professionals and the local municipalities regarding the use and specifics of this property.","True","None","False","True","1931","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Anacapa","","2640","","","","Contract","","6888","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Blinds","1960","90274","4335","PVR1YY"
