te balconies?perfect for enjoying ocean breezes, golden sunsets, and pastoral views. Wide-plank sand-colored French oak floors, new interior paint, contemporary brushed nickel fixtures, and a brand-new AC system lend a crisp, modern feel throughout. The recently remodeled kitchen is outfitted with new stainless steel appliances, marble countertops, and ample cabinetry?ready for the home chef. The primary bathroom has also been thoughtfully remodeled with high-end finishes, creating a luxurious retreat. A refreshed hall bathroom complete the picture. The functional floor plan offers flexibility: the primary suite is conveniently located near two additional bedrooms, a remodeled hall bathroom, and the laundry room. A fourth bedroom?ideal as a home office or guest room?is privately set off the living room. Out back, a large patio offers ample space for outdoor dining and lounging. Beyond it, a generous flat lawn with new sod is perfect for play or relaxing afternoons, surrounded by planters ready for a garden or homegrown produce. With captivating views, updated interiors, tremendous outdoor space, and an ideal location in prestigious Palos Verdes Estates?known for its top-rated schools, peaceful streets, and scenic coastline?this home checks every box. Don?t miss the opportunity to make it yours.","","Entry, Family Room, Living Room, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Penny","Wales","PVWALEPEN","v8542","","","Compass","2250000","False","Full Service","Text or Call Listing Agent office line: 424-241-3311","","None","False","","2370","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Zurita","","1716","","","Contemporary, Spanish","Conventional","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","","1975","90274","1981","PVR1*"
