d authentic Japanese plaster walls create texture and warmth. Open beamed ceilings and oversized glass windows and doors frame lush garden views, while inviting the outdoors in. At the heart of the L-shaped design, a spacious redwood deck with pergola overlooks the serene Japanese garden. Custom details like shoji closet doors and teak cabinetry blend thoughtfully with modern comforts like central A/C and recently remodeled bathrooms. Enjoy close proximity to award-winning Palos Verdes schools, scenic oceanfront trails, and the iconic Lunada Bay coastline. And come home to your own private enclave, a poetic ode to artistry, nature, and timeless design.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Donald","McVicar","SMCVIDON","SB1323040","","","DOMO Real Estate","2300000","False","Full Service","Call or text Darin at 310.418.6210, then go direct. Supra on front door.","True","None","False","True","1630","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Margate","","15","Square","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Trees/Woods","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-3d-home/86c3b0ac-1874-4b44-a342-c0f5eee0ab9e?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&utm_source=dashboard","https://vimeo.com/1170394254/4c3ff40c73?fl=ip&fe=ec","","1962","90274","",""
