Lawn, Lot 6500-9999, Rocks, Value In Land, Yard","Biking , BLM/National Forest, Curbs, Dog Park, Hiking , Horse Trails, Park, Mountainous, Preserve/Public Land, Ravine, Stable(s), Street Lights, Suburban, Urban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Fire and Smoke Detection System, Fire Rated Drywall, Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB23141729","","2","6","2","1","Vacant","","","","Shed(s), Workshop","Driveway, Asphalt, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage, Garage - Single Door","True","Brick, Concrete, Covered, Deck, Porch, Front Porch, Slab","True","52","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","920.37","Situated in the heart of the picturesque Lunada Bay neighborhood in Palos Verdes Estates, this enchanting Cape Cod Cottage by the Sea is a refurbished gem. Tastefully modernized while retaining its original 1948 charm, this turnkey property provides the perfect blend of traditional and contemporary. Upon entering the home, you'll be greeted by a semi open floor plan that maintains the true character of the original 1948 build. The living and dining room located in the rear of the home feature floor-to-ceiling windows, providing panoramic ocean views. The main level of the home includes one bedroom, one bathroom, and an office. Throughout the house, you'll find new vinyl wood floors, a new staircase with an elegant iron railing, and other updates that enhance the overall appeal of the property. Upstairs, there are three newly designed bedrooms and a thoughtfully planned layout. The master bedroom boasts two walk-in closets and a master bathroom with double sinks, quartz countertops, and a large rain shower with mosaic tile floors. From the master bedroom, you can step onto the newly reconstructed deck, further enjoying the ocean views. The kitchen has been adorned with quartz countertops, new cabinetry, and appliances. The large window above the sink offers incredible ocean views, making meal preparation a delightful experience. Situated on a spacious 9,296 sqft lot, this 2,499 sqft home provides ample outdoor space for relaxation and entertainment. Overall, the remodeled design offers a beautiful living environment with modern upgrades while preserving the home's original charm. This vibrant home is a testament to the harmonious balance of preservation and innovation. With its prime location, stunning ocean views, and thoughtfully designed interiors, the Cape Cod Cottage by the Sea is a rare treasure in Palos Verdes Estates. This property is more than just a house; it?s a sanctuary by the sea, a home that promises tranquility, comfort, and unforgettable memories.","","Foyer, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Betcy","Elie","v211509695","VC8264","2.5","%","Meridian Capital Real Estate","2300000","False","Full Service","Please text listing agent to confirm showing appointment and go direct. Supra located on water pipe to right of the front door. The number to text is 310-210-4620.","True","None","False","","2499","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","W","Palos Verdes","","2037","Drive","","Cape Cod, Contemporary, Cottage, Modern, Traditional","1031 Exchange, Cal Vet Loan, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Fannie Mae","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","Bay, Bluff, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","Bay Window(s), Plantation Shutters, Storm Window(s), Wood Frames","1948","90274","2703","PVR1*"
