public schools in one of the safest and most sought-after neighborhoods in the country. Situated on the scenic Palos Verdes Peninsula, you'll have access to hiking trails, beaches, and an active, family-friendly community, all just a short drive from the heart of Los Angeles. The property's privacy is one of its finest features, with lush gardens and pathways leading to the entrance. Step inside to discover spacious, light-filled living areas with floor-to-ceiling windows that connect modern elegance with the tranquility of nature. The open floor plan creates a warm and inviting atmosphere, perfect for entertaining or unwinding, while the living room offers a peaceful glimpse of the ocean. Two cozy fireplaces, situated in the living room and the kitchen/family room, enhance the home's charm. Outside, enjoy the beautifully landscaped grounds equipped with automatic sprinklers for easy maintenance. Whether you are dining al fresco or relaxing under the stars, this serene outdoor space is your perfect retreat. And in the quiet of the night, you can hear the distant sound of the ocean buoy bell, a gentle reminder of your proximity to the sea. Additional conveniences include a two-car garage and two basement storage areas, offering ample space for your belongings. Only blocks away, you'll find dramatic cliffs and sweeping ocean views, perfect for sunsets, hiking, or biking along the coast. This home is the epitome of California living, where luxury, nature, and tranquility come together in perfect harmony.","Shake, Wood","Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-65800181","Richard","Haynes","SBHAYNRIC2","SB1292440","","","Haynes Real Estate","2325000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Supra Lock Box ","True","None","False","","2136","","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Palos Verdes Drive West","","2837","","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo","True","https://www.seeth