llowing you to enjoy the coastal scenery from the comfort of your own home. The spacious and well-appointed kitchen offers ample countertop space and plenty of storage, making it a delight for any aspiring chef or entertainer. The bedrooms are thoughtfully situated on the lower level, providing a peaceful and private retreat. The large primary bedroom features direct access to the yard, allowing you to step outside and bask in the tranquility of the surroundings. The primary bathroom boasts a luxurious en-suite bath and a sizable closet area, ensuring both functionality and convenience. In addition to the remarkable interior, this property also offers a three-car garage, providing plenty of space for vehicles and a seperate storage room below the garage. The 7,709 square foot lot is beautifully landscaped and offers endless possibilities for outdoor enjoyment, whether it's hosting gatherings, gardening, or simply relaxing and taking in the stunning ocean views. Located within the highly acclaimed school district, this home is surrounded by fantastic educational opportunities, further enhancing its appeal for families. Don't miss the opportunity to own this exceptional property in Upper Lunada Bay, Palos Verdes Estates. With its impressive features, ocean views, and prime location, this residence offers a truly extraordinary coastal living experience. Schedule a viewing today and come discover the beauty and tranquility that await you at 2545 Via Sanchez.","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Luis","Gonzalez","sbgonzlui","SB1292420","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2430000","False","Full Service","Call or text Jason, then go direct.","True","","","True","2983","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Sanchez","","2545","","","","Cash To Existing Loan","","6890","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Water","True","","","","1976","90274","2805","PVR1*"
