"","0.1489","The sale of this home is contingent upon the seller's ability to close their up-leg property which is currently in escrow. Will need longer escrow or rent back. Broker and Broker?s Agent do not represent or guarantee the accuracy of the square footage, lot size, bed/bath count, lot lines/dimensions, permitted or unpermitted spaces, ordinances, use codes, zoning, rent control rules, school districts or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from Public Records or the other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals. Please email offers along with pre-approval and proof of funds to mattcox@coveandkeyre.com","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Microwave, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","None","False","7543014007","","0","","False","4","1","","","3","4","2413","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","","","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","16","2500000","#ERR","07/29/2023 7:22:05 AM","","","08/17/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/02/2023 12:28:56 PM","","","07/06/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/17/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/01/2023 6:41:56 AM","10/02/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/02/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","16","","False","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room, In Kitchen","","Stucco, Wood Siding","Stucco Wall","True","","Conventional","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Central","True","Balcony, Beamed Ceilings, Built-in Features, Granite Counters, High Ceilings, Living Room Balcony, Pantry, Recessed Lighting, Storage","True","True","","None","False","","False","","33.770162","Individual Room","True","False","","Coastal Zone","2550000","Dining room Chandelier, light fixture in kitchen/breakfast area, and interior light fixture over the front door to be excluded from sale.","","2550000","#ERR","","","mattcox@coveandkeyre.com","","Matthew","903-815-3088","","Cox","","PVCOXMAT","","","","","PV8612","","Cove & Key Real Estate","903-815-3088","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.408033","","7","6487","0-1 Unit/Acre, Rectangular Lot, Patio Home","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Sidewalks","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV23132403","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Concrete, Garage, Garage Faces Rear, Garage - Three Door","True","Concrete, Deck, Patio","True","54","","None","False","","702.64","Welcome to this stunning Spanish home custom built by renowned architect Roy Bayer in 1989. This architectural masterpiece boasts a unique blend of classic Spanish design and modern amenities, making it a true gem in the heart of picturesque Lunada Bay. Enter into the enchanting front courtyard adorned with lush greenery and beautiful trees including: Mexican Lime, Meyer Lemon, Dwarf Banana, Dwarf Tangerine, and ferns creating a refreshing and serene ambiance, as well as custom ironwork that adds a touch of elegance. Inside, the interior is adorned with custom paintings by artist Sharon Brown, infusing the home with unique and artistic charm. Upon entering, your eyes will be drawn to the striking art nouveau iron stair rail and exquisite marble tile, creating a grand and inviting entrance. The primary suite is a true retreat, offering a spacious and comfortable haven. The two-door walk-in closet provides ample storage, and the ensuite bathroom is a sanctuary in itself. Indulge in relaxation with a large jacuzzi tub, a separate shower, double sink and vanity area, and a separate toilet/bidet room. The hand-painted Portuguese tile mirror adds a touch of cultural beauty. The kitchen is a chef's dream, equipped with top-of-the-line amenities and designed with functionality in mind. A breakfast nook offers a cozy spot to start the day, while the 6 burner gas cooktop, Sub-Zero side by side refrigerator, island, and double sinks make cooking a pleasure. A pantry provides additional storage space for all your culinary needs. One of the highlights of this property is the breathtaking ocean views. From the tip of Catalina Island to the mesmerizing expanse of Malibu, these views can be enjoyed from multiple vantage points throughout the home. French doors and wooden windows frame these scenic vistas, allowing natural light to flood the living room and creating a seamless connection to the outdoors. Venturing downstairs, you'll find three generously sized guest rooms, each offering ample closet space. Two full bathrooms ensure convenience for guests and family alike. The family room exudes a nostalgic charm reminiscent of the 1960s, with its art-inspired decor, french doors, and, of course, more stunning ocean views. Additional practical amenities complete the picture, including a laundry room designed for efficiency with generous cabinet space and a desk area for sewing or crafts, as well as an oversized 3-car garage, which includes an extra storage room.","Tile","Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Victor","Liu","PVLIUVIC","PV8589","2.5","%","Luxury PV Realty","2500000","False","Full Service","Text/Call Matt at (903) 815-3088. Matt is to be present at all showings. Please do NOT show up without an appointment. Home is not vacant.","True","None","False","","3558","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Valdes","","2641","","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6890","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=dPi6tY8Xcdi&mls=1","","Wood Frames","1989","90274","2811","PVR1YY"
