led kitchen steals the spotlight with its custom wood cabinetry, double oven, KitchenAid Pro Line refrigerator, 6-burner Viking cooktop, indoor grill, and expansive granite-topped counters ? perfect for meal prep. The kitchen seamlessly flows into a cozy family room with a fireplace, creating a warm and inviting space. A casual breakfast table area is also available, making it great for morning gatherings. Sliders from the family room lead to a covered patio and a spacious grassy backyard, providing an excellent outdoor extension of the living space. For more formal occasions, the living room offers oversized windows, high ceilings, plush carpeting, and a fireplace. Adjacent to it, the large dining room provides an elegant setting for hosting guests. This home also offers a home office with a custom-made desk built for two people and built-in cabinetry, providing a perfect work-from-home environment. Centrally located is a courtyard accessible through multiple sliding doors, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. Upstairs, you'll find a dedicated laundry room with a sink and storage cabinets for convenience. Two upstairs bedrooms share a well-appointed bathroom featuring dual sinks, a shower, a separate soaking tub, and marble floors. The rear bedroom is generously sized and includes a cozy fireplace and ample closet space. The primary suite is a true retreat with a walk-in closet featuring built-in organization and a remodeled bathroom. The bathroom offers two vanities crafted from rich wood, an oversized walk-in shower with two shower heads, and a separate toilet room. The primary bedroom is spacious, featuring elegant ceiling details and a private deck with ocean views. Additional highlights of this home include a 2-car attached garage, a newer air conditioning unit, newer windows and doors, fresh paint, and new light fixtures. With its ocean views, meticulous upgrades, and thoughtful design, this Upper Lunada Bay home offers a luxurious coastal lifestyle that's both comfortable and sophisticated.","Tile","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Karen","Lowe","PVLOWEKAR","v8498","2.5","%","The Agency","2600000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing requests 310-704-4014.  Open Houses Sat Jan. 27 and Sun Jan. 28 from 1-4pm","True","None","False","True","3553","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Zurita","","1705","","","Spanish","Conventional","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1991","90274","",""
