autiful 4-bedroom home in Upper Lunada Bay. Designed for both elegance and comfort, this residence offers spacious interiors, high-end finishes, and breathtaking ocean views. At the heart of the home, the chef?s kitchen impresses with custom wood cabinetry, granite counters, and premium appliances, including a KitchenAid Pro Line refrigerator, double oven, 6-burner Viking cooktop, and indoor grill. Flowing into a cozy family room with a fireplace and breakfast area, this space seamlessly connects to the covered patio and private grassy backyard?ideal for both relaxation and entertaining. Formal living and dining areas provide sophisticated settings with soaring ceilings, oversized windows, and an inviting fireplace. A dedicated home office, featuring built-in cabinetry and a custom desk for two, enhances work-from-home convenience. A central courtyard, accessible from multiple rooms, creates a serene outdoor retreat perfect for dining or lounging. Upstairs, two secondary bedrooms share a luxurious bathroom with dual sinks, a soaking tub, and marble floors. A spacious rear bedroom features a fireplace and generous closet space. The primary suite offers a spa-like en-suite with dual vanities, an oversized walk-in shower, and a private deck with spectacular ocean views. Additional highlights include a 2-car garage, newer A/C, updated windows and doors, stylish light fixtures, and full wraparound tiled courtyards. The backyard's double-gated entry ensures privacy and security, while hummingbirds and nearby peacocks add a touch of natural charm. With stunning sunsets, a versatile floor plan, and proximity to top-rated schools, this Upper Lunada Bay gem is a rare opportunity to enjoy the best of coastal luxury living.","Tile","Den, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes","","","Kevin","Lee","PWKEVLEE","PB21856","","","Bricx