ual pane windows that keep you comfortable all year.  Chef?s kitchen, with Thermador oven and refrigerator, quality cabinetry, large island with counter seating. Upstairs primary has a beautiful west facing balcony, walk in closet and spa like bath.  2 other bedrooms upstairs share a Jack & Jill full bath. An en-suite guest bedroom on the first floor and a family room/office opening to the front courtyard.  Sliding glass doors enhance the connection between indoor and outdoor living, while an established dining room adds a touch of sophistication. Step outside to your private retreat featuring a heated saltwater pool and a relaxing jacuzzi. The outdoor BBQ area and expansive patio are perfect for al fresco dining and entertaining.  The home is tucked away in a charming friendly neighborhood with local amenities close by. Don?t miss the opportunity to make this warm, quality home your own.","Spanish Tile","Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palo Verde Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Regina","Hoffman","sbhoffreg","SB1338520","","","eXp Realty of California Inc","2655000","False","Full Service","Please call listing agent prior to showing. Use Supra on front door. Call for other options if necessary","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","2497","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Garfias","","1613","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Blinds, Casement Windows, Double Pane Windows, Screens","2013","90274","1927","PVR1*"
