e Oven and a Viking Free Standing 6 Burner Range & Hood with built-in Microwave in the Island.  Enjoy Views of the Ocean and Mountain Horizon from inside the Kitchen and Living Room.  This two level floor plan has one regular Bedroom and 3/4 Bath on the main floor with three other Bedrooms on the Upper Floor.  The Primary Bedroom has a remodeled Bath with Soaking Tub and Separate Shower that also opens up to an oversized balcony that takes in the Ocean and Sunset Views all the way to Point Dume.  There is also a convenient Laundry set up in the Primary Bath along with a second Laundry area in the garage.  A remodeled 3/4 Hall Bath serves the two other Bedrooms.  Plenty of space in the backyard for kids and pets to play or to create your own oasis.  The tile roof was done about 10 years ago.  Lunada Bay Plaza with restaurants, barber, hardware store, bank, liquor store, gas station and deli offer convenience close by.  PV Unified School district created additional convenience for families with the Elementary, Intermediate & High School all within close proximity to one another making for an easy going daily weekday lifestyle.","Tile","Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Melissa","Resich","VRESIMEL","V7044","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2675000","False","Full Service","DO NOT USE SHOWTIME: FOR SHOWINGS Text Joe @ 310-738-3262.  Owner will need some time to prepare the home with dog so give me ample time to set up your showing...thanks.","True","None","False","","2394","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Dalton Rd","","1617","","","Cape Cod","Cash, Conventional","","7140","","Single Family Residence","","","Mountain(s), Ocean","True","https://youtu.be/ax40Lj8FYzY","","","1957","90274","","PVR1*"
