cean breezes. The thoughtfully redesigned kitchen is a chef?s delight, showcasing a large center island, custom cabinetry with pull-out shelving, quartz countertops with a designer tile backsplash, Viking stove, hood and refrigerator, and a Gaggenau wine cellar. The kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining area and inviting family room, creating the ideal setting for everyday living and effortless entertaining. The home offers 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, including a spacious primary suite with a walk-in closet and an updated bathroom featuring a shower and jet tub. The lower level features a private suite with a bedroom and office area?easily convertible to a fifth bedroom?along with a tastefully remodeled bathroom. Additional upgrades include recessed lighting, wood flooring, brand-new blinds, air conditioning, newer roof and direct garage access. Sliding doors from the family room open to a charming backyard, perfect for outdoor dining, BBQs, and intimate gatherings. A striking staircase leads to a spectacular view deck with seating areas where you can unwind while taking in panoramic ocean and Catalina Island views. There is also space to install a Jacuzzi (buyer to verify). Ideally located just minutes from Lunada Bay Plaza, popular local restaurants, award-winning schools, and the iconic coastal bluffs, this home offers a rare opportunity to experience the very best of the Palos Verdes coastal lifestyle.","","Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2700000","False","Full Service","First showing starts on 3/7 (SAT) Open House 1-4pm. Lock box will be installed afterwards.","True","None","False","","2621","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Carrillo","","2412","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7141","","Single Family Residence","",