"","0.2159","","Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Oven, Gas Cooktop, Gas Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","None","False","7542011005","","0","","False","2","","","","2","4","2211","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Fax","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","13","2800000","#ERR","02/18/2025 12:21:12 AM","","","05/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/05/2026 2:35:18 PM","","","02/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/03/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/18/2025 10:07:38 AM","05/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","","West","13","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Family Kitchen, Dining Room, In Living Room","Rain Gutters","Stucco","","","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Cathedral Ceiling(s), High Ceilings, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting, Unfurnished","True","True","By door","Supra","False","","","","33.772825","Gas & Electric Dryer Hookup, In Garage","True","False","","","2798000","","","2798000","#ERR","310-872-4164","","Debbie@AnchoredInTheSouthBay.com","310 265-6041","Debbie","","","Allen","","VALLEDEB","","","","","V7186","310-373-3427","Estate Properties","310-378-9494","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.419963","","14","9406","Back Yard, Front Yard, Garden, Lawn, Rectangular Lot, Level, Near Public Transit, Park Nearby, Sprinkler System, Yard","Biking , Dog Park, Golf, Horse Trails, Watersports, Stable(s), Storm Drains","","See Remarks","","","PV25027398","","2","2","1","1","Owner","3108724164","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Driveway - Combination, Concrete, Paved, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener","True","","","40","","Private, Heated, In Ground, Lap, Salt Water","True","","1618.5","Prime Location: Nestled in the heart of the prestigious Lunada Bay enclave, this exceptional property offers unparalleled accessibility to the breathtaking Lunada Bay Bluffs, just a leisurely two-minute stroll away. The property also boasts proximity to all three renowned Palos Verdes schools, Lunada Bay Elementary, Palos Verdes Intermediate, and Palos Verdes High School, ensuring a top-tier education for residents with children. Substantial Lot: The residence is situated on a sprawling lot encompassing approximately 10,000 square feet. The property benefits from a generous city-owned setback, which creates an expansive, park-like ambiance, providing ample space for outdoor activities and relaxation. Interior Features: The interior of the home is exquisitely crafted with four bedrooms and two beautifully appointed bathrooms. The spacious open living room features a fireplace that invites relaxation and warmth. Adjacent to the living room is a sun drenched dining room, perfect for hosting gatherings and enjoying meals with family and friends. The dining room connects to a designer kitchen, Carrera marble island, granite countertops, a charming dutch door, and vaulted ceilings that add to the sense of openness. A Clerestory skylight bathes the interior in natural light, creating a bright and airy atmosphere. Handsome wide plank hardwood flooring graces all rooms, except for the designer-remodeled bathrooms, which feature elegant high quality finishes. French doors off the living room open onto the outdoor space, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living and creating an ideal setting for entertaining or simply enjoying the California sunshine. While the coastal location typically offers a temperate climate, the home is equipped with air conditioning for added comfort during warmer days. Exterior Amenities: The outdoor space is a true oasis, designed for both entertainment and relaxation. A sparkling saltwater pool invites residents to cool off and unwind on hot summer days, while a Jacuzzi provides a soothing retreat for relaxation and rejuvenation. A spacious blue stone patio offers an ideal space for outdoor dining and lounging, and an outdoor shower provides convenience and functionality. A newer tile roof and rain gutters enhance the value, curb appeal, and fire safety. The lush landscaping and mature trees create a serene and private environment, making the outdoor space a true extension of the home's living area.","Tile","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","Justin","Miller","PVMILLJUS","S6107","","","Beach City Brokers","2800000","False","Full Service","Please call or text to set an appointment. Debbie Maxwell Allen  Estate Properties   (310)872-4164   Debbie@AnchoredIntheSouthBay.com BROKERS OPEN 2/18/25 11 to 2pm","True","","","True","1730","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","One","","","Chelsea","","2328","Road","","","Conventional","","6888","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","","1954","90274","2606","PVR1YY"
