 water feature inviting you for a swim in the pool.  As you enter the front doors, discover incredible ocean views with natural light pouring in from floor to ceiling windows.  Head to the kitchen and enjoy the indoor outdoor living with the expansive deck.  The gourmet kitchen, equipped with Miele appliances & Jerusalem Gold limestone counters seamlessly flow to the dining area, attracting family gatherings and entertaining guests. Retreat to the master suite, offering a spa-like indoor-outdoor bathroom with the private deck currently used as an orchid nursery.  The home theater room awaits your favorite game or movie night, equipped with a built in illuminated wall fridge.  Should you need refills or popcorn, just exit the sliding glass door behind the projector, and head up the outdoor spiral staircase to the kitchen.  Enjoy the decks outside both living and bedroom levels around the west and south sides of the 9,339 sq ft lot. Enjoy sunny California days by the private swimming pool or unwind over looking the beautifully koi pond and ocean.  Located in the coveted Lunada Bay neighborhood, this home is ideally close to nationally-ranked, award-winning Palos Verdes High School, Top-Ranking Lunada Bay Elementary and Palos Verdes Intermediate School, scenic parks, and charming local shops. Experience luxury living in one of the most desirable coastal communities in Southern California.  Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a piece of paradise.","Spanish Tile","Home Theatre, Kitchen","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","CLW-X83458","Glenn David","Thompson","CLW-X76901","CLW-X72093","","","WILSHIRE REAL ESTATE","2976000","False","Full Service","Text with 2 hours notice & confirmation. Thank you for showing.","","None","False","","3366","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Zumaya","","1120","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash to New Loan","","6890","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Sewer Available, Water Ava