xcellent floor plan.  Upon entering the home through the double door entry, the stunning hardwood floors, gorgeous new light fixtures and two story foyer are just a few of the many captivating features.   The main level includes a spacious entry, two bedrooms with custom closets, a full bathroom, office and family room with floor to ceiling windows.   The upstairs is ideal for entertaining with a floor plan that flows perfectly out to the beautiful backyard.  The gourmet kitchen features high end appliances and new countertops that overlook the sparkly pool and private oasis. On the top level there are two primary suites with magnificent ocean views, private balconies, vaulted ceilings and a fireplace.  If the idea of laying in bed in the morning, sipping on coffee and enjoying an ocean view is appealing, this home is a must see.  Outside you will find a beautiful, very private entertainers oasis.  The lush landscaping, mature fruit trees , built-in kitchen, and recently refinished blue tile pool and jacuzzi as well as an outdoor shower are all reasons to want to be at home in your very own paradise.  Don't miss out on this ""turn key"" opportunity to own a very special piece of real estate in Lunada Bay.","Shingle, Tile","Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Jacqueline","Enriquez","PVENRIJAC","v8542","","","Compass","3025000","False","Full Service","The property is owner occupied. Please contact listing agent for showings.","True","In Ground","True","","2982","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Estudillo","","1820","","","Contemporary","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","https://vimeo.com/1023827984","","Double Pane Windows, Skylight(s)","1974","90274","1908","PVR1*"
"","0.3502","Listing Agent is also the owner of Excel Funding Real Estate Services, Inc. Realist Tax and property profile are showing 3 bathrooms, however home has 4 total bathrooms. Buyer and Buyers Agent to investigate all pertinent & material facts and not solely rely on information supplied by the Listing Agent and or Listing Office including square footage/bedroom/bathroom/etc. Property was in Notice of Default but has since been cured. Seller is working on getting this reflected on title.","Dishwasher, Gas Oven, Gas Range","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Special Assessments","True","7543048014","","0","","False","4","1","","1","2","5","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Offers Email","Agent Fax","Agent Direct Ph","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","320","3050000","#ERR","07/31/2023 4:28:23 PM","","06/07/2024 10:00:59 AM","07/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/31/2024 2:30:40 PM","06/10/2024 12:00:00 AM","","07/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","10/27/2023 3:59:43 PM","07/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/31/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","320","","False","","","","","","","Other","Family Room, Living Room","True","Wood","True","Central","True","Bar, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters","True","True","None","None, Call Listing Office, See Remarks","False","","","","33.771099","Individual Room","True","False","","","3350000","","","4125000","#ERR","310-784-2828","225","frances@excelfundingres.com","310-784-2829","Fran","","","Baldwin","310-352-2760","SBALDFRA","","","310-784-2828","225","S6831","310-784-2829","Excel Funding Real Estate Services, Inc.","310-784-2828","225","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.405125","","61","15256","0-1 Unit/Acre","Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB23140998","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage, Garage - Three Door","True","Patio, See Remarks","True","49","","None","False","","814.85","Discover the epitome of coastal luxury and elegance at this stunning residence in prestigious Palos Verdes Estates. Offering captivating ocean views, impeccable craftsmanship, and an idyllic location, this residence presents an unparalleled opportunity to embrace a lifestyle of beauty, tranquility, and sophistication within the backdrop of an expansive park-like property. Immerse yourself in a spectacular ocean setting and embrace breathtaking views of the Ocean and Catalina Island from multiple vantage points. Witness stunning sunsets and feel the refreshing ocean breeze from the comfort of your home. Large windows and strategically placed skylights flood the interior with inviting natural light. When the time comes to bring the energy down, enjoy custom automatic blinds in living and family room to adjust the mood. Boasting generously proportioned living areas and expansive yards, providing ample space for entertaining guests or relaxing with family, the open floor plan seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas, making it an ideal place for both casual gatherings and formal events. A well-appointed gourmet kitchen is a chef's dream. Featuring top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances (including a 60 inch Wolf range with French Pop duo oven costing over $20,000), island, elegant countertops, and custom cabinetry. Prepare culinary delights while enjoying the mesmerizing ocean views just beyond your windows. When you aren't entertaining others, the opulent master suite offers a private sanctuary allowing you to wake up to the sight and sound of the ocean. The en-suite bathroom is a true spa retreat, featuring a soaking tub, walk-in shower, dual vanities and a custom built walk-in closet. Outside, the meticulously landscaped grounds feature lush gardens and an inviting outdoor lounge area. This home is perfect for hosting gatherings or simply unwinding after a long day. Palos Verdes Estates is renowned for its exclusive neighborhoods, stunning vistas, and access 