Faces Front","True","Covered, Patio Open","True","57","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","856.07","View View View!! This beautifully updated Lunada Bay home has undergone extensive remodeling to offer an exquisite blend of privacy, delightful coastal living and breathtaking panoramic ocean and sunset views from almost every room. Step into elegance through the formal entry adorned with limestone floors, leading you to a captivating living room featuring wood floors and a stylish stone fireplace. Indulge in the culinary delights of the remodeled kitchen, boasting custom granite countertops, a spacious center island, Thermador appliances, and a breakfast nook. The seamless flow from the kitchen to the family room, complete with a fireplace, creates an ideal space for entertainment. Venture to the UPPER LEVEL to discover the primary suite, a resort-style haven with a view deck, vaulted ceilings, plenty of closet spaces and a primary bathroom with a relaxing soaking tub and a cedar-lined walk-in closet. Nearby is a den/office that was converted from the 5th bedroom and can easily be reverted back. There are 2 additional bedrooms with California closets, sharing a remodeled hallway bathroom. 2 Trex decks span across the house, taking in the enchanting views. The LOWER LEVEL surprises with a wine room featuring custom stonework and wine fridges. A fourth bedroom and bathroom a few steps down is a perfect in-law or guest quarter. A large laundry room with plenty of storage perfected the functional floor plan. The beautifully landscaped yard, with large patios and BBQ area, provides an inviting outdoor space for warm summer nights. Upgrades include custom window coverings, Milgard sliding doors, wood floors, recessed lighting, surround sound, sectional garage doors as well as updated kitchen and bathrooms. Located close to schools as well as the trails & outdoor activities in Palos Verdes, this home offers a unique and desirable lifestyle. Don't miss the chance to call this Palos Verdes Estates gem your own!","","Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Jae In Jenny","Yoon","pvyoonjen","V8463","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","3200000","False","Full Service","For all showings, please text Cindy Carter at 310-388-2533, your name, company name, showing date and time and Cindy will confirm the showing with you. Easy to show, but prefer overnight notice or at least 4 hour notice if on the same day.","","None","False","","3738","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via Olivera","","2633","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6890","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/457693","","Blinds, Drapes, Skylight(s)","1978","90274","2809","PVR1*"
"","0.2745","Put back on the MLS for comp purposes. Property was sold after Listing was cancelled.","6 Burner Stove, Built-In Range, Gas & Electric Range, Refrigerator, Self Cleaning Oven, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7542005024","","0","","False","5","1","","3","1","4","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Fax","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","0","3250000","#ERR","03/10/2024 7:34:42 PM","","","03/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/10/2024 7:41:10 PM","","","12/15/2023 12:00:00 AM","12/15/2023 12:00:00 AM","03/10/2024 7:37:36 PM","03/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","","West","0","","False","","","","","","","Conventional","Family Room, Living Room","True","","True","Central, Fireplace(s), Natural Gas","True","Beamed Ceilings, Built-in Features, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Copper Plumbing Full, High Ceilings, Recessed Lighting","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.775432","Gas Dryer Hookup, Individual Room","True","False","","CC And R's, Home Warranty, Homeowners Association","3250000","","","3250000","#ERR","310-373-9994","","lucas@thelucasteam.com","877-373-9849","Norman","310-373-9994","","Lucas","","VLUCANOR","","","","","V7946","310-703-1999","RE/MAX Estate Properties","310-544-9999","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.422016","","11","11956","Corner Lot, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Rectangular Lot, Sprinkler System","Biking ","","Public Records","","","PV24048708","","2","6","2","1","Owner","Norm's Cell","","310-809-8815","","Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Two Door, Off Street","True","","","54","","None","False","","1152.89","This quintessential traditional home in the heart of Lower Lunada Bay sits on a stunning, oversized corner lot that?s a stone?s throw from the famed PV Cliffs and charming Lunada Bay Plaza. The curb appeal is stellar, and exemplifies a true home town feel. Upon entering, you are greeted with an open and spacious living room with an exquisite stacked stone fireplace with hearth, and French Doors that open onto the awesome backyard! This is the epitome of true indoor/outdoor living! The huge wrap around yard is very private and is a combination of beautiful landscaping and hardscaping! There?s a big grassy yard for the kids and pets to play, a stunning patio with a gorgeous built in fireplace and waterfall feature, fruit trees (lemon, lime, and tangerine), and a professionally installed putting green! The gourmet chef?s kitchen has been elegantly appointed with a 48? 6-burner Wolf range with Pro Wall Hood, Sub-Zero refrigerator with custom door panels, beautiful cabinetry, and granite counters to match the beautiful distressed cherry hardwood floors that are throughout the entire downstairs living area. Directly off the Kitchen is an open dining room and a large family room with soaring cathedral ceilings, fireplace with built-ins, and French doors that invite you onto the rear yard. The inviting dining room has beautiful built-in cabinetry with full wine fridge and an under the counter beverage fridge. This is such an amazing home for entertaining and family get togethers! Two of the bedrooms are on the entry level, one of which has an en suite full bathroom. There?s also a powder room & full laundry room on the main level, and there?s direct access to the garage. Upstairs are two very large bedrooms, both with vaulted ceilings. The huge primary bedroom has a beautifully remodeled bathroom, walk-in closet, & great view of the property and surrounding neighborhood. The second upstairs bedroom is another enormous room with built-in corner desk and TV cabinet, and it?s own remodeled ? bathroom (currently being used as an upstairs TV/family room). This home is walking distance to: Lunada Bay Elementary, Palos Verdes Intermediate, AND Palos Verdes High School, as well as the restaurants and shopping in Lunada Bay Plaza. You and your family can have a true sense of community living here, and can go to K-12 school with many familiar faces! Home was fully remodeled in 2010 including a new roof & Pella windows throughout. Don?t miss out on this perfect family home!","Synthetic","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SWOODHOW","Cari","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","3250000","False","Full Service","No Showing instructions","","","","True","2819","Taped","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Chelsea Road","","2140","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hgVlz-Ru9hVhPQb1bvrRQur32qq0MGTH/view?usp=share_link","","Double Pane Windows, Screens, Skylight(s)","1956","90274","",""
