ss, Driveway, Electric Vehicle Charging Station(s), Garage - Three Door","True","","","57","","Private, Filtered, Heated, In Ground, Pool Cover, Salt Water","True","","828.99","Situated on a flat lot on a flat street with a sweeping ocean view including Catalina Island, this incredibly spacious and comfortable turn-key home elicits a strong pride of ownership. Large windows and balconies accent ocean views throughout the living, dining, and primary rooms. A bright foyer entrance opens to a wall of glass and windows. The home features custom lighting and hardwood floors throughout, new maple cabinets and quartz counters in the kitchen and bathrooms, new Thermador appliances such as a gas range with master-chef BTU power, a recently renovated roof, two recently upgraded furnaces, two like-new air conditioner units, and fresh paint on the inside and outside. Beautiful front and back yard grass areas are outlined by over 200 rose bushes and gladiolas. The property perimeter in the backyard is secure, making it safe for pets to be off-leash. There are oversized living, dining, and family rooms featuring two fireplaces and a kitchen with ample storage. There is also a large primary bedroom and bathroom, large bedrooms, and bathrooms and walk-in closets with custom furniture for each bedroom. The primary bathroom has a deep, brand-new Roman tub and extra large vanities with custom lighting. The fully private backyard features a pickleball court adjacent to the family room, a saltwater pool and hot tub with heaters, a gazebo for dining, and premium-quality paver, making it a delight for entertainment. Extra parking or storage area can be found on the side of the home. The backyard contains a small orchard with roughly 15 fruit trees, and there is room for a vegetable garden on another side of the home, with dedicated sprinklers for all areas. The three-car garage is extra spacious, with two charging stations for electric vehicles. Accessible from the garage is also a very large, walk-in storage area. This executive home is in a spectacular neighborhood, again on a flat street also ideal for dog-walking, in Palos Verdes Estates, which has almost zero crime rate. Nearby there is access to the bluffs, beautiful churches, 5-star resorts, hiking trails, and several golf courses. Terrific medical care is available from physicians at UCLA, Cedars Sinai, and Torrance Memorial, all within ten minutes. The home is also in a top-notch, nationally recognized public school district, and there are widely renowned private schools in the area. Please note some interior photos have been virtually staged to show the property's potential.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Tooba","Malikyar","PVMALITOO","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","3500000","False","Full Service","The Supra lockbox is on the front door. Access hours are 8am-6pm each day (no appointment or permission necessary). Please contact Eric Fischer at (310) 408-0200 if you have any questions.","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","4222","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via Castilla","","1446","","","Contemporary","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27438","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ZCx62Ehjgw","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Screens, Skylight(s)","1978","90274","2862","PVR1*"
"2+ Access Exits, Doors - Swing In, Low Pile Carpeting, Parking","0.4895","Thank you for your interest! Showings with listing agent/team present only. Please TEXT for a showing request 310-739-8272. Call 310-739-8272 for questions. First showings will be open houses Thursday 1/11 from 2 to 4 pm, Friday 1/12 from 10 am to 1 pm, Saturday 1/13 from 12 noon to 4 pm, and Sunday 1/14 from 1 to 4 pm & Tuesday 1/16 from 10 am to 1 pm. Please review all supplements. We have shared with you the prelim, the home inspection, termite inspection, NHD, TDS, SPQ. Please send offers to NancyDeprezTeam@gmail.com. Looking for a non-contingent offer given that we have a full home inspection for your review. OFFER DEADLINE IS WEDNESDAY JAN 17 @ 12 NOON.","Double Oven, Range Hood","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","None","False","7541029009","","0","","False","4","1","","","3","5","1373","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Toll Free","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","13","3505000","#ERR","01/08/2024 9:50:34 AM","","","01/21/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/07/2024 5:18:52 AM","","","01/08/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/21/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/04/2024 10:20:34 AM","03/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","13","","False","Area, Family Kitchen, Dining Room, In Kitchen, Separated","Lighting, Rain Gutters","","","","","Cash","Den, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Gas, Wood Burning","True","","True","Central","True","Balcony, Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Copper Plumbing Full, Pantry, Storage, Two Story Ceilings","False","False","None","None","False","","","","33.781601","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Laundry Chute, Washer Hookup, Washer Included","True","False","","","3250000","","","3250000","#ERR","","","nancy.deprez@vistasir.com","","Nancy","","0","Deprez","","PDEPNAN","","0","","0","PB20222","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby's Int'l Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.410271","","27","21321","Back Yard, Front Yard, Garden, Gentle Sloping, Landscaped, Lawn, Level with Street, Rectangular Lot, Level, Park Nearby, Rolling Slope, Yard","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Horse Trails, Park, Street Lights, Suburban","","Assessor","","","PW23224837","","3","9","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Driveway Level, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Three Door","True","Concrete","True","1","","None","False","","860.12","Custom built ocean view Palos Verdes Estates home, first time on the market! Welcome to 1705 Via Estudillo, perfectly situated on a serene, idyllic street near Dolores Plaza, just half a mile from Lunada Bay Plaza and 2 miles from Malaga Cove Plaza. Located across the street from quiet little city-owned park, there is a gorgeous, unobstructed view of the ocean from the living room, family room, master bedroom, and upstairs bedrooms facing the front, while the kitchen and dining rooms and back-facing bedrooms look out to the spacious and secluded lush backyard. From the curb, you will be greeted by the grand circular driveway, the gracious entry with large front double doors and fountain, and the 3 car attached garage to the right. Inside, the first impression is a formal entry foyer with high ceilings, leading to the living room with stunning vaulted clear redwood ceilings (not a single knot!), large picture window facing the ocean, and majestic fireplace and mantle. Adjoining the ocean view living room is the formal dining room with view to the private backyard, and its various mature trees and bamboo. The kitchen has a large kitchen island, plenty of cabinetry and counter space, a walk-in pantry, another dining area with glass sliders to the back patio, and an adjoining laundry room. The  ground floor also has an ocean view family room with beamed ceilings and fireplace, as well as a bedroom and full bath and half bath. The second floor has the primary suite with vaulted clear redwood ceilings, ocean views, an adjoining study or sitting area with fireplace, and ensuite bath. The top floor has 3 bedrooms and 1 full Jack-and-Jill bathroom, and 2 of the large bedrooms can be partitioned into 2 bedrooms each. Therefore, this 5 bedroom home has the flexibility to become a 6 or 7 bedroom home. Pride of ownership can be seen and felt in the entire property, so it is not surprising that this home has been in the same family since it was custom constructed in 1978. This well loved gem will be cherished by the next owner for its unique charms, stellar location, and high-end construction.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Suzanne","Dyer","VDYERSUZ","V8407","2.5","%","Strand Hill Properties","3505000","False","Full Service","By appointment only - please TEXT Nancy for an appointment. First showings at Open Houses starting Thursday Jan 11 @ 2 pm! Thank you!","True","None","False","","4075","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Estudillo","","1705","","","Custom Built, Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","6889","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Phone Available, Sewer Available, Water Available","Ocean","True","","","","1978","90274","1905","PVR1*"
