 set up with Smart technology to control the lighting, intercom system, alarm, hvac, and security cameras. Walking trails to the cliffs, beach, and parks. Close to shopping, restaurants, golf course, and schools.","","Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-364719773","Angie","Nguyen","PNGUANG","PB21357","2","%","SoCal AllOffers","3600000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please call/text to schedule an appt. 310-486-8521 Showing Information: Appointment w/List. Office ","False","In Ground","True","","3373","","","CA","Closed","Two","W","","Palos Verdes","","2729","Drive","","Modern","Cash","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Peek-A-Boo, Ocean","True","","","Skylight(s), Blinds, Double Pane Windows","1972","90274","2837","PVR1*"
