","","62","","Private, Fenced, Heated, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","905.28","Experience the pinnacle of coastal living in this move-in-ready, ocean view retreat, where privacy, tranquility, and breathtaking scenery are everyday luxuries. Grand double doors welcome you into an expansive, light-filled open floor plan designed for both refined entertaining and effortless daily living. Walls of glass showcase sweeping views from nearly every room, seamlessly connecting the indoors to the outdoors. A wraparound view deck features a built-in outdoor kitchen and retractable, lighted awning?ideal for entertaining. Designed for true single-level living, the main floor includes an oversized primary suite with balcony access, dual walk-in closets, and a spa-inspired bath with freestanding soaking tub and dual vanities. Just steps from the main living areas, the heated pool and spa extend directly off the main level, creating a serene, resort-style sanctuary for lounging, swimming, or starlit relaxation. The lower level offers exceptional comfort and privacy for guests, featuring a second primary bedroom with en-suite bathroom, two additional spacious bedrooms with a Jack-and-Jill bath, and versatile bonus rooms perfect for a home office, yoga studio, gym, or playroom. Whether hosting large gatherings or enjoying intimate family movie nights, this home effortlessly accommodates every lifestyle. Additional highlights include a three-car garage, solar panels, EV charger, wine cellar, fiber-optic internet, warm wood flooring, and custom finishes throughout. Thoughtfully designed and impeccably maintained, this is a home where luxury meets ease?simply move in, unwind, and begin living your coastal dream.","","Exercise Room, Family Room, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Virginia","Butler","VBUTLVIR","V7151","","","Coldwell Ba