ntion to detail and thoughtful craftsmanship throughout.  Soaring ceilings and retractable walls of glass create a seamless indoor-outdoor experience, opening onto expansive patios and a sprawling lawn?generous enough to accommodate a pool?perfect for entertaining or enjoying quiet afternoons in the sun. Designed to capture the refreshing coastal breezes and the invigorating scent of ocean air, the home exudes the tranquility of a luxury retreat. The flowing floor plan connects formal living and dining spaces with a stunning chef?s kitchen, creating an ideal setting for gatherings both large and intimate. Beautiful hardwood floors run throughout, anchored by two wood-burning fireplaces that bring warmth and ambiance to the living and family rooms. Each of the four bedrooms includes its own ensuite bathroom, with the private primary suite offering a peaceful sanctuary.  Additional features include a new roof, ceiling fans throughout, two tankless water heaters, and a charming greenhouse. Located in the heart of Palos Verdes Estates?one of Southern California?s most picturesque and prestigious coastal communities?residents enjoy lush landscaping, dramatic ocean bluffs, scenic hiking trails, and an unparalleled sense of peace and security. The city is renowned for its commitment to preserving natural beauty, its top-rated public schools (three of which are within walking distance of this home), and its close-knit, welcoming community.  This ideal location offers convenient access off the hill while also granting residents the opportunity to join the city-owned Palos Verdes Beach and Athletic Club?an exclusive oceanfront facility featuring a pool, fitness center, and private beach access?as well as membership options at the Palos Verdes Golf Club and Tennis Club. From morning walks along the clifftops to dining at Lunada Bay Plaza, this home is a rare opportunity to fully embrace the refined, relaxed Southern California lifestyle.","","All Bedrooms Down, Attic, Entry, F