alk-in closets and adorable lofts that are super fun for the children. Kitchen features custom cabinets and natural stone countertops with views of the spacious backyard and oversized porch. Home has fully upgraded with hardwood floors. House has dual-zone AC and heat, lot of built-in storage cabinets in the house and garage.. All of this on a 10,738 SF flat lot! Walking distance to the Lunada Bay Elementary, Palos Verdes Intermediate School and Palos Verdes High School - and the coveted Lunada Bay Market.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Kevin","Pluimer","PVPLUIKEV","v8542","","","Compass","3850000","False","Full Service","Thanks for your interest. PLEASE READ CAREFULLY: (1) Please schedule all showings by calling 1-800-746-9464 or through the SHOWINGTIME app (NOT ShowingPLUS). The CBS CODE will be provided with your confirmation in the showingtime email. Be sure to click on the ""More Details"" button.","True","Above Ground","True","","3239","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Chelsea","","2137","Road","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional, Submit","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1950","90274","2601","PVR1YY"
