d outdoor refrigerator set the stage for endless summer gatherings. A cozy fire pit lounge offers the perfect spot to unwind under the stars while soaking in more incredible coastal views. The lush, landscaped yard and multiple spacious balconies invite relaxation?from sunrise coffee to sunset cocktails. This is more than just a home?it's a private coastal sanctuary where luxury, serenity, and panoramic beauty converge in one of Southern California?s most coveted neighborhoods.","Spanish Tile","Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Game Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ning","Wang","TRNINWAN","PB20590","","","Partner Real Estate","4200000","False","Full Service","n/a","True","None","False","True","4448","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two, Multi/Split ","","","Via Davalos","","1409","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Conventional","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Water Connected","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic, Pier","True","","","Custom Covering, Plantation Shutters, Screens, Skylight(s)","1976","90274","1943","PVR1"
