ludes a private office, (possible 5th bedroom) a three-car garage, and a full-width exterior deck that invites al fresco dining and sunset gatherings.  Downstairs, the home offers a secondary family room and four additional bedrooms, including a luxurious primary suite with breathtaking views, a spa-like bathroom featuring a jacuzzi tub, sauna, dual vanities, and a spacious walk-in closet.  The expansive backyard includes the sparkling pool & spa, built-in barbecue,  huge lawn, fire pit, and unmatched views of the ocean and Palos Verdes bluffs.  Meticulously maintained and recently upgraded, this home has been dialed in from top to bottom?offering the perfect blend of timeless elegance and modern luxury.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sharon","Chu","HSHARCHU","8496","","","A + Realty & Mortgage","4370000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie:  310.704.5164 for showings.","True","Private","True","","4658","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1509","","","","Cash to New Loan","","30905","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","","1977","90274","1941","PVR1*"
