hree spacious bedrooms, each en suite, including the sumptuous primary suite with walk-in closet and luxurious bathroom.  The handsome, oversized office is the ideal spot to work from home.  When you add it all up:  A+ location, beautiful craftsmanship and captivating architecture;  this home has it all!","","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kerry","LaPine","PVLAPIKER","SB1290910","2","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","4500000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appt. 310.704.5164","","","","","3342","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","","","Rocky Point","","312","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","17606","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","2012","90274","2624","PVR1*"
