rue","Covered, Enclosed, Patio","True","1","","Private, Fenced, Heated, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","849.06","Introducing a Luxurious Old World Mediterranean Estate with a Spanish Flair. Nestled in the heart of the Upper Lunada Bay neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates, this enchanted abode stands as a testament to the lush, untamed beauty that surrounds it. . With 5 bedrooms, 5 1/2 bathrooms, and 5,300 square feet of opulent living space, this sprawling estate offers an incomparable living experience. As you step through the impressive entryway, you are greeted by a cathedral ceiling in the foyer, adorned with a stunning chandelier that casts a warm, inviting glow throughout the home. Venetian Plaster walls add an extra touch of elegance, creating a timeless atmosphere. The main level boasts a formal dining room, perfect for hosting grand soir?es, while a charming breakfast nook provides a cozy space for more intimate gatherings. The magnificent open floor plan seamlessly merges a grand, chef inspired kitchen with an expansive great room, creating a breathtaking expanse of shared living spaces. Outside, a covered patio invites you to enjoy al-fresco dining and lounging. Wine enthusiasts will be delighted with the wine closet , an exquisite feature for storing and showcasing your prized collection. The home also offers a den, a laundry room on each level for ultimate convenience, and a spacious living room that radiates comfort and style. The primary bedroom is a true sanctuary, featuring a cozy fireplace, a generous walk-in closet, and a private balcony for your morning coffee or evening stargazing. The en-suite bathroom is a spa-like retreat, offering a perfect escape from the world. With a 3-car garage, you'll have ample space for your vehicles and storage needs. But the true magic of this property lies outside, where plush landscaping surrounds a gated pool, stone-built BBQ area, and a covered outdoor patio with a TV, making it an entertainer's dream. There are two fireplaces to keep you warm during cooler evenings, and the Viking 6-burner range, two ovens, and Sub Zero appliances in the kitchen are a chef's dream. Throughout the home, details on the ceilings add to the character and charm of this Mediterranean masterpiece. Every corner of this residence has been meticulously designed and constructed to the highest standards.","","Den, Family Room, Foyer, Jack & Jill, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Karen","Lowe","PVLOWEKAR","v8498","2.5","%","The Agency","4500000","False","Full Service","Please call or email Karen  (310-995-2622),  or Sharon  (310-383-5455) for all showing requests and any questions.","True","In Ground","True","True","5300","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Castilla","","1420","","","Mediterranean, Spanish","1031 Exchange, Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","27438","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","https://youtu.be/ZL7EKLJ18Mo","","","2005","90274","2800","PVR1*"
