rd","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Park, Storm Drains, Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB25102783","","2","6","","1","Owner","","","","","Built-In Storage, Direct Garage Access, Driveway","True","Deck, Front Porch","True","59","","Private, In Ground, Salt Water","True","Close Of Escrow","874.49","Welcome to 2718 Via Victoria, a beautifully updated modern Spanish-style residence tucked on a quiet cul-de-sac in the highly sought-after Upper Lunada Bay of Palos Verdes Estates. Set on a flat and fully usable 16,777 sq ft lot, this expansive 7-bedroom home spans 5,434 sq ft and offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and functionality with picturesque views of the canyon and ocean. Thoughtfully remodeled throughout, the home features high-end finishes and top-of-the-line appliances. The main level offers a flexible and open layout with a formal living room, two spacious dens, a dining area, three fireplaces, and a stunning chef?s kitchen that flows seamlessly into the family room?ideal for entertaining or multi-generational living. A newly added bourbon bar area with two Thermador wine fridges enhances the space for gatherings and celebrations. The kitchen is a showstopper with a Mont Blanc quartzite island, Sub-Zero fridge/freezer, 6-burner Wolf range with double oven, Viking dishwasher, and built-in microwave. The first floor also includes two bedrooms, two and a half baths, and a large laundry room. Nearly every room opens to the lush backyard or offers canyon and ocean views. Upstairs, you?ll find five additional bedrooms, including two Jack & Jill suites. The spacious primary suite captures beautiful ocean views and features a luxurious en-suite bathroom. With seven total bedrooms, this home offers excellent flexibility?whether you need space for a home office, gym, playroom, or guest quarters. The backyard is a private retreat, complete with a saltwater pool, oversized spa, multiple seating and lounge areas, a beautifully tiled outdoor shower, Built-in BBQ, and a large grassy lawn perfect for play and entertaining. Additional highlights include whole house water softener, Anderson Windows, an attached 2-car garage, extended driveway with parking for 4+ cars, a workshop, garden area, dual-zoned air conditioning, and a charming front porch for enjoying coastal sunsets. All of this is just moments from top-rated Palos Verdes schools, local amenities, restaurants, libraries, golf clubs, scenic hiking trails, the coastline and the 110 freeway. This is a rare opportunity to own a truly exceptional home in one of the South Bay?s most prestigious neighborhoods.","Spanish Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Jack & Jill, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Edward","Kaminsky","SKAMIEDW","SB1327500","","","eXp Realty of California, Inc","4752000","False","Full Service","Showings are by appt only and listing agent must accompany. Qualified buyers only. Text Tina at 310-873-8462 to schedule","True","In Ground","True","True","5434","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Victoria","","2718","","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional","","32253","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Canyon, City Lights, Ocean, Pool, Valley","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/4f0457a4-5243-43a9-87be-9a0beb6f109f?wl=true&setAttribution=mls&initialViewType=pano","https://media.showingtimeplus.com/sites/zerqgmr/unbranded","","1987","90274","4478","PVR1*"
