lush landscaping, a pool, ocean views and room for a pickle ball court? Welcome to your dream European manor! This Lunada Bay property has been completely remodeled yet still offers the ability for a new owner to add their personal touch. As you approach the property, a grand driveway and limestone walkway lined with immaculate landscaping leads you to the impressive entrance adorned with intricate stonework. Step inside, and be prepared to be captivated by the timeless elegance and custom craftsmanship that permeates every corner of the home. The gourmet kitchen is a chef's delight, featuring top-of-the-line appliances, natural quartzite countertops and marble backsplash, a built in Miele coffee maker and a center island perfect for gathering with family and friends.  Enjoy casual meals in the breakfast nook, which overlooks the lush lawn, beautifully maintained flower beds, sparkling pool and inviting jacuzzi  Step outside to discover an outdoor paradise that complements the beauty of the manor.  The expansive half-acre lot offers endless possibilities for outdoor entertaining and relaxation.  Lounge on the sprawling pool deck while enjoying the ocean breeze, dip in the pool, gather around the fire pit or embrace the beautiful lawn for a game of whiffle ball or soccer with the family. Upstairs the palatial primary suite is a haven of luxury and tranquillity.  Wake up to panoramic ocean views from your private balcony and indulge in the spa-like en suite bathroom, complete with a soaking tub, a spacious shower, and dual vanities.  Four additional bedrooms, two with ocean views and one with its own en-suite bathroom, provide comfort and privacy for family members or guests. Experience the opulence and tranquility that this remarkable estate has to offer, where everyday feels like a vacation in your own private paradise!","Slate","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Recreation, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Nicole","Reis","SBREISNIC","SB1350760","","","Compass","4983000","False","Full Service","Please contact listing agent for all showing requests. Property is tenant occupied and we need 24 hrs notice. The house is also available for Lease.  Please call Nicole for more information.","False","Private, Heated, In Ground, Permits","True","","3456","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Victoria","","2878","","","Custom Built","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7332","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Trees/Woods","True","https://vimeo.com/1078572443","","Double Pane Windows","1972","90274","4470","PVR1*"
"","0.2677","","Barbecue, Dishwasher, Disposal, Gas Cooktop, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Trash Compactor, Warming Drawer, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7541006011","","0","","False","6","","","","6","5","1270","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Text Message","Office Fax","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","246","5150000","#ERR","03/31/2025 2:38:05 PM","","11/04/2025 5:37:20 PM","12/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/23/2026 5:12:16 PM","","","03/31/2025 12:00:00 AM","12/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/16/2025 12:20:44 PM","01/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","01/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","","","246","","False","Area","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Carpet, Stone","False","Central","True","Balcony, Built-in Features, Open Floorplan, Recessed Lighting","True","True","None","None","False","","","","33.784741","Individual Room, Upper Level","True","False","","","5480000","","","6480000","#ERR","","","suzannetdyer@gmail.com","","Suzanne","","","Dyer","","VDYERSUZ","","","","","V8407","310-541-6560","Strand Hill Properties","310-541-6566","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.417969","","11","11663","Back Yard, Front Yard, Landscaped, Lawn, Level with Street, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Yard","Curbs","Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","PV25069829","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Circular Driveway, Driveway, Garage","True","Patio, Front Porch","True","75","","Private, Heated","True","Close Plus 1 Day","1170.45","Nestled along the most prestigious street in Palos Verdes Estates, this remarkable residence enjoys an unrivaled location directly across from the bluffs. With protected parkland in front, the home boasts uninterrupted, protected panoramic ocean views stretching from the iconic Queen?s Necklace to Malibu?s Point Dume. The breathtaking scenery also includes vistas of downtown Los Angeles, the Hollywood Sign, Griffith Park Observatory, and mesmerizing city lights that twinkle along the coastline at night.  Spanning approximately 4,300 square feet (buyer to verify), this expansive home features five generously sized bedrooms and six bathrooms. Upstairs, are five spacious bedrooms, with two offering stunning ocean views and access to a spacious balcony and laundry room. The primary suite is complemented by a luxurious en-suite bath, spectacular views, and dressing area. Three additional bedrooms share a second balcony overlooking the backyard and pool area.  The main level is designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, with large folding style doors that invite the coastal breeze and frame the spectacular ocean views. The open-concept dining area flows effortlessly into the spacious kitchen, family room, a home theater area, and an expansive living room with ocean views provide ample space for entertainment and relaxation. Two half baths serve this level, including one with direct backyard access for convenience when enjoying the pool and outdoor kitchen. The outdoor space is an entertainer?s dream, featuring a large yard, a built-in cooking area, a pool, and spa. Parking is plentiful, with a three-car garage accessible via the back alley and an additional parking pad that accommodates up to five more vehicles. Designed with future possibilities in mind, the home is elevator-ready and offers potential for an ADU. Originally renovated and expanded in 2013, this extraordinary property is a true estate home with breathtaking and highly sought after location.  Close to award wining schools and easy access off the hill to restaurants and shopping.  Owners in Palos Verdes Estates can join the beautiful Palos Verdes Golf Club, Tennis Club, and Swim Club located on the ocean.","","All Bedrooms Up, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","Palos Verdes","","Vidya","Naik","