nting 1424 Via Castilla, a finely built Mediterranean Villa with beautiful ocean views in one of most prestigious neighborhoods in PV Estates.  Designed by renowned architect Doug Leach and built in 2008 the luxuriously appointed 5 bedroom, 5 bathroom home is set on a flat 15,716 sf lot across from dedicated city parkland allowing for beautiful un-blockable ocean views.  Features include a long gated driveway, 3 car garage prewired for EV charging, private entertainers dream backyard,  4 zone AC with independent HVAC units for each, attached Casita w/separate access, office, wine cellar and elegant finishes throughout.  The foyer has marble flooring, a grand staircase and vaulted ceilings accentuated with beautiful Dennis & Leen Chandeliers.  Downstairs features a separate office, formal dining and living room, fireplace and ocean views.  The Gourmet kitchen includes a large center island with stone countertops, Viking appliances; 2 refrigerators, under-counter refrigerated drawers, built-in Miele espresso machine, 2 Viking ranges and 3 Miele dishwashers. Custom cabinetry & rich walnut flooring lead to a breakfast nook and family room with a built-in entertainment center.  French doors from the nook and family open to the backyard perfect for entertaining.  Upstairs features the primary suite plus 2 other en-suites all with ocean views.  The primary suite has its own fireplace, his/hers walk-in closets, bath, jacuzzi tub & fireplace.  The home also has a 5 camera security system & Sonos home audio system with built-in speakers. The backyard is an Entertainer's Dream!! - Hosts an outdoor Viking BBQ kitchen, fireplace, spa & pool w/swim-up bar and Baja areas. Prepare to become the focal point of festivities with friends and loved ones with this move in ready, elegant, ocean view home!","Spanish Tile","Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Roo