"","0.3913","Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals. All visitors to be advised home may have security recording systems.","Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","None","False","7543045030","Other","0","","False","7","1","","","6","6","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Home Ph","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Dual","True","Los Angeles","27","5510000","#ERR","01/15/2024 5:46:55 PM","","02/08/2024 10:36:48 AM","02/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/07/2024 10:22:17 AM","","","09/08/2023 12:00:00 AM","02/11/2024 12:00:00 AM","02/07/2024 3:37:39 PM","03/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/07/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","27","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Stone, Wood","True","Central","True","","True","True","Front handrail","Supra","False","","","","33.773315","Individual Room","True","False","","","5599000","","","5799000","#ERR","310-855-3557","","tony.accardo@compass.com","","Anthony","310-855-3557","","Accardo","","PVACCAANT","","","","","v8542","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.406658","","92","17043","0-1 Unit/Acre","Hiking ","","Assessor","","","PV24004785","","3","3","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage - Three Door","True","","","32","","Private, In Ground","True","Close Of Escrow","897.98","Indulge in the epitome of luxury living at 1380 Via Romero, Palos Verdes Estates. This exquisite property boasts 6 bedrooms and 6.5 bathrooms, providing an expansive 6,136 square feet of living space. Nestled on a generous 17,043 square-foot lot, this home offers a perfect blend of sophistication and comfort. Built in 2000, this residence is a timeless masterpiece, featuring unobstructed panoramic ocean and Catalina views from 5 of its 6 bedrooms. Dual primary suite options on each level offer indulgent Jacuzzi tubs, walk-in closets, and expansive Catalina island and ocean view. A retreat within a retreat, the sauna room provides a tranquil escape, and the dedicated theater promises unforgettable entertainment experiences. The property includes a 3-car garage, complemented by four fireplaces that add warmth and charm to various living spaces. The multi-zone air conditioning and heating system ensure optimal comfort throughout the year. Experience the pinnacle of culinary delight in the chef's kitchen, complete with SubZero appliances and a 48? range. Abundant natural light bathes the interior, complemented by over 10 skylights that emphasize the high ceilings, creating an airy and inviting ambiance. Recent updates to the bathrooms and hardwood flooring bring modern elegance to this luxurious abode. Storage is abundant with multiple large storage rooms, seamlessly integrated yet not included in the official living space. Step into the backyard oasis where a saltwater pool and spa, complete with a motorized cover, invite relaxation. Enjoy the privacy of low-maintenance landscaping, and revel in the dramatic exterior lighting system that adds a touch of magic to the evenings. This property goes beyond the ordinary with in-wall speakers, ensuring a harmonious atmosphere throughout. For those with furry companions, an exterior gated dog kennel provides a secure and stylish space for pets. Pride of ownership is prevalent as you tour the home and observe the TLC taken in every detail.","","Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Media Room, Sauna, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","","Palos Verdes","","Beatri