e ocean-view tower room upstairs?a unique retreat within the residence. Outside, the grounds beckon with resort-style amenities, including expansive patio and lawn areas for ultimate relaxation. Enjoy a refreshing swim in the sparkling pool, unwind in the bubbling spa, or engage in friendly competition on your private tennis court. Additional amenities include a circular driveway, gated front courtyard entry, and an attached three-car garage with an EV charger. Its prime location affords easy access to top-rated schools, Lunada Bay Plaza, and a variety of hiking trails ? perfect for those seeking a prestigious coastal lifestyle. For a private viewing, please call or text.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Lunada Bay","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Steven","Watts","VWATTSTE","v8491","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","5750000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Call or text Kevin for appointment 310.346.4256","","Heated, In Ground","True","","3696","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1804","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean, See Remarks","True","","","","1971","90274","","PVR1*"
