azing culinary creativity.  This spacious home is boasting 6 bedrooms and 7.5 bathrooms and sits on over ? acre of flat land. The backyard will inspire the most discerning entertainer with a beautiful stone patio, covered BBQ area, pond, massive pool & spa, gazebo and a vegetable garden? not to mention sprawling yard area!  It?s a tradional floor plan with the remaining bedrooms upstairs, two of which have their own lofts.  All bedrooms are en suite.  The master suite has a built in office, remodeled spa like bathroom and opens up to a spacious deck drenched in sunlight.  This glorious homestead is a perfect combination of a private compound and entertainment complex in a serene landscape and must be seen to believed.","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","6500000","False","Full Service","Easy to show but MUST have a confirmed appt time.  24 hours notice preferred.","True","Private","True","","6975","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","1820","","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood, Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","","1982","90274","1856","PVR1YY"
"None","0.4489","follow this link for property disclosures: https://app.disclosures.io/link/2108-Paseo-Del-Mar-3tx0kdd4","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Freezer, Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7542008003","Other","0","","False","8","2","","4","2","6","2100","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","15","6510000","#ERR","05/01/2025 2:52:59 PM","","","05/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","07/01/2025 4:08:58 PM","","","03/06/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/01/2025 2:52:59 PM","06/20/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/20/2025 12:00:00 AM","","West","15","","True","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash","Living Room, Patio","True","Wood","True","Central","True","Balcony, High Ceilings","True","True","","None","False","","False","","33.777304","Individual Room","True","False","","Homeowners Association","6800000","","","6800000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.422827","","3","19555","Back Yard, Level with Street, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Sprinkler System","Biking , Fishing, Golf, Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB25059842","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","Guest House Detached","Garage - Three Door","True","Concrete, Covered, Patio","True","43","","Private","True","Negotiable","1143.51","Welcome to this spectacular ocean view estate located on one of Palos Verdes Estates? most prestigious streets, directly across from the scenic Lunada Bay bluff. This exceptional contemporary residence was built in 2015 and offers the perfect blend of modern sophistication, luxurious amenities and a breathtaking coastal setting. Boasting five bedrooms in the main house plus an additional bedroom in the approximately 900-square-foot detached casita, this property is designed for both grand-scale entertaining and everyday comfort. Inside, soaring cathedral ceilings and wide-open living spaces create a light-filled atmosphere. The formal living and dining rooms open through expansive doors to a stunning outdoor sitting area with ocean views of the Pacific.  At the heart of the home is a chef?s kitchen anchored by a massive stone-topped center island and breakfast bar. Outfitted with Thermador appliances?including a six-burner double oven range, steam oven, separate freezer, and side-by-side refrigerator?it also features a separate scullery with a second oven, range, sink, and ample cabinetry, ideal for hosting larger gatherings. The kitchen is part of the show-stopping great room, which features a floating fireplace and opens to a resort-style backyard with a pool, spa, and fully-equipped outdoor kitchen. Designed by a renowned landscape architect Di Zock, this outdoor area combines Ipe wood decking, stunning plant selection, a covered lounge area, dramatic outdoor lighting, a grassy play area, and a fire pit with outdoor seating.  The main-level primary suite offers ocean views, a custom walk-in closet, wood floors, a cozy fireplace, and a spa-like bath with a two-person soaking tub. Upstairs, you'll find an additional family room and two private en-suite bedrooms. The detached casita provides a full living room, kitchen, bedroom, and bath?ideal for guests, extended family, office, or gym space.  Additional highlights include three-zone air conditioning, two Tesla Powerwalls, a Vivint alarm system, a whole-house water softening system, and a spacious three-car garage.  This is California coastal living at its finest.","","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jason","Buck","VBUCKRIC","V7186","","","Estate Properties","6510000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments:  310-704-4014","True","","","True","5693","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Paseo Del Mar","","2108","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","7331","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","https://players.brightcove.net/5782667246001/default_default/index.html?videoId=6372177756112","","","2015","90274","",""
"","0.5766","Offers are due on Wednesday, 7/19 at 12PM.","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Free-Standing Range, Freezer, Disposal, Trash Compactor, Water Heater","True","160 - Lunada Bay/Margate","Unknown","True","7543001022","","0","","False","9","1","","","8","7","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Fax","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","8","6537000","#ERR","07/05/2023 7:10:45 PM","","","07/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/09/2023 10:12:45 PM","","","04/08/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/10/2023 2:19:17 PM","08/09/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/09/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","8","Double Door Entry, Mirror Closet Door(s), Sliding Doors","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash","Dining Room, Family Room, Primary Bedroom, Great Room, See Through, Two Way","True","Carpet, Stone, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","Balcony, Bar, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, High Ceilings, Living Room Balcony, Living Room Deck Attached, Open Floorplan, Pantry","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.765256","Individual Room","True","False","","","6500000","","","6500000","#ERR","","","annieho1999@yahoo.com","310-782-8529","ANNIE","","","HO","","shoannie","","","","0","SB1350760","","Compass","310-241-3038","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.406529","","8","25117","0-1 Unit/Acre, Cul-De-Sac, Sloped Down, Front Yard, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft","Sidewalks","","Assessor","","","SB23119681","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage, Garage Faces Front","True","Covered, Deck","True","72","","Private, In Ground","True","","781.56","Introducing an extraordinary coastal beauty! Perched high in the prestigious Lunada Bay, this gorgeous home offers panoramic breathtaking ocean views  from Malibu to Catalina! Prepare to be captivated as you step into this stunning home, where floor-to-ceiling windows showcase the sparkling ocean, creating an exquisite backdrop for your daily living. Designed with a perfect balance of elegance and functionality, this home embraces the essence of coastal luxury and tranquility. Almost every major room captures the breathtaking ocean vista, allowing you to indulge in the beauty of nature from the comfort of your own space.  With seven spacious bedrooms, each accompanied by its own en suite, this residence offers ample accommodation for family and guests. The upstairs primary bedroom presents a serene retreat, complete with a study/sitting room, walk-through shower, sauna, two walk-in closets, separate vanity areas, and washrooms. On the lower level, a generous secondary primary bedroom awaits, boasting its own ocean views and a connected den that can be utilized as a kitchenette. Additionally, there are two bedrooms on the main level that provide flexibility and convenience for guests or in-laws.  And a versatile bonus room can serve as a media or game room. Among the standout features of this exquisite property is the newly remodeled chef's kitchen, a haven for culinary enthusiasts. Equipped with top-of-the-line appliances, abundant counter space, and ample storage, it effortlessly combines functionality and style. Entertaining becomes a delight with the expansive wet bar, featuring a wine cellar, and the spacious open layout that encourages seamless gatherings. Stepping outside, you'll discover the gorgeous grounds that includes a serene Japanese garden, a tranquil waterfall, and a large swimming pool and spa, all overlooking the expansive ocean views, creating a perfect setting for relaxation and entertainment. Located on a quiet cul-de-sac, this exclusive property shares its surroundings with only five other homes, ensuring privacy, peace and quiet. With its unbeatable location and breathtaking ocean view, this home presents an unparalleled opportunity. Don't miss the chance to make this your own private sanctuary.","Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Sauna, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jay","Field","OCFIELJAY","OC03224","2.5","%","eXp Realty of California Inc","6537000","False","Full Service","Please call Annie for showing appointments.","True","Private, In Ground","True","","8364","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Miguel","","2745","","","Contemporary","Cash to New Loan","","32253","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Bluff, Canyon, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","https://order.teatreeproductions.com/2745-Via-Miguel/idx","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=aru6h8VLgEf","","2000","90274","4480","PVR1*"
