place, laminate flooring, and newer windows that bring in natural light. The home features three bedrooms and two bathrooms, with a versatile Den that could easily serve as a fourth bedroom, nursery, guest room, or home office. The large Family Room is a standout feature, with soaring high ceilings, custom decorative wood beams, a stone masonry fireplace, built-in cabinetry for storage and entertainment, and dual large bookcases. This room also offers stunning views of the backyard patio and spa area, as well as a lush side yard with mature landscaping. The primary bedroom offers generous closet space and an en suite bathroom. The kitchen, located between the Living and Family Rooms, is conveniently positioned with access to the backyard patio and a built-in brick BBQ. The Laundry Room is just off the kitchen and includes a sink for added convenience. With its seamless indoor-outdoor flow and view corridors of the coast, L.A. basin and mountains from nearly every room, this home is perfect for those who enjoy entertaining and relaxing in a private, serene setting. A true must-see in person!","","Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Julie","Christensen","SCHRIJUL","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2100000","False","Full Service","Vacant. Go direct. Supra and Combo lockbox on front door. Call L/A for combo","","","","","2368","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Sonoma","","2432","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Subject To Other, Submit","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s)","True","https://dan-solomon-photo.aryeo.com/sites/wejalnn/unbranded","","","1956","90274","2031","PVR1*"
