th natural light cascading in from every angle. From the moment you enter the front door, you will notice the pride of ownership reflected in custom plantation shutters, beautiful hardwood floors, and designer touches throughout. The open-concept layout connects the living and dining areas, creating a functional and inviting space. Gather around the fireplace while enjoying views of the treetops and the magnificent backyard. The downstairs den or bonus area, complete with its own designated fireplace, offers flexibility as a kids' hangout, home office, or additional living space. A convenient indoor laundry area includes additional storage. Step through the sliding patio doors into your own private oasis where the large, flat grassy yard is perfect for kids to play, while the upper patio provides a tranquil retreat to enjoy a glass of something delicious. Located just around the corner from the prestigious, award-winning Montemalaga Elementary School and a neighborhood park, this home is also close to the shops, restaurants, and amenities Palos Verdes offers. This quintessential Montemalaga home has never been on the market and is truly one of a kind. Impeccably maintained and featuring a highly functional layout inside and out, it is ready for you to move in and make it your own. Break out the bocce ball and get ready to host unforgettable gatherings in this exceptional backyard.This is a rare chance to own a piece of history and make it your own. More than a dream, with a little imagination?it?s your forever home. Welcome home!","","Den, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","","","","Ajith","Puthanpurayil","CLW-C121197","CLW-X83017","","","LAX Realty, Inc.","2150000","False","Full Service","Please text Anna Perry (310) 874-9668 to schedule an appointment to show.","True","None","False","","2346","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via La Brea","","2209","","","Traditional","Cash