ional Realty","310-541-8271","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.384305","9369","10","9369","Cul-De-Sac, Front Yard, Gentle Sloping, Lawn, Park Nearby, Sprinkler System, Yard","Biking , Curbs, Hiking , Gutters, Park, Preserve/Public Land, Sidewalks, Street Lights, Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB25013987","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Driveway, Garage, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Two Door, Garage Door Opener, Workshop in Garage","True","Patio, Patio Open","True","12","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","843.39","Buyers requested interior photos be removed. This home was a clean, livable fixer. This 2-story, 4-bedroom home is an exceptional value and a wonderful opportunity. Nestled in the heart of Monte Malaga, it feels and looks like you are in Palos Verdes Estates! Plus you have close proximity to the coveted Palos Verdes Peninsula public schools! Neatly tucked into a friendly cul-de-sac, and freshly painted inside and out, this home appeals to various lifestyles and offers endless potential for future renovations! Perfectly livable as it is, the sunken living room with vaulted ceilings provides an ideal space for family and friends to gather. The formal dining room and bright, sunny kitchen opens beautifully to the family room; a flexible space that makes entertaining a breeze. The entry-level bedroom is ideal for guests, in-laws, home office, etc. A full bathroom is next door and your guests or clients can access the room via the direct access 3-car garage. Speaking of the breeze, this home enjoys a cool ocean breeze year-round, and nice ocean views from the entry level with spectacular views from the extraordinary primary suite! This harmonious space is your private, serene sanctuary to peace, relaxation, and sweeping Queens Necklace Pacific Ocean views! It is so large and inviting that it has its own living room; ideal for decompressing after a long day as the ocean views unwind your mind. The private bathroom has ocean views too with a double sink vanity, wall closet, and a large step-in shower. The huge walk-in closet is a dream come true with space for everything! There are also two secondary bedrooms sharing a full bath on this level. This home is a terrific value with recessed lighting, new lighting in the kitchen, formal dining room and exterior, fresh paint inside and out, a direct access 3-car garage with ample built-in storage and workbench, plus the laundry room is next to the entry-level bedroom which means this room could be ideal for a live-in housekeeper, au pair, college student, and extended stay guests.","Tile","Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Workshop","","Los Angeles Unified","","","","","Cameron","Stearns","VSTEACAM","v8542","","","Compass","2375000","False","Full Service","***OFFER DEADLINE-Monday, 2/03/25 at 10 AM*** Owners do not want a lockbox, listing agent must be present for showings per owners' request. EASY to show! Please don't use Showingtime. This is a trust sale, the 92-year-old owner passed away peacefully of natural causes in the house while on hospice in late 2024. All information provided is deemed reliable but is not guaranteed. Broker/Agent/Seller does not guarantee the accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, permits, use code, schools, or other information concerning the conditions or features of the land provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer(s) and their agents are advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspections and with appropriate professionals.","","None","False","True","2816","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Sandbrook Drive","","6015","","","Contemporary, Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","670418","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural