y System","Assessor","","","OC23210737","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Street","","","","35","","Private, In Ground, Salt Water","True","","674.42","Nestled in the most prestigious area of Montemalaga in the city of Palos Verdes Estates.. With breathtaking ocean views of the Queens Necklace, 2433 Via Sonoma embodies luxury living with a myriad of exquisite features and recent upgrades that redefine modern comfort. Boasting a total of 5 bedrooms and 5.5 bathrooms, this two-level residence spans 3,781 square feet of meticulously designed living space on a generous 0.55-acre lot. The residence underwent a transformative renovation from November 2020 to April 2021, highlighted by the addition of a new A/C and heating system, a fully redone pool with saltwater and heater, and a renovated kitchen featuring top-of-the-line Viking appliances. The property also received new plumbing, flooring, a water heater, and all-new electrical systems. The primary bathroom was fully remodeled, along with all other bathrooms, and an additional bathroom and walk-in closet were added. The thoughtful upgrades extend to new window treatments, fresh paint, and the incorporation of a new garage motor in April 2022.  Beyond the walls, the property encompasses a stunning oasis with an abundance of avocados in the botanical garden, creating an atmosphere of tranquility. The private pool, accessible year-round, complements the property's flow for entertaining, accentuated by the breathtaking ocean view. Enjoy the comfort of a central air conditioning system, zoned heating, and a whole-house fan. The kitchen, equipped with high-end appliances, becomes the heart of entertainment, while the main floor's three bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms offer convenience. Situated in a safe and friendly neighborhood, residents benefit from proximity to shops, outdoor recreation, and dining options in the nearby Riviera. This Palos Verdes Estates residence seamlessly combines privacy with convenience. Embrace the Southern California lifestyle in this meticulously upgraded home, where every detail has been carefully considered to provide a haven of comfort and style.","Clay","Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Sauna","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Josephine","Balzano","PVBALZJOS","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","2550000","False","Full Service","TEXT Erick Bissman 949-903-2611 for showing schedule. 24 Hour Notice required, text agent to set up showing request along with name and DRE#. Wait for confirmation.","","In Ground, See Remarks","True","","3781","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Sonoma","","2433","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Conventional","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean","True","","","","1957","90274","2030","PVR1*"
