e an outstanding residence that offers an almost ""treehouse"" feel.  The serene backyard is accentuated by lush mature trees along the perimeter providing privacy and beauty. The lot at the front measures approx. 88' and widens to 166' at the back; with the house located towards the front of the property, there is extensive room to build out without impacting the backyard area. It's expansive outdoor space offers options to build a pool, outdoor kitchen, sports court and still have room for a grassy area. Location-wise, the property scores high with proximity to top-rated Palos Verdes Peninsula schools.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ronald","Melendez","sbmeleron","SB1323210","","","Compass","2555000","False","Full Service","Vacant, go any time. Please make sure all doors are locked","True","None","False","","2612","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Margarita","","1340","","","See Remarks, Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Hills, Peek-A-Boo, See Remarks, Trees/Woods","True","","","Casement Windows, Screens","1964","90274","2027","PVR1*"
"","0.1703","All Offers including RPA, Proof of Funds and Pre-Approval Letter to be emailed to the Listing Agent, Stephen Haw, at skh8828@gmail.com.","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Double Oven, Disposal, Gas Range, Microwave, Range Hood, Refrigerator, Self Cleaning Oven","True","162 - Monte Malaga","Unknown","True","7544024002","","0","","False","3","","","1","2","4","17","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","8","2575000","#ERR","08/10/2023 6:05:27 AM","","","08/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/20/2023 1:37:31 PM","","","08/10/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/18/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/20/2023 10:50:04 AM","09/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","8","","False","Area","","","","","","Cash to New Loan","Living Room","True","Carpet, See Remarks, Tile, Vinyl, Wood","True","Central","True","Balcony, Beamed Ceilings, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Granite Counters, High Ceilings, Quartz Counters, Recessed Lighting","True","True","NA","None","False","","","","33.784487","In Garage","True","False","","","2495000","","","2495000","#ERR","310-544-6100","","skh8828@gmail.com","310-544-6166","Stephen","","","Haw","","VHAWSTE","","","","","V8040","310-544-6166","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","310-544-6100","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.392374","","2","7419","Landscaped, Park Nearby","Park, Suburban","","Assessor","","","PV23142336","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Direct Garage Access, Concrete, Garage Faces Front, Garage - Single Door","True","Concrete, Patio Open, Front Porch, Stone, Tile","True","1","","Private, In Ground","True","","1160.43","Welcome to your Mediterranean paradise in the prestigious Montemalaga area of Palos Verdes Estates! This beautifully updated home is located across from the grassy Coronel Plaza, offering a soothing green view right from the doorstep. Recent upgrades, including brand new flooring and HVAC, infuse timeless charm with contemporary living. The inviting landscape and charming front porch lead you to the inside to discover the home with open beam cathedral ceilings throughout. The living room offers a cozy fireplace and French doors leading to the front porch. The gourmet kitchen has expansive granite countertops and top-of-the-line appliances, such as a Viking range, sub-zero refrigerator & a wine cooler. The kitchen seamlessly flows into the bright & airy dining area and family room with bay window seats and French door to the tiled backyard. A main floor bedroom en-suite, currently used as an office and can easily be converted back to a bedroom, boasts a tastefully remodeled bathroom and a closet. Two additional bedrooms are of good size. They share a well-appointed hallway bathroom featuring a soaking tub, a 2-sink vanity & a linen closet. There is also a door that opens to the outside for easy access from the swimming pool. The upper level holds a primary suite, providing the utmost privacy and tranquility.  A balcony took in the open view while a double door closet provides additional closet space. The primary bathroom features both a shower and a tub as well as access to a large walk-in closet. The delightful space outside the house boasts an outdoor kitchen/BBQ area, a sitting area with a fire pit, and a sparkling swimming pool and spa. All of this is beautifully enveloped by carefully curated landscaping, creating a private and picturesque oasis perfect for hosting gatherings or simply unwinding in style. The combination of Mediterranean charm, modern upgrades, and the incredible outdoor space makes this property an absolute gem. As if this is not enough, this home sits in a quiet street of Palos Verdes Estates but have easy access to the heart of Palos Verdes, restaurants, shops and schools.  Don't miss the opportunity to call this house your home and embrace the luxurious lifestyle that awaits you.","","Entry, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Helena","Choi","vchoihel","PV8627","2.5","%","eXp Realty of Greater Los Ange","2575000","False","Full Service","The property is occupied by the Seller. Overnight notice is required. Please TEXT Cindy Carter at 310-388-2533 of your name, company name and the showing time and she will set up the showings for you.","True","Private, In Ground","True","","2219","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Coronel","","64","Plaza","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Park/Greenbelt","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/448597","","Bay Window(s), Casement Windows, Drapes, Skylight(s)","1963","90274","","PVR1YY"
