way that provides convenient guest parking.This is a rare opportunity to own an exceptional property with stunning coastline views in upper Malaga Cove.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Dressing Area, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Tony","Buttitta","SBBUTTANT","SB1288550","","","Coldwell Banker Residential Br","3150000","False","Full Service","Easy to show. Please text Patricia Gardner at 310-507-5204 to schedule a showing. Please leave your business card and make sure to close all doors before leaving after the showing.Thank you","True","Private, In Ground","True","True","3364","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Monte","","953","","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7330","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://tours.previewfirst.com/ml/152359","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/731169e7-7cdf-4641-9a7b-42faa10d9b8d?setAttribution=mls&wl=true&initialViewType=pano&utm_source=dashboard","Custom Covering, Drapes, Screens","1973","90274","1615","PVR1*"
