 an elegantly remodeled and perfect, turnkey single level home. Remodeled down to the studs in 2014 by local and renowned Knightsbridge Development, this sophisticated 3 bedroom 3.5 bathroom home features stunning finish style and quality from the quarter sawn oak wood floors to the quietly luxurious kitchen and bathrooms.  The home is framed by the iconic olive trees that famously line Via Sonoma as you first approach.  The wide lot allows for the new circular driveway.  Through the front door you're greeted by the open formal living room and a view of the lush backyard and pool through the large Kolbe & Kolbe sliding glass doors.  The west side of the home features the main living areas including the kitchen, family room, dining area, breakfast nook, laundry room and garage.   The east side of the home features the 3 generously sized en-suite bedrooms all with nice green garden views.  The primary suite undeniably stands out.  Large, light and bright with a backdrop of the yard and accompanied by the tranquil sounds of the fountain in the rose garden.  The primary bathroom is spacious and features separate walk-in shower and soaking tub with exquisite marble tile work.  The manicured backyard features a beautiful rose garden with a PV stone and decomposed granite path leading to a picturesque and ample seating area, pool + spa, patio, outdoor dining area and boxed gardens.  Other features include central air conditioning, new epoxy garage floor, window treatments, and new plumbing, electrical and Kolbe & Kolbe windows and doors throughout completed with the 2014 remodel.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","Palos Verdes Peninsula","","","Patricia","Gardner","PVGARDPAT","V7151","2.5","%","Coldwell Banker Realty","3169250","False","Full Service","Text Neil (310) 902-7227","True","Private, In Ground","True","True","2427","Assessor"