dining room is on one side, and a spacious family room with fireplace is on the other.  Two ?primary-suites?, each with a private bathroom offer luxurious choices.  The library / piano room includes an additional fireplace and provides a charming alcove in which to relax.  The expansive driveway leads to the 2 car garage with direct access to the large laundry room.  Rose gardens, fruit trees, air-conditioning and solar panels are just a few of the many amenities.","","Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Two Primaries","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jennifer","Caras","scarajen","S1279800","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","3175000","False","Full Service","Please call or TEXT Valerie for an appt.  310.704.5164","","None","False","","2608","Estimated","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Sobrante","","2409","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://brokerageengine.s3.amazonaws.com/listing-media/vistasir/1685732946661_2409-VIA-SOBRANTE---DIRECTORS-CUT---SOTHEBYS---V1.1.mp4","","","1959","90274","2028","PVR1YY"
