 sophistication. Handcrafted interior appointments include a formal living room with a cozy fireplace, a grand dining room, and an expansive great room, also featuring a fireplace, all set beneath soaring vaulted ceilings that exude elegance. The gourmet chef?s kitchen is designed to impress, with a large center island offering plenty of seating, superb-quality finishes, and a convenient butler?s pantry. Hardwood and stone flooring flow throughout the home, adding timeless style and warmth. The primary suite serves as a luxurious retreat, complete with its own fireplace, a spacious walk-in closet, and access to private decks that overlook the beautifully landscaped backyard. Outside, the lush greenery surrounds a sparkling pool and spa, enhanced by a programmable lighting system that adds an enchanting ambiance to evening gatherings. The professionally designed landscaping and lighting, combined with multiple outdoor entertaining areas, creates a serene oasis for relaxation or entertainment. This estate is as technologically advanced as it is elegant. The home features new audio and visual equipment with six TVs, a Nest smart thermostat for easy climate control, and a state-of- the-art Sonos sound system with speakers throughout the interior, patio, and pool area. A Lutron programmable lighting system provides customizable indoor and outdoor lighting. The iAqualink app allows full control of the pool equipment, including the heater, jets, jacuzzi, and vibrant lighting, right from your device. For peace of mind, the property is secured by a Ring system with nine exterior cameras, while an iPad controller ensures effortless management of the home?s smart features. Adding to the community's appeal, Palos Verdes Estates is uniquely served by its own dedicated firefighting and police teams, providing specialized and prompt emergency services to its residents. With an abundance of storage, an advanced alarm system, and thoughtfully designed spaces, this estate seamlessly 