"None","0.1821","To see property disclosures please follow this link: https://app.disclosures.io/link/2205-Va-La-Brea-xi7b6zmm","Dishwasher, Disposal","True","162 - Monte Malaga","Unknown","True","7545009032","","0","","False","4","","","","4","4","1652","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","57","3498000","#ERR","01/04/2026 6:15:20 AM","","","01/14/2026 12:00:00 AM","02/19/2026 7:41:42 AM","","","12/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","01/14/2026 12:00:00 AM","02/15/2026 3:22:25 PM","02/18/2026 12:00:00 AM","02/18/2026 12:00:00 AM","","North","10","","True","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Family Room, Living Room","True","Stone, Wood","True","Central","True","Living Room Balcony","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.791774","Individual Room","True","False","","","3498000","","","3498000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.391906","","13","7934","Landscaped","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Park","","Assessor","","","SB25274526","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Deck, Patio","True","1","","None","False","","1065.16","Beautifully remodeled in 2022, this sought-after Montemalaga residence pairs Spanish exterior character with a clean, coastal interior including elevated finishes throughout. Arched windows and doors add classic architectural charm and enhance the home. A dramatic, light-filled entry sets the tone where vaulted ceilings, 9-foot doors and oversized sliders create an airy flow to a generous deck for seamless indoor-outdoor living. The living room is anchored by a striking stack-stone fireplace and opens to a spacious formal dining area, ideal for gathering and entertaining. At the center of the home, the kitchen is designed to impress and perform, featuring a huge island topped in Taj Mahal stone, quartz countertops and a glass tile backsplash. A full suite of commercial-grade appliances elevates the space, including double ovens, a steam oven, a glass-front refrigerator, a Wolf range, a Wolf built-in coffee center and a drink refrigerator?wrapped in a sleek, modern aesthetic that feels both timeless and current. Two bedrooms are located on the upper level with gorgeous wide-plank wood floors, including one with charming French doors and another with an en-suite bathroom. Two sleek bathrooms on this level showcase marble detailing and designer finishes for a polished, cohesive look. Downstairs, the home is centered around a welcoming family room with a fireplace and French doors that open to a grassy backyard, complete with space for a fire pit and a patio perfectly suited for a table and chairs. The lower family room also includes a wet bar area with a Viking drink refrigerator?ideal for movie nights, game days and effortless hosting. The primary suite offers a true retreat with vaulted ceilings, a dramatic statement light fixture and warm wood floors. The spa-inspired en-suite bathroom features a freestanding soaking tub, an oversized walk-in shower finished in marble with a rain shower head and two custom wood vanities. A well-appointed walk-in closet includes glass-front doors, built-in drawers and custom shelving. Also on the lower level is a dedicated office with a wall of glass, allowing you to stay connected to the home?s activity while maintaining privacy. A separate laundry room adds convenience to this turnkey residence. Thoughtfully remodeled, filled with natural light and perfectly positioned in one of Palos Verdes Estates? most desirable neighborhoods, this home delivers effortless style and everyday comfort.","","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Lauren","Yoon","VLEELAU","V8040","","","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","3498000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showings:  310-704-4014","True","None","False","","3284","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via La Brea","","2205","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","7330","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","Trees/Woods","True","","","","1955","90274","",""
