ms while vaulted beamed ceilings and hardwood floors fill the space with natural light. The formal dining room offers convenient access to the kitchen, which is anchored by a large center island with sink and plenty of room for casual dining. Quartz countertops, 6-burner Bertazzoni stove, luxurious cabinetry, designer tile backsplash ? all overlooking the lush backyard. The main floor also includes a cozy family room with a stone fireplace, built-in bookcases and double French doors that open to a roomy front courtyard and patio area. The main-floor primary suite is a true retreat, complete with vaulted beamed ceilings and oversized windows overlooking the incredible trees, yard and pool. The stunning remodeled bathroom has rich walnut cabinets, dual sinks in Cristallo quartz countertops, free-standing tub, honed limestone throughout, and an amazing glassless oversized shower. The lower-level hosts three additional roomy bedrooms, a full bath and a second family room with a fireplace and wet bar with plenty of counterspace while French doors lead to an oversized outdoor deck. The magnificent backyard is a showstopper, featuring a gorgeous pool and spa surrounded by mature, verdant landscaping. The built-in BBQ, grassy lawns, private orchard and various relaxation spots create a private sanctuary. Additional comfort amenities include a three-car garage with direct access to the home, central AC/heating with Nest control, solar panels with a separate solar-heated water tank, new roof and a 240-volt socket for EV charging. The ideal Peninsula location combined with the luxurious finishes and thoughtful design make this a perfect home for a discerning buyer.","Tile","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sharon","Benton","PVBENTSHA","v8498","","","The Agency","3575000","False","Full Service","Text agent Katie Cimmarusti for showings 818-404-0779.","True","Private, In Ground","Tru