nities.  The spacious bedrooms include an oversized primary suite with a fireplace and luxurious bathroom.  The handsome office has hardwood floors and the formal dining room is perfectly positioned.  The attached, 2-car garage provides direct access to the house and as a bonus, there?s covered parking for two more cars.  Some of the additional features include 3 masonry fireplaces, air conditioning, a wine cellar and much more. This property must be seen to be appreciated; very few homes exude such class and style.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Library, Living Room, Office, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Sue","Kohl","CLW-L00776","CLW-B2003104","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices California Properties","3870000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","","None","False","","4500","Plans","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Visalia","","2105","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","","Coastline, Ocean","True","","","","1972","90274","2152","PVR1*"
