"4","25456","Corner Lot, Cul-De-Sac, Front Yard, Garden, Gentle Sloping, Landscaped, Level with Street, Lot 20000-39999 Sqft, Rectangular Lot, Level, Sprinkler System, Sprinklers In Front, Sprinklers In Rear, Sprinklers Timer, Treed Lot, Yard","Biking , Suburban","Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Smoke Detector(s)","Assessor","","","SB23121468","","2","7","0","1","Owner","","","","Shed(s)","Driveway - Brick, Concrete, Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Single Door, Garage Door Opener, Off Street, Private, Pull-through","True","Brick, Concrete, Patio Open, Rear Porch, Wood","True","66","","Private, Filtered, Heated, Gas Heat, In Ground, Permits, Pool Cover, Tile, Waterfall","True","","1180.03","This iconic Tudor home in the Montemalaga neighborhood of PVE is a charming and nostalgic property with a captivating old-world feel. Situated on a corner, spanning over half an acre on a secluded cul-de-sac, this estate offers ambiance that is sure to impress. Upon arrival, you are greeted by a stately semi-circular driveway that provides ample family and guest parking. The expansive front yard can accommodate a wide range of outdoor activities for both children and adults. Upon entering the foyer, you are entranced by the stunning interior with its open and airy layout. Each space in this home has been thoughtfully and meticulously updated. The custom kitchen is a chef?s dream with Italian marble countertops, rich cabinetry, a built-in bread box, a pantry with abundant storage, counter seating, and high-end appliances. The kitchen overlooks lush foliage in the backyard, the pool, and 2 water features as well as an ocean peek of the iconic Queen?s Necklace.The stately dining room has a vaulted wood ceiling, room for a 12 person table, wood burning fireplace and overlooks the yard?perfect for viewing sunsets. The living room is where you?ll spend quality time?enjoying family, entertaining, relaxing, reading, or watching the fire burn in the exquisite fireplace featuring antique brick. There is also a separate light-filled office. With a total of 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, privacy and comfort are ensured for both residents and guests. The home offers a primary ensuite bedroom that showcases stunning views of the picturesque outdoors and the city lights view at night. The primary bath is spa-like with soaking tub (featuring a Fortuni chandelier), enclosed shower, and double sink vanity. There are 3 more bedrooms on the main floor and a completely separate suite downstairs with its own exterior door - superb for guests. The backyard features a pool, spa, 2 water fountains, and a brick patio with a built-in BBQ, sink, and refrigerator. Moreover, scenic views of the city, Disneyland fireworks, and a glimpse of the Queen's Necklace are available out back. The property also boasts a variety of mature fruit trees and raised garden beds. You can indulge in fresh fruit from apple, avocado, banana, lemon, orange, fig, plum, and 2 types of pear trees. The garage has been newly epoxied providing both a clean and functional space with laundry and wall to wall storage. This exceptional property blends timeless elegance with modern amenities in a serene private setting.","Shake, Wood","Attic, Basement, Bonus Room, Center Hall, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Workshop","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SBSANDJAM","Cora","Fischer","VFISCCOR","V7186","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","3900000","False","Full Service","TO SHOW CALL OR TEXT ROMA 310.422.0652.","","Private, Above Ground, Fiberglass, Heated, Permits","True","True","3305","Seller","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Novato","","2501","Place","","Tudor","Conventional","","8652","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, W