zing View of the Ocean, and City Lights all the way to the Mountains! ?Queens Necklace View? The house was designed with the intent of every room having a view, and they do! Completely Remodeled, and feels like a Brand New Home!!! The Kitchen and Family Room was Reconstructed with Steel I-Beam Construction in order to open it up and transform it into this Modern Masterpiece. Bi-Fold Doors in the Family Room, Great Room, and Primary Bedroom. The Remodel includes New Sewer/waste lines installed in concrete foundation, New PEX type hot and cold plumbing throughout, New Bathroom tile/slate/fixtures and Quartz Countertops. New Kitchen Cabinetry, Appliances, and Quartz Countertops. Utility Room with Closet and New Cabinetry throughout. New Lighting Fixtures, New Ceiling Fans in Bedrooms, New Carpet and Flooring, New Interior and Exterior Doors, New Double Pane Windows, New Interior Wall Surfaces and Painting throughout the home and Pre-wired for future Sound System. New Exterior Paint. New Exterior View Deck with Glass Panel Enclosure. New Water Heater and Water Softener System, Shall I keep going? Two New HVAC units, one on east side and one on west side. Squeaky Clean 3 Car Garage with New Openers, Freshly Painted Walls and Newly Epoxied Floor, complete with new base boards. Top it all off with New Copper Rain Gutters, front and back.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","DeDe","Hsu","PVDELIHSU","V8040","2.5","%","Keller Williams Palos Verdes","3950000","False","Full Service","Easy to show, Call First and Go Direct.","True","","","","3189","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Coronel","","1915","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(