m, including a large and private flagstone patio, with salt water pool, hot tub, built-in BBQ, pizza oven and fireplace and numerous gardens surrounding the property. The total square footage of living space includes a 420 sq.ft. non-contiguous guest quarters with private entrance and ocean views. With additional amenities too numerous to detail, come see your Palos Verdes dream home in person!!  Note:  this is a Trust sale.  All statements made herein must be confirmed by the Buyer.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Foyer, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","PVWOODHOW","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","4000000","False","Full Service","supra on front door 2/19","True","Private, Heated","True","True","4173","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Margarita","","1412","","","Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","7538","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Pool, Water","True","","","Blinds, Casement Windows, Custom Covering, Plantation Shutters, Screens","1964","90274","2144","PVR1YY"
