,"Private, Fenced, Heated, In Ground, Waterfall","True","Close Plus 2 Days","1509.3","Rare double-lot, view property in the prestigious Monte Malaga neighborhood in Palos Verdes Estates. This gated property boasts an expansive and flat corner lot and showcases a beautifully remodeled single-story home with views that will captivate you from every angle and showcase the 'Queen's Necklace.'The home's open floor plan highlights coastal and city vistas as the centerpiece of the property while the entertaining spaces and chef's kitchen are the heart of the home. The home features luxury appliances and custom designer upgrades and finishes throughout.The property's circular driveway leads to a two-sided drive-through garage adding to the ample onsite property parking for guests and events. The property features a private pool with spa and waterfall feature, 2 outdoor BBQ areas and detached storage building ideal for a workshop or home gym.Take in breathtaking coastal views stretching from Malibu to Redondo Beach, from the Pacific Ocean to snow capped Santa Monica Mountains in the winter. The mesmerizing cityscape includes SoFi Stadium, LAX, downtown Los Angeles and the LA basin, offering a visual feast for the eyes from sunrise to sunset.The property consists of two lots: 7545-009-019 at 22,017 square feet and 7545-009-018 at 7,615 square feet for a total of 29,632 square feet of mostly flat usable space. Whether you envision development, an ADU, RV parking, or other creative uses, this property offers both immediate luxury and long-term potential. This is more than just a home-- it's a unique opportunity to own a slice of paradise in one of Palos Verdes Estates' most coveted neighborhoods.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","","Lily","Liang","VLIANLIL","V8407","","","Strand Hill Properties","4300000","False","Full Service","Please call listi