 the impressive kitchen include: white shaker cabinets, nearly 9 foot marble island, marble backsplash, quartz countertops, Sub-Zero refrigerator, 6 burner Wolf range with oven, Bosch oven, microwave, and dishwasher. The first floor bedroom, with an adjacent bathroom and separate entrance, is ideal for guests. Upstairs is the primary bedroom with a fireplace, two walk-in closets, and a large master bathroom, including a separate walk-in shower and soaking tub. The two additional bedrooms on the second level have soaring ceilings and beautifully renovated en-suite bathrooms. The laundry room is conveniently located on the second floor. This home offers wide plank, French Oak hardwood flooring throughout, three gas fireplaces, a three car attached garage, two zone heating and air conditioning and new exterior paint. The spacious backyard accommodates two expansive Saltillo-tiled patios which overlook the canyon below and the ocean beyond.","Clay","Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Separate Family Room, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Lynn","Aglipay","VAGLILYN","PV8606","2.5","%","Compass","4500000","False","Full Service","Showings by appointment only with 24 hour notice please. Text Cathy 310-986-9805.","True","","","True","4420","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Lopez","","1517","","","","Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","7334","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Ocean","True","","https://ranchophotos.com/mls/1517-via-lopez/","","1984","90274","1961","PVR1*"
