 residence boasts one of the most breathtaking and unobstructed views of the Queen?s Necklace, South Bay, Los Angeles, and the Pacific Ocean. This thoughtfully updated 4-bedroom plus an office/bonus room, 3-bathroom Palos Verdes Estates property is designed for both luxury living and effortless entertaining. The expansive open-concept living area is designed to maximize the awe-inspiring views, with a striking all-glass wall that brings the outdoors in. At the heart of the space, a chef's kitchen equipped with top-of-the-line appliances is ideally positioned for both convenience and style. The home's four spacious bedrooms are located on the upper level, with a convenient laundry area. The office, located just off the kitchen and dining areas, offers privacy and easy access to the pool, deck, and expansive views. From the moment you enter, you?ll feel the allure of this remarkable home?whether you seek a sanctuary for your family or an entertainer's paradise. This is a rare and perfect opportunity to experience unparalleled coastal living.","Spanish Tile","Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kristin","Warrick","PVWARRKRI","V8463","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","4500000","False","Full Service","Contact Darius Majlessi for all showings and questions.","True","In Ground","True","","3559","Seller","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Monte","","952","","","Contemporary, Mid Century Modern, Modern","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Conventional","","7142","","Single Family Residence","","","Bay, City Lights, Coastline, Neighborhood, Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://vimeo.com/1095158231","","","1963","90274","1616","PVR1YY"
