es Estates. This gated property features a horseshoe driveway and water fountain that set the tone for the luxurious and serene lifestyle you will experience within. Upon entry, you are greeted by an impressive foyer boasting high ceilings, an intricately designed iron staircase, and imported Moroccan tiles. The main floor features a spacious open floor plan with beautifully appointed high-end designer finishes and ample natural light. A formal living room and true entertainer?s bar provide the perfect setting for elegant entertaining and casual gatherings alike. The bar includes 2 Marvel wine refrigerators, a Marvel ice maker and a Fisher and Paykel dishwasher. The expansive family room is equipped with a cozy fireplace and the dining room is conveniently located adjacent to it and the kitchen. The kitchen is a chef's dream, with top-of-the-line appliances, custom cabinetry, and a spacious center island. The appliances include Wolf gas range with 6 burners, a ceramic griddle and two gas ovens, two additional Wolf electric ovens and a steam oven, full sized Sub Zero refrigerator freezer and separate beverage fridge, a farm sink and vegetable sink, and two cove dishwashers.  Also on the first level, the oversized game room has custom motorized drapery and opens to the yard. Beyond, closed off by pocket doors, is the office with windows to the front of the property. Upstairs features a total of 5 bedrooms, each with a full ensuite bathroom providing ample space for family and guests along with a laundry room. The primary suite is a true retreat with a fireplace, sitting area, walk-in closets, balcony, and a luxurious spa-like bathroom with custom vanities, a soaking tub, and a separate shower. The backyard is a serene and private paradise, featuring a pool and spa and mature landscaping, a beautiful stone fountain, and ample seating areas to enjoy complete relaxation and sunshine. This exceptional estate underwent a complete renovation in 2019, with no expense spared. The renovation included custom lighting and flooring throughout, new cabinetry, doors, closets, security cameras, a stone facade, complete electrical rewiring and conversion to a smart home as well as upgraded finishes and appliances. The total cost of the renovation was $2.5 million, ensuring that this home is move-in ready and truly one-of-a-kind.","","All Bedrooms Up, Attic, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Game Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Sauna, Utility Room, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Rodman","Amiri","VAMIRROD","V7765","2.5","%","Merit Real Estate","5300000","False","Full Service","48 HOURS NOTICE TO SHOW. AVAILABLE TO SHOW EVERY DAY AFTER 11AM, TUESDAYS AFTER 4PM. TO SHOW CALL OR TEXT LAUREN 310.901.8512 OR ROMA 310.422.0652.","","","","True","7194","Seller","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Fernandez","","1505","","","","Conventional","","7334","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, Coastline, Ocean, Pool, Water","True","","","","1990","90274","1944","PVR1*"
