 seamless blend of opulence and sophistication, offering an unmatched lifestyle of comfort and grandeur. Spanning two levels of architectural brilliance, this 6-bedroom, 6.5-bathroom estate stands as a testament to modern elegance. The impressive double-door entryway leads into a world of refined living, where gleaming hardwood floors lead you to the spacious living room adorned with vaulted ceilings and fireplace. Here, you can indulge in the breathtaking coastline view that stretches beyond the horizon, with sparkling waves dancing along the pristine beaches and the enchanting city lights of Downtown Los Angeles. The gourmet kitchen is a culinary masterpiece, complete with a generous center island adorned with Wolf and Thermador appliances, plus a large pantry and laundry room adds to the functionality. An elegant formal dining area with built-in cabinetry provides for lavish gatherings, and a charming breakfast nook with a bay window overlooks the serene patio oasis, complete with a glistening pool and spa. The main level is crowned by the lavish Primary Suite, a haven of tranquility boasting panoramic vistas and an ensuite bathroom of sheer indulgence. Immerse yourself in the spa tub, surrender to the soothing steam shower, and explore the vast walk-in closet that caters to even the most discerning fashion enthusiast. Two additional bedroom suites on this level provide a seamless connection to the patio's enchanting ambiance. Venture to the lower level to discover an array of entertainment and leisure possibilities. A game room, resplendent with ocean views, features a well-appointed bar, while a sprawling media room offers movie nights, gaming adventures, or your very own fitness haven. Three more exquisite bedroom suites ensure that family and guests are pampered with space and comfort, while an elevator/dumbwaiter offers effortless access between levels. A collector's dream, the cavernous garage boasts space for up to nine cars, complete with a Tesla charger, providing a distinguished showcase for your prized automobile collection. Indulge in the epitome of coastal luxury living, where breathtaking views and refined design converge to create an unparalleled residence in coveted Monte Malaga.","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Game Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Michael","Sun","TRMICHSUN","PB19485","2","%","Pacific Sterling Realty","5700000","False","Full Service","Showings by appt only, contact listing agent with at least 24 hours notice, provide pre-approval letter or proof of funds for all showings","","Private","True","True","6219","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Rincon","","961","","","Contemporary","Cash, Conventional, Submit","","7142","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, White Water","True","","","Bay Window(s), Double Pane Windows, Roller Shields, Skylight(s)","1980","90274","1627","PVR1*"
