d by Hendrix-Allardyce and landscaping by Lifescapes, designed the Bellagio Garden.This property boasts a fantastic landscape with mature trees, fountains, a sparkling pool, spa, pergola, gazebo, loggia, and tranquil walkways.It was built with superior quality and attention to detail, including walls an average 12 inches thick.From the formal courtyard with a fountain through the Loggia to the front foyer, you already know this is a home built with labor of love.There is a spacious 2-story foyer, with a specially designed curved staircase surmounted by an Italian-inspired stained-glass dome.The living room has a vintage French fireplace, and voluminous windows and adjoins a music room or a meeting room.The formal dining room opens seamlessly into the front Loggia and with a swing door to the chef's kitchen that is fully equipped with all your needs! There is also a separate breakfast nook in addition to the banquette set.Truly a perfect home that meets any entertaining need from an intimate dinner party to a fundraising gala!A lovely sitting area with plenty of sunlight is next to a casual media room- specially designed with no reflections while enjoying TV during the daytime, two walls with built-in cabinets, displaying shelves, and a cozy fireplace.A stately library is next to the living room with elaborately designed ceilings/walls.There is a spacious family room/cabana with a full marble bar and lounge and then retreat to the loggia and into the award-winning resort-style garden.The upper level features a generous primary suite with a huge sitting room and view balcony, his and her section of a huge closet, his powder room in addition to a spa-like bathroom with steam shower and huge massage tub, and her toilet/bidet.4 generous guest suites complete the upstairs. The lower level has a room that was designed for a movie theater, a wine cellar, and the 6th bedroom suite,with its own entry and living quarters, a spacious laundry room, equipment room and storage room.Soak in the sun at the swimming pool, encompassed by the lush landscape and mature trees or enjoy the cozy outdoor fireplace on a cooler night.Additional amenities include multiple zoning central air,central vacuum,4 car garage, elevator, etc.Do not miss such a handsome house with its understated elegance and quality construction!","Tile","Foyer, Great Room, Home Theatre, Kitchen, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Multi-Level Bedroom, Separate Family Room, Utility Room, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes / LAUSD ? inquire","","","","","Carmelita","Luhrsen","sluhrcar","sb1303660","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","10600000","False","Full Service","48 hours notice to show, please text L/A at 310-902-7799 and advise with time of showing, agency info and buyer's prequa or evidence of funds. many tks!","","Private, Heated","True","","11332","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Paseo La Cresta","","1420","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Coastline, Courtyard, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Trees/Woods, Water","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/story/459470/u","","Drapes","1992","90274","2073","PVR1YY"
"","0.8479","Net sales price was was $11,077,000 as no buyer commission was paid.","","","162 - Monte Malaga","Unknown","True","7544019013","","0","","False","8","1","","","7","6","7","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Email","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Fax","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","538","10800000","#ERR","07/09/2023 1:09:05 PM","","","10/27/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/16/2023 9:32:39 PM","","","07/09/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/27/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/09/2023 1:39:00 PM","11/14/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/14/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","110","","True","","","","","","","Conventional","Dining Room, Family Room, Library, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","N/A","See Remarks","False","","","","33.784696","Individual Room, Upper Level","True","False","","","11995000","","","11995000","#ERR","310-678-7158","","Brett@PalmRealtyBoutique.com","","Brett","","","Zebrowski","","SZEBRCAR","","","","","S9298","310-545-2491","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","310-545-2490","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.399734","","5","36933","Lawn","Hiking , Horse Trails","","Assessor","","","SB23122642","","5","5","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","73","","Private, In Ground","True","","978.08","PANORAMIC ""UNBLOCKABLE"" OCEAN VIEWS FROM EVERY LEVEL!!! As you cruise along the easy curves of Via Coronel, climbing higher along the Palos Verdes hillside, the vivid contrast of lush green against blue sea comes clearer into view. At one of the street?s highest points a gated entrance leads onto a tidy circular driveway with old-growth trees and shapely green hedges. Welcome to 1724 Via Coronel, a Panoramic Ocean View European-styled estate that?s been thoughtfully refreshed to support an elegant mode of coastal living. At approximately 11,000-plus square feet, this masterpiece spans 6 bedrooms, 7.5 bathrooms and is positioned on a high-altitude lot that?s been as lavishly considered as its grand, sun-splashed interior. A tennis court and a resort-style pool deck with a bubbling spa and outdoor kitchen are among the highlights; so too is the ocean view fountain system inspired by the elaborate fountains at Bellagio. There are manicured green spaces too, designed for playing games on the lawn or quiet meetings over sun-soaked sunsets. So neatly linked are the outdoor spaces with the home?s interior, there seems to be little division between the two. Styled in the vein of European sophistication, the three-story residence is generously scaled and equipped with architectural markers of traditional luxury. There?s a grand entrance stretching 30 feet skyward that?s centered by a gold rotunda, filling the crisp interior with natural light and introducing the opulence of home. Floors of finely grained wood, set in a classic chevron pattern, contrast against sunlit white walls, and the home?s airy spaces are set apart by graceful archways and regal columns. Prime gathering spaces?like the refined salon where flames flicker in the gleaming stone fireplace; or the deep-teal study, where you can enjoy a favorite book beneath the classic, coffered ceiling. Dining spaces are free-flowing and modern, from a formal dining room that neatly adjoins the welcoming, sunlit kitchen that?s decked in gleaming appliances. Smoothly as the home flows for everyday family life, it also neatly shape-shifts into a versatile entertaining home. There?s a near-endless selection of spaces?from spacious, elegant configurations where one can host a fresh-air f?te for hundreds, to kid-friendly and contemporary areas, like the tech-savvy theater or the plush arcade stocked with classic video games. Not to miss is the tranquil cedar sauna, gym, yoga studio or the brick lined wine cellar.","","Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Game Room, Great Room, Home Theatre, Laundry, Library, Living Room, Primary Suite, Media Room, Multi-Level Bedroom, Office, Sauna, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brett","Zebrowski","szebrcar","S9298","2.5","%","Palm Realty Boutique, Inc.","10800000","False","Full Service","Call/Text Brett (310-678-7158) to show.","","","","","11042","See Remarks","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Coronel","","1724","","","","Contract","","8043","","Single Family Residence","","","Bluff, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Hills, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Water","True","","","","2022","90274","2052","PVR1YY"
