o the back patio with bubbling fountain. ?The family gourmet will enjoy the generous sized kitchen with plenty of counter space and stainless-steel appliances. Upstairs, you will find three generously sized bedrooms, two of which enjoy breathtaking Queen?s Necklace views. The?backyard has a large brick patio?creating a?peaceful?setting for outdoor entertaining. Below the brick patio is a low-maintenance turf lawn that wraps around the large two-car garage. Recent improvements include refinished hardwood floors and fresh interior paint throughout. ?This elegant home awaits!","","Den, Entry, Family Room, Formal Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cari","Corbalis","sclaycar","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2350000","False","Full Service","TEXT Valerie at 310.704.5164 to set up a showing time.","","","","","2342","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Del Monte","","511","","","","Cash, Cash To Existing Loan, Cash to New Loan, Contract","","6885","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean","True","","","","1961","90274","1205","PVR1YY"
"","0.1671","To view property disclosures follow this link: https://app.disclosures.io/link/1609-Va-Montemar-qzkc5p6m","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Refrigerator","True","163 - Malaga Cove","Unknown","True","7540018007","","0","","False","3","","","","3","4","1434","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","170","2435000","#ERR","11/14/2025 11:16:59 AM","","12/10/2025 3:42:32 PM","12/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/23/2026 2:37:10 PM","02/12/2026 12:00:00 AM","","11/06/2025 12:00:00 AM","02/10/2026 12:00:00 AM","11/19/2025 2:15:36 PM","02/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","02/23/2026 12:00:00 AM","","East","32","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","Stucco Wall","True","","Cash to Loan","Family Room, Living Room","True","Carpet, Wood","True","Central","True","","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.792966","Individual Room","True","False","","","2498000","","","2598000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.403836","","7","7280","Back Yard","Biking , Golf, Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB25256282","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Deck, Patio","True","32","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","912.33","This beautifully updated Palos Verdes Estates home combines comfortable living with refined details and ocean views. Behind a gated entry, a private front courtyard offers a welcoming outdoor space with room for a dining table and grill setup?ideal for casual gatherings or quiet evenings at home. Inside, the open layout begins with a bright dining area that flows seamlessly into the remodeled kitchen. The kitchen features granite countertops, custom cabinetry, premium stainless-steel appliances including a 6-burner Thermador range and garden window. A small peninsula provides additional bar seating for casual dining. The adjoining living room serves as the heart of the home, featuring hardwood floors, fireplace and a dramatic retractable La Cantina glass door that opens to a deck finished with concrete and tile details. From here, you can enjoy partial ocean views and the refreshing coastal breezes that define Palos Verdes living. The main level also includes a tranquil primary suite with oversized windows, custom shutters and a private bath, along with a spacious second bedroom and a hallway bath offering dual sinks, a roomy glass shower and custom tilework. Downstairs, you?ll find a third bedroom, another full bathroom, laundry room and a versatile fourth bedroom with its own fireplace, sink, built-in cabinetry and sliding doors leading to the rear patio and grassy yard. This flexible space works perfectly as a second primary suite, media room or cozy family room. Additional highlights include a 3-zone A/C system with two condensers, updated windows and doors, and an EV charger in the attached two-car garage. Just minutes from Malaga Cove Plaza, scenic trails, award-winning schools, and pristine local beaches, this home offers a thoughtful blend of function, flexibility and the easy elegance that makes Palos Verdes Estates so desirable.","Tile","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SBPAPIANT","Ana Horga","McLachlan","sbmclaana","SB1288550","","","Coldwell Banker Residential Br","2435000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments 310-704-4014","True","None","False","","2669","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Montemar","","1609","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural G