ssessor","","","SB25011078","","2","6","2","1","Owner","Kristina","","310-465-3993","","Driveway, Concrete, Driveway Down Slope From Street, Garage","True","Concrete, Deck, Patio Open, Front Porch","True","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","871.01","Perched majestically above the coastline, this exceptional residence offers an unparalleled living experience with breathtaking panoramic ocean and city light views, famously known as the Queen?s Necklace. This coveted perspective stretches along the coastline, providing a mesmerizing display of sparkling lights that curve gracefully, reminiscent of a necklace adorning the shoreline. Designed with an open-concept layout, the living room, dining area, and kitchen seamlessly blend to create a harmonious space that invites the endless ocean vistas into every corner. Expansive windows and thoughtfully positioned sightlines ensure that whether you?re preparing a meal, entertaining guests, or simply relaxing, the Pacific Ocean?s beauty is your constant companion.The residence is thoughtfully divided to enhance privacy and functionality. The upper level houses two spacious bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom, offering a serene retreat. Descending to the lower level, you?ll find an additional two bedrooms, each accompanied by its own en-suite bathroom, providing comfort and convenience for family members or guests. This level also features a dedicated laundry area equipped with a washer and dryer, adding to the home?s practical amenities.For golf enthusiasts, the property features its very own putting green, allowing you to practice your swing while soaking in the ocean breeze. The outdoor spaces are equally impressive, featuring three distinct terraces designed for entertainment and relaxation. Each terrace offers a unique vantage point to enjoy the breathtaking ocean views, whether you?re hosting a gathering or savoring a quiet moment by the sea. A long private driveway sets the property away from the street, providing an added sense of seclusion and tranquility.Beyond the property?s immediate luxuries, its prime location offers proximity to a wealth of amenities. Within a short drive, you?ll find four renowned golf courses, including the historic  known for its stunning ocean views and rolling terrain. Nature lovers can explore hiking and horseback riding trails within the Palos Verdes Nature Preserve, offering miles of scenic paths through diverse ecosystems. The luxurious Terranea Resort is also nearby, providing fine dining, spa services, and boutique shopping. Additionally, the area boasts a variety of dining and shopping options, ensuring that leisure and convenience are always within reach.","Tile","Foyer, Great Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Veronica","Xu","PVXUVER","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2485000","False","Entry Only","Property shown by appointment only. Text Dounia at 310-935-6340 to schedule","True","","","","2853","Plans","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Somonte","","797","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional","","6884","","Single Family Residence","","","Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic","True","","","Double Pane Windows","1956","90274","","PVR1YY"
