cond floor and opens up into the living room with grand white water views of the Pacific Ocean. The second floor hosts the Main bedroom/ en-suite bathroom, Second bedroom, Living room, kitchen, office, and guest bathroom. Enjoy a warm cup of coffee in the mornings and in the evenings partake in a glass of wine while you relish in the view of the ocean from the large balcony. Bottom level of this home provides two more guest bedrooms, family room, two more bathrooms, indoor laundry area, and spa room. Backyard has expansive tiled patio, two fruit-bearing avocado trees, a fruit-bearing kumquat tree, and another amazing view of the ocean!","","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ching Sze","Louie","A34047","30296","1.5","%","Louie Properties, Inc.","2590000","False","Full Service","Please call or text Agent for showing. Thank you!","True","","","True","2305","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Almar","","573","","","","Submit","","6886","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Underground Utilities, Water Connected","Coastline, Ocean, Panoramic, Water, White Water","True","","","","1953","90274","1229","PVR1*"
"None","0.2749","To access dislcosures, use this link: https://app.disclosures.io/link/504-Va-Almar-14684d9d","Dishwasher","True","163 - Malaga Cove","Unknown","True","7540012029","","0","","False","3","1","","","2","3","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3103787747","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","32","2625000","#ERR","09/13/2023 8:28:16 PM","","10/08/2023 2:38:19 PM","10/15/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/21/2023 2:01:15 PM","","","07/04/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/15/2023 12:00:00 AM","09/15/2023 1:27:55 PM","11/21/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/21/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","32","","True","Dining Room","","","Stucco Wall","True","","Cash to New Loan","Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","text agent","Supra","False","","","","33.79926","Individual Room","True","False","","","2698000","","","2798000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.399767","","1","11973","Sloped Down","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Watersports","","Assessor","","","SB23120973","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Concrete","True","30","","None","False","","925.27","Nestled in the prestigious enclave of Lower Malaga Cove with panoramic ocean views, this home has been recently remodeled to exude timeless elegance and modern sophistication. This captivating residence invites you to experience the epitome of luxury living, boasting panoramic ocean and coastline views from multiple vantage points. Upon entering the foyer, you'll be greeted by abundant natural light streaming through oversized windows and new skylights illuminating the spacious, open-concept living area. A cozy fireplace anchors the living room and has high ceilings, a bar area, and multiple sliders leading outdoors. Warm wood-inspired floors underfoot seamlessly flow into the dining room, creating the perfect space for entertaining guests, while the large picture window allows a stunning view of the coastline. The heart of the home is the recently remodeled gourmet kitchen. This kitchen is a chef's dream come true and is adorned with new top-of-the-line appliances, crisp white cabinetry, and Quartz countertops. For a more casual dining option, the breakfast bar offers a place to watch the kitchen activity. Adjacent to the kitchen is a cozy family room with sliders open to an outdoor patio, perfect for a morning coffee. The upper level offers three spacious bedrooms: a luxurious primary suite with a private balcony overlooking the ocean, a fireplace, and a roomy walk-in closet.  The en-suite remodeled bathroom is a spa-like retreat featuring dual vanities, a soaking tub, and a separate shower. Each additional bedroom is generously sized, providing ample space for family or guests. The additional bathroom on the upper level has been remodeled with designer finishes and light fixtures.  Newly installed skylights bring an abundance of light into the home.  Also on the upper level is an open-concept home office with built-in shelves and Queen?s necklace views. Elevated from the street level to capture the breathtaking views, the home also offers a direct-access two-car garage, a pad for extra parking, a dedicated laundry room, and a back patio for entertaining. Lower Malaga Cove is renowned for its serene ambiance and proximity to the Plaza, picturesque parks, hiking trails, and coastal access.","Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Shawn","Nejad","VNEJASHA","V7804","2.5","%","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","2625000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing instructions