s greets you from the moment you step through the front door.  The tastefully remodeled kitchen boasts cathedral ceilings, pristine white cabinetry, a charming window seat, and a casual eating area. Adjacent to the kitchen, the dining room opens seamlessly into the living room, where a cozy fireplace invites relaxation. Beautiful hardwood flooring adds an elegant touch throughout.  Mesmerizing views are showcased from the living room, dining room, and primary bedroom.  French doors lead you to a private tiled deck, offering the perfect spot to savor your morning coffee or unwind with an evening cocktail while soaking in the breathtaking vistas. The main level also features two bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a lovely primary suite adorned with specialized built-in cabinetry and a recently remodeled (2023) ensuite bathroom featuring a luxurious walk-in shower and dual vanity.  Descend to the lower level to discover a wine cellar, a spacious family room complete with a fireplace, bar, entertainment area, and a built-in work center. A cozy fourth bedroom and bathroom provide ideal accommodations for guests or family members. French doors from both the family room and lower bedroom lead to the lush green backyard and private jacuzzi on the lower brick patio.  Convenience meets practicality with a spacious laundry room and abundant storage options throughout. Additional features include a Spanish tile roof, built-in cabinets in the lower bedroom, laundry room, and family room, recessed lighting, Andersen windows, and a Culligan water softener. A two-car garage completes the package.  With natural lighting flowing throughout, this special home is an entertainer's delight, perfect for hosting gatherings and creating cherished holiday memories with family and friends. Don't miss the opportunity to make this extraordinary residence your own!","Spanish Tile","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary S