ean views overlooking a wide expanse of parkland. You can't beat the Malaga Cove location, just steps in any direction to great community features like Malaga Cove Plaza, parks, hiking and (yes!) the beach. The main living spaces upstairs feature dramatic, cathedral ceilings with new skylights, a wide-open floorplan and views from all over. Step out onto your front balcony to really enjoy the views. Inside, a recently remodeled, high-end kitchen takes center stage, with large island with seating, plenty of cabinetry and newer appliances. There's also a central atrium-style courtyard bringing in more light to the living spaces, featuring a hot tub. Three sizable bedrooms are on the upper living level, including one with built-ins for a home office. A fourth bedroom with its own bath is downstairs, and might function nicely as a guest suite, office or home gym with a view. Home features A/C with four zones, although you may rarely need it with all those ocean breezes. Comes with electric car charger and surround sound system. This home is a true delight for the senses, all in a convenient, central location.","Tile","Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","George","Fotion","VFOTIGEO","V7404","2.5","%","Call Realty","2735000","False","Full Service","Pretty flexible for showings, with at least 4 hr notice, please. House is occupied, dogs present.","True","Above Ground","True","","2474","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Almar","","340","","","Mid Century Modern","Conventional","","6885","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Connected, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Park/Greenbelt","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=596yZKJRhdU&brand=0","","Skylight(s)","1961","90274","1261","PVR1YY"
