 coastal serenity. Close enough to the ocean that the waves become your nightly soundtrack! Set in a prime Lower Malaga Cove location, this home offers panoramic, unobstructed views of the Santa Monica Bay, whitewater, and city skyline?just steps from the cliffs, a scenic stroll to Malaga Cove Plaza, a gorgeous bike ride to the beach or Riviera Village, and a mere two minutes to commute on/off the hill. A city owned side passage (easement) to the left of the property provides a natural buffer, allowing for more than typical privacy between this home & the neighboring property. This home is thoughtfully designed to make everyday living feel like a retreat. Nearly floor-to-ceiling windows fill the home with natural light & showcase sweeping views, while the fully enclosed back patio and lush gardens offer peaceful privacy. A remodeled kitchen features sleek finishes, a stylish butler?s pantry, & a cozy breakfast nook with stunning views. The spa-inspired bath oozes tranquility. The open-concept living & dining areas revolve around the views & open to an oversized front balcony; ideal for entertaining & relaxing alike. On the main living level, you?ll also find two bedrooms & a generously sized primary en suite w/sitting area & French doors that lead to a beautifully landscaped backyard. Downstairs at street level, there?s a highly versatile bonus space w/its own bath, private entrance, & elevator access to the main floor. Whether you need a fourth bedroom, second primary suite, guest quarters, media room, gym, or creative studio, this space adapts to fit your lifestyle. An added bonus, the home is equipped with seller owned solar panels; reducing (or eliminating) electric bills & your carbon footprint! Discover a lifestyle where every day feels like a coastal retreat?embrace breathtaking views, thoughtful design, and unmatched privacy in one of Palos Verdes Estates? most coveted locations. Welcome home to 556 Via Media, where serene living meets effortless elegance.",