 this spacious home offers a scenic backdrop for any occasion. Whether you enjoy a tranquil morning sunrise, an awe-inspiring sunset, or just a sunny SoCal afternoon, you will find it through one of the many large windows or French sliding doors throughout. With 4 bedrooms (3 en suite), and 4 1/4 baths, this home is perfect for any size family. The main living area's open concept is an entertainer's delight! Cozy up to the living room?s cast stone fireplace flanked by gorgeous custom cabinetry and shelving with marble counters, or open up the large French sliders and feel the ocean breeze while taking in the views. Set foot on the expansive front balcony from living or dining room and enjoy glorious views throughout the day and into the evening. Step into the elegant formal dining room and enjoy more ocean views and a second cast stone fireplace, offering an impressive space perfect for a dinner party or everyday dining. Alongside the dining room, the large open kitchen features a stunning, Tuscany inspired, custom-wine cellar with temperature control. The large, private backyard is not to be outdone. With an outdoor kitchen complete with BBQ, Salamander grill and spacious bar/counter with ample seating, it is perfect for family gatherings, impromptu summer parties or a more formal affair.  Relax around the large built-in firepit, showcase your golf skills on the putting green, or just unwind with a soak in the jacuzzi after a long day! Other highlights include; 2 flex spaces for office, media room, den, library or workout area, newer custom wood clad casement windows and doors throughout, custom shades and blinds, some motorized and/or with the top/down-bottom/up features, rear-facing balcony with views of the lush hillside, and much more. Centrally located to dining, entertainment, the beach and award-winning Palos Verdes schools. A must see!","Tile","Bonus Room, Den, Main Floor Bedroom, Two Primaries, Walk-In Closet, Wine Cellar","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unifie