"","0.4862","The existing structure is a tear down and financially not viable to remodel. This offering includes PVHA and City of PVE approved plans to build a new home - normally a procedure that takes over a year to complete. The Sellers have spend 3 years+ on this project and is including with the offering paid Permits, Plans, Reports, and designer specs. Agents, kindly consider the value being offered here - It typically takes 18 months to get your reports (topography, geo, silhouette/compatibility, etc) and full art jury and city planning approval with permits. Mathematically its 18 months carry interest cost at 75% LTV/Tax/Insurance = $365k. Plans/Reports are approx. $140k. Thats over a $500k value being sold with this opportunity! Buyer and Buyers Agents are recommended to obtain price quotes from local reputable general contractors. Images in MLS and advertising include renderings of the project and may differ from the approved plans. Accordingly, the modification of such photos are conceptual and Buyers/Buyers Agents to use alternative resources to satisfy themselves. Broker/Agent does not guarantee accuracy of square footage, lot size, ordinances, zoning, rent control, permits, use code, schools and/or other information concerning the conditions or features of the property provided by the seller or obtained from public records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personal inspection and with appropriate professionals.","","","163 - Malaga Cove","Unknown","True","7539030004","","0","","False","6","1","","","5","5","1830","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Direct Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Agent Fax","Agent Voice Mail","Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","27","3425000","#ERR","11/18/2024 2:17:41 PM","","","12/15/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/24/2025 5:02:57 PM","","","11/18/2024 12:00:00 AM","12/15/2024 12:00