 from the garage to the pantry with the push of a button. This is a rare chance to create a legacy home in one of the South Bay?s most prestigious areas. Enjoy quick access to Malaga Cove or Hollywood Riviera shops & dining, top-rated schools, the exclusive Palos Verdes Golf & Tennis Club, and scenic trails, all while enjoying privacy, luxury, and convenience. Don?t miss this extraordinary opportunity to build a timeless custom estate, perfectly blending modern design with panoramic views and an unparalleled lifestyle.","","Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Montemalaga","","Palos Verdes","","Anthony","Accardo","pvaccaant","v8542","","","Compass","3425000","False","Full Service","Please do not walk the property without notice - existing property is an occupied home.  The existing structure has several defects and agent to occupancy all showings.  East to show with short notice - Call/Text Tony Accardo (310)-855-3557. Being offered is an existing tear down home with APPROVED plans and PAID PERMITS to construct this beautifully designed Doug Leach panoramic view home.  Bring your clients and builders to the high elevation patio to see the sweeping ocean to Los Angeles basin views and visualize what could be the most unique $10M home once built (do the comps.. $1700/ft on resale value). NOTE: Landscape plans have been prepared however not submitted.  Its my understanding construction can proceed and full approval of these plans (or a modified custom version) could take a few months to gain final approval including various additional costs to the Buyer.","True","","","","5917","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One, Two","","","Via Campesina","","2812","","","","Cash To Existing Loan","","7540","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Golf Course, Hills, Ocean","True","https://masterpeace.wistia.com/medias/teud98swlr","","","2025","90274","1429","PVR1*"
