nean Villa privately set in the prestigious Malaga Cove neighborhood. Revel in some of the most magnificent ocean and coastline views, complemented by expansive outdoor patios and terrace decks for seamless indoor-outdoor living. Inside, the home boasts rich Maple hardwood flooring complemented by authentic Mediterranean tile work under vaulted beamed ceilings. The main level, beaming with natural light, also features a spacious living room, anchored by a grand central fireplace and stunning panoramic views from every angle. Ideal for entertaining, the chef's kitchen features high-end appliances, custom cabinetry, and a large breakfast island with unparalleled coastline panoramas. Adjacent, the formal dining room provides an elegant setting with vistas overlooking lush surroundings and the sparkling ocean beyond. Upstairs, discover three spacious guest bedrooms alongside the luxurious primary retreat. This sanctuary includes an ocean-view balcony and an exquisite spa-like bathroom with a separate tub/shower and ample walk-in closets. Outdoors, a generous patio invites al fresco dining, while a rooftop deck provides additional sweeping views and convenient access to the primary suite. Located in Palos Verdes, indulge in a rich community life that embraces outdoor activities such as biking, golf, hiking, and neighborhood horse trails. Experience the quintessential California lifestyle in this breathtaking Mediterranean Villa.","Tile","Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-C139612","Scott","Rosenberg","CLW-X86373","CLW-X8241001","2.500","%","Kidder Mathews of California, Inc.","3600000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Call LA 1,Text LA 1 ","True","None","False","","4464","","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Pinale","","2312","","","Spanish","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean","True","","","","1992","90274","1313","PVR1YY"
