 top-of-the-line appliances make cooking a delight, while the open layout allows for easy entertaining and socializing with guests.  Adjacent to the living room is a formal dining room, exuding elegance and sophistication. Each bedroom and bathroom have their own charm with the Primary being the star!  This sanctuary of relaxation features large windows that offer More panoramic views and a beautiful fireplace.  The ensuite bathroom boasts a spa-like atmosphere, with a great soaking tub and extra large shower.  There is a built-in Spa on the deck just outside for relaxing. Don't miss your chance to experience the essence of Southern California Coastal Living.","Spanish Tile","Primary Suite, Multi-Level Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Virginia","Butler","VBUTLVIR","V7151","2.5","%","Coldwell Banker Realty","4400000","False","Full Service","Please call Margie at 661-755-4001 to Show.  Easy to Show! Brokers Open scheduled for Tuesday Jan 30th. Please  do Not park in the driveway.  You can block it if you need to.","False","Above Ground","True","","3044","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","W","Palos Verdes","","615","Drive","","Spanish","Cash, Conventional","","8523","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Coastline, Ocean","True","","","","1936","90274","1215","PVR1*"
