 in the prestigious Malaga Cove area of Palos Verdes Estates. Imagine waking up to the sound of breaking waves and the smell of the Pacific Ocean.  From the moment you arrive at the property, you are stunned by the panoramic views!  Ocean, city, mountains and beyond! This property was beautifully and extensively remodeled in 2016 and again in 2022. This estate boasts 4 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, two living rooms, an office, a beautifully updated kitchen and lush landscaping. Upon entering the home, the main living area offers an open floor plan concept with new hardwood floors, a high end gourmet kitchen and beverage center, a dining room with a gas fireplace and a living room that has beautiful french doors that open up to the newly renovated patio that is an entertainer's dream.  Also on the main floor is one full bathroom and one full bedroom. The second level includes a spacious Primary suite with a built in seating area overlooking the ocean and an office, a third bedroom and a second family room/media room that leads out to a second viewing deck.  The large primary suite has a beautiful bathroom with a separate tub, shower, and walk-in-closet.  The bottom level offers an en suite guest room with it's own patio that is multi purpose.  There is plenty of room for sports equipment, back yard games, gardening or simply enjoying the unobstructed panoramic view.  All three levels include outdoor terraces that will allow you to enjoy all that California has to offer from sun up to sun down. This extremely sought after Malaga Cove location provides easy access on and off the hill, yet provides a sanctuary upon your return.","Tile","Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite, Media Room, Office, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Monte Malaga","","Palos Verdes","","Charles","Raine","VRAINCHA","PV8613","2.5","%","Coastal Legacy Realty Group","4425000","False","Full Service","Showings by appointment. 