and charm. The kitchen features a large marble island and two copper sinks. Perrin and Rowe fixtures, handblown glass pendants, Walker Zanger basketweave backsplash, 6-burner Thermador stove and built-in espresso machine appeal to the cooking enthusiast. Adjacent to the kitchen is a breakfast room surrounded by tall windows, allowing for abundant natural light and easy access to the private yard with a built-in BBQ and outdoor fireplace. The multi-level outdoor area has a spa with a natural waterfall, lounging area and Valencia orange trees. Also on the main level is a spacious office with built-in cabinetry, offering an inspiring workspace. Travertine balconies in the front of the home provide the perfect vantage point to take in the panoramic ocean and coastline views, while the custom ironwork adds a touch of artistry to the facade. The family room, complete with a stone fireplace and cabinetry to conceal audio-visual equipment, is the ideal space for relaxation and entertainment. Upstairs, the primary suite offers stunning coastline views, a fireplace and beamed ceilings. The ensuite bathroom boasts a soaking tub and stone mosaic details, while his and hers closets with luxury cabinetry provide ample organization. Perrin and Rowe plumbing fixtures, Waterworks light fixtures, stone clad shower and dual sinks give this space a spa-like feel. Three additional ensuite bedrooms on the upper level are finished with custom window coverings, romantic Juliet balconies, French doors and vaulted ceilings. The bathrooms feature Waterworks fittings, marble and stone flooring and luxurious cabinetry. On the lowest level, the three-car garage is equipped with an extra-large finished storage room with easy access as well as a bonus room that can be used as a workout space or office. Other features of this beautifully constructed home are coved ceilings, plastered-in vents, custom built closet linen armoire, built-in speakers, skylights, outdoor shower and gorgeous lighting.",""