mic views of the ocean, coastline, city, mountains, and the entire LA Basin. The view changes all the time, like a living canvas in front of you. Features include a two-story foyer, luxurious living room, huge formal dining room, gourmet kitchen w/ adjacent family room, wood-paneled library, a wine tasting room, and media room. Custom wood and stone flooring throughout, custom pedestal cabinetry, tasteful use of granite, amazing ceiling detail, and multiple zoned air-conditioning. Home features include 7 bedrooms, 10 Baths, 5 fireplaces, 4-car garage, 3 stop elevator, pool with infinity spa, fire pit, and tons of exterior patios and balconies making it the perfect setting for entertaining. All on a quiet cul-de-sac street with about 26,500 sq. ft. lot. It has mature landscaping and offers a bonus parking area. Property is fenced, gated, and centrally located with easy access to the Westside, any beach cities, or PV center. This extraordinary home comes with the location, size, VIEW, quality, and privacy...truly a rare opportunity! Some pictures are virtually staged.","Tile","Family Room, Formal Entry, Foyer, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palo Verde Unified","","","","","Timur","Tecimer","nonmember","NONMEMBERMRML","2.5","%","Overton Moore Prop","8150000","False","Full Service","Over night notice is a must, busy family, seller requests Proq or evidence of funds prior to confirmation of any appt. Please email to lilyliangpv@gmail.com. Please do not make appt with showing time, and will not be answered.  Many tks!","","Private, In Ground","True","","7465","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Horquilla","","629","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7540","","Single Family Residence","","Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Bluff, City Lights, Coastline, Golf Course, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/405128","https://vimeo.com/806079028/17f8f27926","","