"","1.18","Make sure to watch the walk through video provided in the MLS link. This property has undeveloped land directly below the sports court - large enough to build an ADU, guest house or more - call to discuss more. Please text/call Travis at 424.293.6963 for a showing or questions. Broker does not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided, including square footage, lot size, permitted or un-permitted spaces, and/or bedroom/bathroom count. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of this information through personal inspection, building permits and/or with appropriate professionals (i.e. attorney, appraiser, architect, contractor, etc.).","Dishwasher, Disposal, Microwave, Refrigerator, Vented Exhaust Fan","True","163 - Malaga Cove","","","7539032009","","","","","7","0","0","0","7","6","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","619-847-3927","","Judith@CanbyandCo.com","","Judith","","","Lovingfoss","CLW-C123632","","","","","","CLW-X83391","","Christie's AKG","424-249-7162","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","114","10800000","#ERR","08/02/2023 4:15:45 PM","","10/01/2023 5:53:21 AM","01/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/12/2024 4:25:13 PM","","","08/02/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/20/2023 12:00:00 AM","10/01/2023 5:54:26 AM","01/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","110","","","","","","","","","","Dining Room, Great Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Carpet, Stone, Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","","True","True","","","","","","","33.794372","Washer Included, Dryer Included, Inside","True","True","","","12988000","","","13988000","#ERR","424-293-6963","","travis@canbyandco.com","","Travis","","","Canby","","CLW-C121571","","","","","CLW-X83391","","Christie's AKG","424-249-7162","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.381016","","","51536","","","Automatic Gate, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Fire and Smoke Detection System, Gated Community, Smoke Detector(s)","Survey","","","23297039","","","","","","","","","","","Controlled Entrance, Driveway, Private","True","Patio Open","True","33","","Heated, Salt Water, Infinity, In Ground, Private","True","","1080","This private and gated estate is balanced on more than 1.18 acres of lush, protected land with perhaps the most sought-after view on the peninsula, The Queens Necklace. The grounds include gardens with a soothing fountain, a salt-water infinity pool with spa and sports court overlooking the Palos Verdes Golf Course. Retreat inside to explore 6BD/7BA with roughly 10,000 SF of the world's finest imported materials such as, 8' hand carved doors, an Italian stone spiral staircase, couture chandeliers, dramatic ceiling height plus multiple balconies and oversized windows with endless sunlight. Special treats include a 1,000+ bottle wine cellar which connects to a 6-seat movie theatre making for an easy pour before movie time. A surplus of good energy flows throughout a centralized courtyard drenched in coastline views stretching to Malibu. The expansive courtyard space and seamless interaction with the kitchen make entertaining large parties with ease. For convenience it's possible to watch your children swim from all wings of the estate. Quiet evenings are stunning as the sky streaks with vibrant colors while by nightfall the stars and coastline magically reflect off the Pacific. Retire to the 2nd floor with roughly 2,000 SF dedicated entirely to the master bedroom quarters. The vast layout includes an extended sitting area tailored for reading a book while admiring postcard ocean views. 2 massive wrap-around balconies with ample sunlight, vast mountain views, and an ocean breeze encapsulate the master bedroom, perfect for a private sun kissed afternoon. The master bathroom hosts his/her toilets, a steam room, walk-in closets plus a unique and secluded Zen Garden. You're a quick drive to world famous golf courses, romantic dinning, shopping, The Palos Verdes Shoreline Park, coastal trails and top tier schools. 710 Via La Cuesta is an extraordinary estate within a premium neighborhood offering a magnitude of luxuries - a must see!","","Family Room, Formal Entry, Great Room, Guest/Maid's Quarters, Home Theatre","","","","","","CLW-30794278","Raquel","Cavanaugh","RSCAVARAQ","RCOT","2.5","%","Century 21 On Target","10800000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Appointment Only ","False","Heated, Private","True","","10000","Plans","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via La Cuesta","","710","","","Mediterranean","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Catalina, City Lights, Coastline, Courtyard, Desert, Golf Course, Hills, Landmark, Mountain(s), Ocean, Panoramic, Peek-A-Boo, Pool, Rocks, Trees/Woods, Valley, Water","True","https://youtu.be/sxu0fPzK8PY","","","2010","90274","1472","PVR1*"
