 coveted Valmonte neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates. This home exudes classic charm, offering a glimpse into a bygone era while providing modern comforts for today's lifestyle. As you enter, you're greeted by a sense of nostalgia and character that only a well-maintained older home can provide. Original hardwood floors lead you through the spacious living areas, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The living room features a cozy fireplace, inviting conversations and relaxation.  The updated kitchen exudes functionality, with quaint cabinetry and ample counter space. It's a perfect canvas for home-cooked meals.  The master suite, ensuite bathroom, and large bay window looking over the well-manicured backyard.  Two additional bedrooms provide versatile spaces for family members or guests, each with its own unique charm and character. The second bathroom retains the vintage charm while offering modern amenities.  The expansive backyard beckons you to enjoy the Southern California climate, with a patio that's ideal for hosting gatherings or simply savoring moments of quiet reflection. Nestled in the Valmonte neighborhood, this home is part of a community that captures the essence of Palos Verdes Estates living. The tree-lined streets, friendly atmosphere, and proximity to parks, golf courses, and Riviera Village with its local boutiques and restaurants contribute to the neighborhood's timeless appeal.  With its vintage charm, comfortable living spaces, and desirable location, this is an opportunity to own a piece of Palos Verdes history.","Shake","All Bedrooms Down, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Stephen","Hodgson","SBHODGSTE","S5267","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1658000","False","Full Service","Supra on driveway gate.  Please be sure to lock all doors and turn off all lights.  Thank you for showing!","True","None","False","True","1388","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","