g value. Located at the desirable and private west end of the Valmonte corridor, Via Capay is just minutes from the charm of Malaga Cove Plaza and the coastal allure of the Hollywood Riviera, beaches, shopping and more. The existing home spans 1,937 square feet on a generous 7,829 square foot lot. With 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, the property is set on a south-facing slope that captures sweeping views of the Valmonte Dunes and the Palos Verdes hillside - visible from both the interior and the elevated rear deck. The house has a new roof, furnace and water heater. Refinished hardwood floors and new carpet. there is a separate laundry room off of the large 2-car garage and ample storage. Although the property needs updating, with vision and a desire to build something truly special, this setting is hard to replicate.","Flat Tile","All Bedrooms Up","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Cheryl-Lynn","Allison","PVALLICHE","V7186","","","Estate Properties","1810000","False","Full Service","Call 310-362-7166, leave name, brokerage and then go direct. Please leave your card on the kitchen counter. Be sure to use booties thx!","True","None","False","","1937","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","N","Palos Verdes","","2737","Drive","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected","Hills, Neighborhood, Panoramic","True","","","","1952","90274","1006","PVR1*"
