offers a blend of comfort, style, and city light views! Boasting 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and an inviting backyard with a large deck off the family room, this home captures the essence of serene coastal living.  Upon arrival, the meticulously landscaped front yard and inviting porch warmly welcomes you. Step inside to discover an open and airy floor plan bathed in natural light. The spacious living room features hardwood floors and a cozy fireplace, creating an ideal space for relaxation and gatherings. The well-appointed kitchen boasts granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and ample cabinetry, catering to both the culinary enthusiast and practical homeowner. Adjacent to the kitchen is a versatile dining area, perfect for enjoying meals with family and friends. The primary bedroom is a tranquil retreat with large windows overlooking the lush backyard.  Two additional bedrooms offer flexibility for a growing family, a home office, or a guest room, all sharing a thoughtfully designed second bathroom.  Step outside to the serene backyard, a true outdoor haven. The expansive back deck is an entertainer's delight, ideal for al fresco dining, summer BBQs, and relaxation.  On a warm summer evening, enjoy the city light view from the deck and backyard.  Located in prestigious Palos Verdes Estates, this home offers not only a comfortable living space but also the opportunity to be part of a thriving community. Enjoy the convenience of nearby parks, golf courses, top-rated schools, and local amenities.","","All Bedrooms Down, Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Steven","Watts","vwattste","v8491","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","1905000","False","Full Service","Supra is on the front door.  Please lock all doors and turn off lights when finished showing.  Thank you for showing!","True","None","False","","1887","Assessor","","CA","Closed","O