 a project which has substantial ""added value"" potential. Malaga Cove Plaza is 1/2 mile away along with several hiking trails practically at your doorstep. The home has been virtually untouched for decades and potential abounds! When you enter the home you are immediately struck by the panoramic views of the 16th and 14th fairways of the prestigious Palos Verdes Country Club golf course. Beyond you view the hills of Palos Verde Estates with its prestigious homes that light up at night. These views have been compared to the hillside views on the Amalfi Coast. Kitchen, dining and living room and fireplace are on the upstairs entry level along with 2 bedrooms, 1 being the primary bedroom. Downstairs are 3 bedrooms and 1 bath along with a family room with fireplace. Sliding glass doors from the family room give you access to the backyard with potential for an entertainment patio, garden area or a pool. Minutes from South Redondo Beach with its shopping and entertainment. Put on your creative hat and come and imagine. Trust sale with no court confirmation required. However, out of country beneficiaries need to sign off. We anticipate all extra signatures to be complete within 2-3 weeks of opening escrow. Contact L/A for offer requirements. Buyer and Buyers agent to verify all information.","","Family Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Victoria","Boddy","SBBODDVIC","s5161","2.5","%","BerkshireHathaway HomeServices","1935000","False","Full Service","Please call  Tiana Bisignano-Capper Before showing  310.503.2377 Supra and combo LBXs on front door.","","","","","2640","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","N","Palos Verdes","","3100","Drive","","","Cash to New Loan","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Golf Course, Hills, Panoramic, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1956","90274","1027","PVR1YY"
