urmet kitchen features stainless steel appliances, custom Thomasville cabinetry, sleek quartz countertops, subway tile, and a farmhouse sink. The kitchen flows effortlessly into the main living area, where beamed ceilings and a white brick wood-burning fireplace add character and comfort. French doors in the living room create a strong indoor-outdoor connection, perfect for relaxing or entertaining in the serene garden setting. A brick patio just off the living room is covered by a charming pergola with caf? lights and a built-in BBQ cooking area. The backyard, partially situated on scenic parkland, is framed by eucalyptus trees and lush landscaping, offering a peaceful retreat with direct access to the trail. The spacious primary suite has plenty of natural light and an ample closet space with built-in organization. The dedicated bathroom has been tastefully updated with subway tile, marble-topped vanity, penny tile, and designer fixtures. A flex space, perfect for an office, bedroom, or workout area, has French doors open to the lovely patio area. With a thoughtful floor plan and high-end finishes, this home is a rare find in one of Palos Verdes Estates? most picturesque and walkable neighborhoods. Whether you?re enjoying the natural beauty of the trails or hosting guests in the garden, this home offers the perfect balance of luxury, privacy, and lifestyle.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Jennifer","Caras","SCARAJEN","S1279800","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","1975000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments:  310-704-4014","True","None","False","True","1822","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Palos Verdes Drive N","","3700","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected","None","False","","","Shutters","1952","90274","",""
