This enchanting, tree-lined street is home to some of Valmonte?s most charming residences, and this storybook bungalow is no exception. Its inviting exterior, adorned with beautiful wisteria, greets you warmly. Inside, original hardwood floors and white wood plank ceilings create a delightful backdrop for you to craft your new home. The living room, with its cozy fireplace, overlooks the expansive backyard, while the downstairs family room offers additional light-filled space, all retaining its original charm. The large backyard is truly a gem, featuring a grove of mature fruit trees peach, orange, lemon, and apple each yielding a bountiful harvest. Surrounded by flowering trees and hedges, this private oasis provides a serene retreat. The primary bedroom has an ensuite bathroom, a generous sized second bedroom and formerly a 3rd bedroom, is now an office space with entry to the downstairs family room. The attached two-car garage also accommodates the laundry, adding convenience to the home. Discover why Valmonte, often blessed with sunny weather, is so coveted. Golf, pickleball, tennis, and horseback riding are all just a stone?s throw away.","","Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","","Palos Verdes","","Michelle","Tumanjan","SBTUMAMIC","S4164","","","Re/Max Estate Properties","2000000","False","Full Service","Go Direct. Text Tony Accardo at (310) 855-3557 for more info. Supra box on front railing. Thanks!","True","None","False","","1920","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Pima","","4036","","","","Cash to New Loan","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1955","90274","1460","PVR1YY"
