n Valmonte in the '50's lived in.  This is a spacious split level 3 bedroom 2 bath home in a highly coveted location.  The sunken living room features a see-thru fireplace, the updated kitchen opens into the family room and onto the sunny (south facing) rear garden, where you will find a sparkling pool, spa, and lots of room.  There are two bedrooms that share a full bath, and a secluded master bedroom with lots of closets and a handy adjacent office.  Continue up the stairs and you will enter an amazing, yuuuge walk-in attic.  Down a few steps and you enter the two-car garage with auto roll up door.  There are all the things that make Valmonte so desirable -- the best climate on the Hill, easy off-Hill commuting, quiet residential streets and, of course, the PV Schools.","Spanish Tile","Attic, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Office, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Joe","Alessi","VALESJOE","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2000000","False","Full Service","Occupied by very cooperative, long term, ideal tenant, but appointment required.  Out of deference to the tenant, please try to show between 10 and 5 if possible.","True","Private, Gunite, Heated, In Ground","True","","2321","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Multi/Split ","","","Via Solano","","4128","","","Traditional","Conventional","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Skylight(s)","1953","90274","","R1"
