vibe. Two cozy fireplaces, one on each floor, ensure warmth and comfort on cool evenings. The wood floors, smooth ceilings with recessed lighting, and plantation shutters provide the modern touch that many are looking for.   Entertain in the beautifully equipped kitchen, featuring maple cabinets, granite countertops, and top-of-the-line stainless steel appliances. Its convenient access door leads to the serene and comforting backyard, offering ample space for outdoor gatherings and leisure. The master suite is the full package, complete with a walk-in closet that can easily serve as a nursery or a home office. The large master bath showcases a luxurious tub, a separate shower, two vanities, and generous closet space, creating a spa-like experience within the comfort of your home with a view.  The lower level offers a bright family room and an updated bathroom (with shower), providing versatility and convenience to accommodate all lifestyle needs. The built-in bookcase adds a touch of character and functionality, while crown moldings and closet organizers further elevate the sense of luxury and organization. Outside, the flat backyard invites you to unwind in a private space. The backyard provides areas of shade and sunlight throughout the day which offers a balance of what you may need for the day. Nestled in a quiet cul-de-sac, this residence ensures tranquility and privacy, providing a peaceful escape from the bustle of everyday life. Beyond its remarkable features, this home is conveniently situated for easy access to PV hiking trails, Ernie Howlett Park, schools, shopping, and the vibrant city of Torrance.","","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Edward","Kaminsky","CLW-X72177","CLW-X2744","2.5","%","eXp Realty of California, Inc.","2000888","False","Full Service","Text Alan at 310-619-1628 or Lisa at 626-617-6