place, large picture window and the light-drenched breakfast nook with access to brick patio and big, grassy backyard.  Primary suite has a light and airy feel with French doors that also lead to brick patio, with ceiling fan, dual closets (including a walk-in) and en-suite bathroom with vaulted ceiling & deep soaking tub.  Two additional bedrooms share 1 3/4 bathroom off the entry hall.  2-car detached garage could serve multiple purposes as there is ample parking in the long driveway should you wish to convert the garage to a more suitable use for your needs.  Located in the highly sought after Palos Verdes School District with easy access to hiking and horse trails, parks, beaches and shopping...  A great place to call home!","","Family Room, Living Room","","","","","","CLW-10011421","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2050000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions:  Showing Information: Listing Agent Accompanies ","","None","False","","1742","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Nivel","","4020","","","Traditional","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","","","","1940","90274","1141","PVR1YY"
"","0.2648","BOM at no fault of seller. All information deemed reliable but not guaranteed, buyer to verify all. Listing agent is related to the seller. Contact Listing Agent 1 with any questions.","","","164 - Valmonte","Unknown","True","7537030014","","0","","False","3","1","","1","1","4","6332","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Direct Ph","Co-Agent Email","","None","False","Los Angeles","25","2055000","#ERR","07/06/2024 8:57:47 AM","","07/28/2024 8:49:28 PM","08/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/13/2024 4:36:45 PM","","","07/05/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","07/26/2024 8:11:42 PM","09/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","09/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","08/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","","25","","False","Area, See Remarks","","","","","","Conventional","Living Room","True","Carpet, Tile, Wood","True","Central","True","Ceiling Fan(s), Quartz Counters, Recessed Lighting","True","True","","Combo, See Remarks","False","","","","33.795417","In Garage","True","False","","","2399900","","","2450000","#ERR","","","catherineestates@yahoo.com","818-933-3177","Catherine","661-373-8564","0","Watkinson","","F207095169","","0","","0","FF7001051","713-561-3650","Real Brokerage Technologies, Inc.","619-248-6434","0","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.355984","","27","11533","Back Yard, Front Yard, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Yard","Suburban","","Assessor","","","SR24138179","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","Patio, Front Porch","True","33","","None","False","","930.29","Charming traditional two-story, with farmhouse feel, in the prestigious Palos Verdes Estates. This residence, cherished by the same family for 45 years, boasts a classic floor plan and breathtaking 180-degree canyon views. As you approach the home, you're greeted by a large, inviting sitting porch, perfect for morning coffees or evening relaxation. Freshly painted inside and out, this home radiates a timeless appeal. Step inside to discover a cozy living room with a wood-burning fireplace, spacious formal dining, remodeled powder room, and throughout the home you?ll find updated fixtures and finishes. The heart of the home is the kitchen, seamlessly connected to the family living spaces. It features quartz countertops, stainless steel sink, pantry with pull-out shelving, dual ovens, center island with a cooktop, and a custom-built craftsman/farmhouse style table. This kitchen has been the backdrop for countless family memories, from Thanksgiving feasts to holiday brunches, cookie decorating, and children's art projects. Upstairs, you'll find four spacious bedrooms. The primary ensuite offers stunning canyon views from each window, multiple wardrobe areas and a private bathroom adorned with dual sink vanity, marble accents highlighted with black finishes and fixtures. The rear yard is a real treat featuring two grassy levels, fruit trees, including lemon, orange, and fig, with ample room for a pool! Canyon views and no rear neighbors, where you can delight in the sight of soaring hawks, owls, and other native birds. Situated on a quiet cul-de-sac, at the end of the street you?ll find a path leading to the Valmonte Canyon Trail. This home is not just a place to live, but a canvas for creating cherished memories and a haven for enjoying the beauty of Palos Verdes Estates.","","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","F164001115","Laura","Coffey","F207099804","SR0232700","","","Real Broker","2055000","False","Full Service","Combo on gas pipe to the left of garage. Call/txt agent 1 with date/time of showing for combo. Please wear provided shoe coverings while upstairs.","False","","","","2209","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Pavion","","4420","","","","Submit","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Neighborhood","True","","","","1965