et.  Lush mature landscaping provide privacy and security on this large flat lot. The private bricked courtyard is a perfect spot for outdoor dining or a tricycle ride.  The back yard looks like a mini park.  Tall hedges and fences surround the yard, equipped with a large pizza oven but can cook so much more. This three bedroom single level home has a lovely open floorplan with views looking out to the beautiful backyard bringing nature right into your living room. Numerous skylights throughout bringing in the sun to every corner of the house.  The large master suite has a fireplace and vaulted ceilings with a wonderful oversized master bath and a small adjacent room for an office or nursery or meditation.   There are so many attributes to this lovely neighborhood with its friendly neighbors, easy flat walking street and walking trails, the Palos Verdes Golf Club and Tennis courts near by.  Award winning Palos Verdes School District, Valmonte Early Learning Academy, beaches and restaurants near by.  Ideal location for commuters wanting easy access off the  hill.","Shake, Wood","All Bedrooms Down, Dressing Area, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Penny","Wales","PVWALEPEN","v8542","2.5","%","Compass","2100000","False","Full Service","Showings will start on Monday, July 1, no earlier than 10:00.  Call Agent for appointment.  310 714-2554  Please allow two hours before showing. Sellers will vacate the house for showings.","True","","","True","1754","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Palomino","","3644","","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Trees/Woods","True","","","Blinds, Drapes","1949","90274","","PVR1"
