, with no neighbors across the street?just peaceful greenery and the golf course. Step through elegant double doors into a spacious, light-filled living room featuring floor-to-ceiling windows and a skylight that bathes the space in natural light. The front entertainment patio, ideal for al fresco dining and lively gatherings, is a true extension of the living space. Presented as a 4-bedroom home, the flexible layout includes a secondary family room (complete with a built-in closet) that easily serves as a fourth bedroom. The expansive primary suite features vaulted ceilings, a walk-in closet, a large ensuite bathroom with a private atrium, and its own patio with hot tub overlooking the greenbelt. Three of the four bedrooms showcase charming vaulted, beamed ceilings. Additional highlights include two cozy fireplaces, a formal dining area, a family room, a spacious laundry room, and a well-equipped kitchen with breakfast bar. The backyard is perfect for entertaining or relaxing, complete with a refreshing pool and large patio area. A generous two-car garage and nearly 11,000 sq ft lot offer endless potential for customization and expansion. Don?t miss this opportunity to create your dream home on one of PVE?s most desirable streets. Buyer and buyer?s agent to verify all information.","","Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","David","Lao","CLW-X54610","CLW-B2003114","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices California Properties","2142500","False","Full Service","Call L/A","True","Private","True","","2544","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Paseo Del Campo","","3225","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional, Submit","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon, Park/Greenbelt, See Remarks","True","","","","1956","90274","1035","PVR1*"
