s is a den to set up a second couch and TV set up for a sports house divided or simply needing your own peace. If you?re up for a project, the den could be the perfect space to add a second bathroom and make a true primary suite. Large sliding doors open up to a large brick patio where you can set up your outdoor seating area and admire the massive green yard. Summer living is meant for this backyard. Original Bungalow charm shines in the dining room with quaint built-ins, plus direct access to the kitchen with stainless steel appliances & quartz countertops. Not to be missed is the proper laundry room with a countertop for folding (a dream come true), laundry sink and Dutch door that leads you to your private backyard. If you didn?t already love it, you?ll also find a bonus room perfect for an office off the garage. And of course the basics - 3 sizeable bedrooms, 1 bathroom, 1 car detached garage, very close distance to Malaga Cove, walking trails, the beach and above all that, it?s looking a lot like your next home. Welcome Home to Palos Verdes Estates!","","Bonus Room, Den, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nick","Burdiak","PVBURDNIC","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2150000","False","Full Service","Call or Text Chris Plank to show (310) 849-1530. Please give at least 2 hours notice as owner works from home and they have a dog. Thank you!","","","","","1488","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via La Selva","","2728","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1940","90274","1022","PVR1*"
