room has hardwood floors, beautifully patterned Spanish tiles, a second fireplace, skylights, and vaulted beamed ceilings. The open-concept design flows seamlessly into the formal dining area. The kitchen, ideal for entertaining, features a center island with seating, quartz countertops, a newer gas cooktop, a Koran quartz sink, and a breakfast nook for casual meals. Double French doors lead to a private backyard oasis with a lushly landscaped yard, charming brick patio, pool, and spa. This outdoor space is perfect for dining, relaxing, and entertaining, offering room for a BBQ, seating, and more. The bedrooms are bright and inviting, with oversized windows, custom wood shutters, and hardwood floors. Additional highlights include newer forced air and heat, upgraded attic insulation, a rebuilt pool heater, newer pool and spa pumps, new interior and exterior paint, modern light fixtures, and a high-power EV charging station. Located in the coveted Valmonte neighborhood, this home enjoys proximity to the shops and restaurants of Riviera Village and the charm of Malaga Cove. With its prime location and thoughtfully updated features, this home offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chanel","Walker","PVWALKCHA","V7826","","","Estate Properties","2194650","False","Full Service","Text Cari Corbalis for showings 310-704-4014","True","In Ground","True","","1860","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via La Selva","","3428","","","Contemporary","Conventional","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","","1949","90274","",""
