the backyard. A beautiful two-way fireplace with a stone hearth is a focal point, connecting the living room to the elegant formal dining room. Both spaces feature multiple doors that lead to a private, grassy backyard framed by mature trees and complete with a charming patio illuminated by caf? lights, ideal for outdoor cooking, dining, or relaxing. The kitchen is a chef?s dream, showcasing a Quartz-topped center island with a new cooktop, an extra sink, and vaulted, beamed ceilings that add character. High-end appliances, including a Bosch double oven, make meal preparation a breeze, while the garden window above the sink offers views over the front yard. Adjacent to the kitchen, a cozy breakfast room with a built-in window seat and custom blinds creates the perfect nook for casual dining. Beyond the kitchen is a versatile home office featuring a glass-paned door for privacy and French doors opening to the backyard, making it an ideal workspace or retreat. Two large bedrooms, each light-filled with warm wood floors, wood shutters, and leafy garden views, share an updated bathroom with a tub-shower combination. The primary bedroom is a peaceful sanctuary with a corner window seat and an ensuite bathroom with a separate tub, shower, dual sinks, vaulted ceilings, Quartz countertops, and ample cabinet space. Additionally, the home has direct access to a two-car garage and a wired security camera system for added convenience and peace of mind. This delightful home effortlessly combines comfort, charm, and functionality in a serene, tree-lined setting.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2200000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showing appointments 310-704-4014.","True","None","False","","2188","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Navajo","","205","","","Contemporary","