lse","Close Of Escrow","1318.15","Beautifully updated in 2018 and perched in the heart of highly desirable, idyllic Valmonte, 113 Via Ardilla is an absolute charmer with the curb appeal, space, amenities, and the privacy you deserve. With recessed lighting above and hardwood flooring below, the dramatic, open-concept living/dining/kitchen area combines a light-filled living room with refinished fireplace, custom built-ins, airy dining area and massive, showcase kitchen island with skylight, stainless appliances, and huge amounts of storage space. An adjacent dining banquette is ideal for quick meals and offers even more built-in storage. The rear of the home houses three bedrooms, all with relaxing views of the lush yard. The light-filled owner?s suite includes a large closet and ensuite bathroom with walk-in rain shower The generously sized secondary bedrooms share a second full bathroom. The home?s garage reveals an unexpected surprise; an in-home office space that still leaves room for a vehicle. But the surprises don?t end when the walls do. 113 Via Ardilla?s outdoor space is a knockout; two paved side yards including one with a romantic courtyard and built-in BBQ lead to a large, flat, grassy backyard lined with mature trees that provide both shade and privacy. In addition, a trellis-topped patio area is the perfect spot for al fresco dining. 113 Via Ardilla is conveniently located just steps from Valmonte Early Learning Academy, the Palos Verdes Little League, in addition to hiking & horse trails. But this home?s combination of charm, location and value is bound to be noticed; make your move before this Valmonte stunner charms? someone else.","","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Shawn","Marchetti","SBMARCSHA","SB1366730","2.5","%","Pacifica Properties Group, Inc.","2200000","False","Full Service","By appointment only, Text Tina at 310-873-8462 to schedule","True","","","True","1669","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Vi