d mountain vistas. If you desire a turn key Valmonte residence, then this is a property you simply cannot miss! With 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, this home boasts a perfect location on one of Valmonte's most sought after streets. Step inside to discover an inviting open floor plan, featuring separate living and a large family room that provide ample space for relaxation and entertaining. The house exudes warmth with two cozy fireplaces, creating a warm ambiance during cooler evenings. The large family room opens to the brick patio area. Leaving the French doors open on warmer nights is a great way to enhance the indoor-outdoor experience. The completely remodeled kitchen has been fully updated with neolith countertops, custom cabinetry, updated hardware, a farmhouse sink, Thermador appliances and a custom walk-in pantry with a mini fridge and coffee bar. The mudroom is conveniently located off the garage with a custom drawer for storage. The bathrooms have been tastefully updated, and the custom maple hardwood floors have been recently refinished, adding a Mid Century Modern touch to the interior. The side yard features an outdoor shower accompanied by a deck and a convenient storage area designated for paddle boards and surfboards. Large attic space with ample storage and convenient laundry facility in garage. Natural light floods the family room and master bedroom, both of which boast French doors leading out to a generous patio overlooking the enclosed backyard. The front porch offers a delightful view to unwind and observe the children playing in the enclosed gated front yard or to engage in friendly conversations with neighbors. This home comes equipped with central heating and air conditioning to ensure year-round comfort. The backyard is adorned with apple and citrus trees, further enhancing the appeal of this lovely property. Plus, there is potential to expand and add a second story on one of the best view streets in Valmonte, making this a versatile investment opportunity. Families will appreciate this close knit top-rated Palos Verdes Peninsula School District, which offers excellent educational options for all grade levels. Additionally, the home is conveniently located just a few blocks away from the Palos Verdes Trail system, PV Stables and PV Country Club.","Wood","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","Palos Verdes","","","Allison","Lutz","CLW-C120204","CLW-X79013","2.5","%","The Agency","2200000","False","Full Service","To show: Call agent (Lee)   I'm available to meet you and your client, just let me know 310-920-7399","True","None","False","True","1641","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Pinzon","","4209","","","","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/445473","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=9hT1prf1t5D&mls=1","","1950","90274","1553","PVR1*"
