? most coveted neighborhoods! Escape to your serene sanctuary and secret garden, boasting breathtaking views of open space and twinkling city lights. Nestled in one of the safest cities, this Palos Verdes Estates home offers a tranquil hillside retreat, blending seclusion with convenient amenities access, in addition to one of the top school districts in CA. Turnkey with dual master suites on both floors and set on an expansive 14,789 sq ft lot, this 4-bedroom, 4-bath home offers the perfect blend of coastal living, comfort, and privacy. Welcome to a home that invites you to slow down, breathe deeply, and enjoy the best of South Bay living. Step inside to find soaring vaulted ceilings, a spacious open-concept living room, formal dining area, and a chef?s kitchen with stainless steel Viking range and hood, all boasting stunning canyon and city light views. The main level also features an oversized en-suite guest bedroom, a separate laundry room, and a half bath. The attached 2-car garage includes an extended driveway for ample parking?perfect for families and entertainers alike. Downstairs, you?ll find three additional bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a luxurious primary suite with a walk-in closet, private fireplace, and spa-like en-suite bathroom featuring dual sinks, a soaking tub, and a separate shower. Recent upgrades include new kitchen backsplash, fresh interior and exterior paint, finished bonus room for storage or home gym, and two expansive TREX decks ideal for entertaining or relaxing outdoors. The beautifully landscaped backyard is an entertainer?s dream?complete with mature fruit trees, drought-tolerant landscaping, a greenhouse, and direct access to scenic hiking and nature trails. Located near award-winning Palos Verdes Unified schools, walking trails, and just minutes from the beach, golf courses, high-end shopping, and fine dining, this home truly offers the best of the California coastal lifestyle.","Spanish Tile","Main Floor Primary Bedroom, P