in Miele coffee maker. Whether you're hosting or enjoying quiet mornings, this kitchen offers the perfect blend of luxury and function. Large picture windows flood the interior with natural light and showcase sweeping views of the renowned walking trail that winds through the neighborhood, enhancing the home?s serene and community-focused ambiance.  Thoughtful upgrades continue throughout, including elegant wainscoting, enhancing the home?s sophisticated character.  The Primary Bedroom enjoys an Ensuite Bath and French Doors to the backyard providing an easy escape to the Spa Retreat.  Outdoors, enjoy two distinct entertaining spaces: Front yard: Fully enclosed with a gated driveway, the expanded front lot offers a secure, spacious play area for kids and pets.  Backyard retreat: Designed for entertaining with a full outdoor kitchen, spa, firepit, and plasma TV area?ideal for relaxing evenings or lively gatherings.  All this while enjoying close proximity to; PV golf course, PV Horse Stables, PV Beach & Athletic Club, Malaga Cove Plaza, Pristine Beaches, Hollywood Riviera restaurants & shops + coveted award winning PVPUSD (Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District)! This is more than a home?it?s a lifestyle. Come experience the best of Valmonte living!","Tile","Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Patricia","Hedstrom","VHEDSPAT","V7946","","","Estate Properties","2350000","False","Full Service","Please Text Joe @ 310-738-3262 with desired time.  DO NOT USE SHOWINGTIME.","","Above Ground","True","","1774","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","N","Palos Verdes","","3609","Drive","","Ranch","Conventional","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood, Trees/Woods","True","https://youtu.be/b1zWp1GKdK8","","","1954","90274","",""
