e lushly landscaped backyard, where a large brick patio awaits, offering an idyllic setting for entertaining guests and enjoying the outdoors.  The upper floor of the home is entirely dedicated to a lavish primary bedroom suite, providing an expansive retreat. Here, you will find a generously sized bathroom adorned with a charming fireplace, creating a luxurious and relaxing atmosphere. Additionally, an adjoining office space offers a private sanctuary for work or leisure, while a spacious walk-in master closet ensures ample storage for your wardrobe. For those seeking tranquility, a private patio awaits, allowing you to unwind while enjoying the surrounding vistas.  Every bathroom in the home has been tastefully updated, showcasing exquisite craftsmanship and extensive use of limestone, further enhancing the overall sense of refinement and luxury. The large kitchen, complete with granite countertops and a center island, offers a perfect blend of functionality and style, making it an ideal space for culinary endeavors and gathering with loved ones.  From the moment you arrive, the residence exudes curb appeal, boasting a stamped concrete driveway that guides you towards the inviting entrance. The expansive lawns that stretch towards the house only add to the majestic presence of this extraordinary property, elevating its visual allure.  This remarkable residence in Valmonte's sought-after neighborhood is a testament to timeless beauty and modern sophistication. With its thoughtfully designed floor plan, enchanting outdoor spaces, and meticulously updated features, this home sets the stage for an exceptional lifestyle.  Located within an easy bike ride to shopping, dining, and the beach and also within the bounds of the award wining Palos Verdes School District.","","Entry, Kitchen, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kathleen","Huber","VHUBEKAT","v8526","2.5","%","L.C. Huber & Assoc. Inc.","2406000","False","Full Service",