"32 Inch Or More Wide Doors, 48 Inch Or More Wide Halls","0.3095","Home photos are when home was previously staged. Home is no longer staged. Easier to show on some days with a 2-4 hour notice. https://www.themls.com/showing/request/25522801 Property is a Trust Sale, sold ""as is"" with no repairs and no Art Jury letter orcompliance. Broker/Agent/Seller does not guarantee the accuracy of data, square footage, lot size, schools, or other information concerning the conditions or features of theproperty provided by the Seller or obtained from Public Records or other sources. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of all information through personalinspection and with appropriate professionals. PVE has a Homeowner Association. There is a discrepancy from the public records and a recent appraisal,","Dishwasher, Refrigerator","True","164 - Valmonte","","False","7539004012","Picnic Area, Hiking Trails, Horse Trails","0","","True","4","1","0","0","3","4","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","None","False","Los Angeles","83","2553000","#ERR","04/09/2025 12:07:34 PM","","06/06/2025 2:36:37 PM","06/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/06/2025 11:22:12 AM","","","04/09/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/13/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/06/2025 11:03:35 AM","08/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/05/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","83","","","Dining Room","","Block","","","","","Living Room, Decorative","True","Stone, Tile","True","Forced Air, Radiant","True","Block Walls, Cathedral Ceiling(s), Ceiling Fan(s)","True","True","","","","","","","33.803134","Dryer Included, Individual Room, Inside, Washer Included","True","","","Trust/Conservatorship","2780000","welcome sign, dinner bell in courtyard, small piece of cement by back door,","","2900000","#ERR","310-962-9905","","elizabethleeproperties@gmail.com","","Elizabeth","","","Markovitch","","CLW-C123014","","","","","CLW-X71845","310-247-7780","Westside Estate Agency Inc.","310-247-7770","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.388945","111x122","","13482","","","24 Hour Security, Carbon Monoxide Detector(s), Fire and Smoke Detection System","","","","25522801","","","2","","","","","","","","Driveway, Concrete, Driveway Down Slope From Street","True","","","1","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","924.33","Buyer paid all closing costs. Welcome to this rare one-of-a-kind home in the prestigious Grove section of Valmonte, Palos Verdes Estates! This 4-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home with  2,762 sq ft is now available for the first time in 50 years.  Situated on a generous 13,482 sq ft corner lot, this property offers an opportunity to create a more spacious residence in a highly coveted neighborhood renowned for its tree-lined streets and tranquil environment, with proximity to the beach and lively Riviera Village. This unique home, remodeled in 1975-77 retains many original details and invites new owners to add living space and create an extraordinary state of the art estate.This home is designed for entertaining and social gatherings; the indoor spaces flow effortlessly through beautiful french doors into the inviting courtyard that takes advantage of a protected setting for family gatherings and group functions. The expansive primary suite is a true retreat featuring a decorative fireplace with handcrafted tile, a spacious walk-in closet, and a serene ensuite bath. The additional secondary bedroom has a shared bath with the lanai` and the third bedroom is extra large with an ensuite bathroom and large closet space. The 4th bedroom offers flexibility as an office or cozy den, adapting effortlessly to your lifestyle. Uniquely integrated storage throughout the house ensures that everything has a space and place to be stored away. Designed for gatherings, the inviting courtyard with a spa leading into a indoor and outdoor flow with the lanai beckon you to entertain friends and family, while the kitchenwith its dine-in breakfast nookboasts charming peek-a-boo ocean views from the sink, adding a touch of serenity to every day. Additional conveniences include a dedicated laundry room with a half bath, direct garage access, an extra-large driveway for ample parking, and expansive green space. Nestled near the stunning Palos Verdes Beach and Athletic Club. Look into becoming a member at Palos Verdes Golf Club as a PVE resident with this homes address. You'll also find the scenic Valmonte Trail just a stone's throw away, seamlessly connecting you to nature and recreational pursuits. The neighborhood is celebrated for its exceptional public schools and a warm community spirit, highlighted by friendly 4th of July block parties just around the corner. With the beach, dining, and boutique shopping all within reach, this location perfectly blends tranquility and convenience.Don't miss this unique opportunity to become part of the Valmonte legacy and create cherished memories for years to come.  Seeking back up.","Concrete, Tile","Center Hall, Living Room, Walk-In Closet","","","","","","CLW-B31696","Elizabeth","Markovitch","CLW-C123014","CLW-X71845","","","Westside Estate Agency Inc.","2553000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please contact listing agent. Can show with a few hours notice, most of the time. Agent lives close by Showing Information: 24-hr Notice,Call First ","True","In Ground","True","","2762","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Anita","","2421","","","Mid Century Modern","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1951","90274","1008","PVR1*"
