"","0.2651","To view seller disclosures please click here: https://app.disclosures.io/link/3117-Paseo-Del-Campo-ktiq7bbw","Dishwasher, Refrigerator","True","164 - Valmonte","Unknown","True","7538015013","","","","False","2","","","","2","3","1811","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Cari","Corbalis","Sclaycar","S5267","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","5","2600000","#ERR","03/27/2025 10:01:33 AM","","","04/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/01/2025 8:29:21 AM","","","01/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/01/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/27/2025 10:01:33 AM","04/30/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/30/2025 12:00:00 AM","","South","5","","True","Breakfast Nook, Dining Room","","","None","False","","Cash","Living Room","True","Wood","True","Forced Air","True","","True","True","rail","Supra","False","","False","","33.801853","Individual Room","True","False","","","2598000","","","2598000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.376489","","5","11548","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Sprinkler System","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Park","","Assessor","","","SB25057973","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Patio","True","28","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","987.84","Nestled in the highly sought-after Valmonte neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates, this home offers timeless charm and sweeping golf course views. Set high above the street, this elegant single-level home boasts a commanding presence with a grand front yard and beautifully landscaped surroundings. Step inside to newly refinished hardwood floors that flow throughout much of the home, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The spacious living room is highlighted by vaulted, beamed ceilings and expansive picture windows that frame views of the lush golf course and towering eucalyptus trees. A fireplace surrounded by signature Palos Verdes stone adds a touch of local character and warmth. The formal dining room has ceiling detailing and a large skylight that fills the space with natural light?perfect for hosting dinner parties. The adjacent family room features a large picture window overlooking the backyard and French doors that lead to a private patio, ideal for al fresco dining or entertaining under the stars. The kitchen is designed for style and function, with a center island and sink, a second skylight, classic white tile counters, warm wood cabinetry, and a built-in double-door refrigerator. A cozy breakfast area provides a casual space for everyday meals with easy access to the backyard, which borders a peaceful walking trail. Two light-filled bedrooms with hardwood floors share a bright bathroom featuring a separate tub, shower, skylight, and crisp white tile. The spacious primary suite feels like a private retreat with a step-down entrance, ample closet space, and oversized picture windows that showcase more incredible golf course views. The en-suite bath includes dual sinks, a private toilet room, and a large walk-in closet. With its classic design, thoughtful layout, and one-of-a-kind setting, this home captures the essence of Palos Verdes living?where natural beauty, architectural charm, and serene surroundings come together seamlessly.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Peter","Lim","SBLIMPETE","SB1293130","","","Redfin Corporation","2600000","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for viewing appointments 310-704-4014","True","None","False","True","2632","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Paseo Del Campo","","3117","","","Contemporary","Con