"None","0.3171","Buyer's agent waived commission - approximate sales price if full commissions paid - $2.67M","6 Burner Stove, Dishwasher, Gas Range, Refrigerator","True","164 - Valmonte","Unknown","True","7538003016","","0","","False","2","","","","2","3","6102","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","16","2600000","#ERR","11/12/2023 9:04:39 PM","","","11/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","01/04/2024 8:56:40 AM","","","11/11/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/28/2023 12:00:00 AM","11/12/2023 9:04:29 PM","01/03/2024 12:00:00 AM","01/03/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","16","","False","Dining Room, In Kitchen","","Stucco","","","","Cash","Living Room","True","Wood","False","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","Pantry","True","True","na","None","False","","","","33.803876","Individual Room, Inside","True","False","","CC And R's, Homeowners Association","2699000","Vintage Light in bedroom","","2699000","#ERR","310.374.2100","","kyle@kyledanielsrealestate.com","","Kyle","310-378-1444","","Daniels","","SDANIKYL","","","","","S5543","310-375-9616","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-375-0583","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.369385","","15","13815","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft","Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB23210203","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Driveway, Garage, Garage - Two Door","True","Covered, Front Porch","True","22","","None","False","","1276.39","Welcome to Navajo Place, one of the best locations in the much loved and highly desirable Valmonte neighborhood. This upgraded one level home blends the best of modern upgrades with the original charm of a Palos Verdes Ranch home. Set back from the street on a nearly 14,000? lot backing directly to the telephone trail, one feels a sense of privacy being tucked away from the urban bustle while having quick access to the beach, dining and services. True to the period, this home has an impressive brick wood burning fireplace, exposed beams, wide plank white oak floors, and large windows that overlook the surrounding greenery. The family chef will love the updated kitchen, exquisitely designed with quartz countertops and Thermador appliances, and the adjacent pantry and laundry offer bountiful storage. Connected to the kitchen is a formal dining room, or dine directly in the kitchen. As you explore further, you will discover two spacious bedrooms that share a beautifully designed bath with dual vanity and walk-in shower.  Further down the hall is a third bedroom with a large closet and adjacent bath.  What?s really special about this property is the nearly 1/3rd acre lot.  Those that know Palos Verdes Estates will appreciate what comes with living on a large lot - a balance of space and privacy, in addition to the room needed to expand the home or create your own outdoor oasis. Car enthusiasts will appreciate the 3 car garage, or imagine converting some of that space for use as an office, gym, or even separate guest quarters.  Just beyond the backyard is the continuous 2-mile telephone trail beloved by four-legged family members and nature lovers alike with towering Eucalyptus trees that travels the length of the PVE border and connects into a network of trails throughout the Peninsula. With access to the top rated Palos Verdes Peninsula school district and located just blocks away from the renown Palos Verdes Golf Club, you can enjoy all the benefits and lifestyle Palos Verdes has to offer.  Schedule a showing today and prepare to be captivated by this unique opportunity to purchase a move-in ready house on a rarely available large lot in Valmonte!","Shingle","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Palos Verdes","","General","NONMEMBER","NONMEMBER","NONMEMBERMRML","2.5","%","NONMEMBER MRML","2600000","False","Full Service","Showing by appointment. Contact Kyle for showing arrangements ideally with 24 hour notice, afternoons preferred.  Brokers Open Tuesday Nov 14th","False","None","False","","2037","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Navajo","","3617","Place","","Ranch","Cash to New Loan","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","","","","1953","90274","1169","PVR1YY"
"","0.176","Official address is 2709 Palos Verdes Drive North","","","164 - Valmonte","None","False","7538014019","","0","","False","3","","","","3","3","1703","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","None","False","Los Angeles","22","2610000","#ERR","09/04/2025 12:50:11 PM","","09/13/2025 7:44:47 PM","09/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","10/21/2025 11:09:44 AM","","","09/04/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/26/2025 12:00:00 AM","09/15/2025 2:07:40 PM","10/21/2025 12:00:00 AM","10/21/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","22","","False","","","","","","","Cash to Loan","Living Room","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","NONE","None","False","","","","33.802243","Inside","True","False","","","2690000","","","2750000","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","","SBUNNBRI","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.384915","","46","7665","Yard","Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB25199097","","2","2","","1","Vacant","","","","","","","","","27","","None","False","","1290.16","Nestled in the heart of the sought-after Valmonte neighborhood, Scandinavia meet California-an architectural home where every surface, finish and line has been meticulously considered. Newly rebuilt by BuildingGeeks Design Group, it is a study in custom calm and craftsmanship. On a quiet and peaceful, tree lined street, you will find the home is framed by towering eucalyptus trees and rolling lawns that lead to a private, enclosed grassy yard. A spacious patio with built-in bench seating provides the perfect backdrop for entertaining around a large outdoor table.  Step through the oversized custom Sierra Pacific front door into a dramatic great room defined by vaulted, beamed ceilings and oversized windows that capture treetop and hillside views. Wide-plank Garrison white oak wood floors flow throughout, complemented by 9-foot interior doors and a cozy fireplace. The dining area, anchored by a striking glass pendant, connects seamlessly to the chef?s kitchen. Outfitted with Marble countertops, a marble backsplash and custom cabinetry, the kitchen also features Thermador appliances, a five-burner cooktop, dual Bosch refrigerators and an oversized island with seating and prep sink?ideal for both everyday living and hosting. The primary suite is a true retreat with high ceilings, a wall of custom built-in closets, and French doors opening directly to the upper yard. The private bath offers dual vanities, marble counters and a custom Concretta shower treatment. Two additional light-filled bedrooms, featuring double closets, and including one with its own en-suite bath. A versatile flex space doubles as a home office or playroom, while a hallway niche houses custom cabinetry for washer and dryer. The oversized finished two-car garage expands the home?s usable space, complete with laminate wood flooring?perfect for a gym, playroom or studio. Set within one of Palos Verdes Estates? most beloved neighborhoods, this residence balances thoughtful design and modern convenience with the warmth of Valmonte?s signature lifestyle: tree-lined streets, nearby trails, and easy access to the best of the South Bay. Alternate address: 2709 Palos Verdes Drive North.","","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","XZACH","Laura","Murphy","NONMEMBER","NONMEMBERMRML","","","NONMEMBER MRML","2610000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt Austin for showings 310-938-9167","","","","","2023","Owner","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Capay","","2709","","","","Cash to New Loan","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1956","90274","1006","PVR1*"
