crow","1260.75","This Beautiful Old Spanish custom home offers a perfect blend of elegance and functionality, elevated above the street to provide unparalleled views of the golf course and Malaga Hills. As you enter this sunlit residence, you'll be welcomed by walls of windows and French doors that fill the space with natural light. The tongue and groove vaulted ceilings enhance the open, airy feel of the home.  Impeccably maintained, this 4-bedroom home has a flex room that can serve as a 4th bedroom or den. (It is currently being used as a den) perfect for growing families or empty nesters. The spacious dining room with French doors, a bright and inviting kitchen and inside laundry complete this perfect Valmonte home. Step outside to enjoy a beautiful courtyard and ample space for organic gardens in the back. Additional highlights include a generous three-car garage and a practical potting shed. This home truly offers both luxury and practicality in a picturesque setting.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Den, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Deborah","Won","SBWONDEBO","sb1293690","","","Re/Max Estate Properties","2698000","False","Full Service","Thank you for showing.  Please do not disturb occupant.  First showings to be Saturday August 24th and Sunday, August 25th, 1:00 - 4:00 PM.  Thereafter, please contact listing agent a minimum of 24 hours in advance to schedule a showing.","True","None","False","True","2140","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Paseo Del Campo","","3109","","","Mediterranean","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Golf Course, Neighborhood, Trees/Woods","True","https://www.seetheproperty.com/u/471164","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=u