ic Records","","","SB24102814","2","2","6","","1","Vacant","","","","","Paved, Garage, Workshop in Garage","True","Cabana, Stone","True","21","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","1450.42","LOCATION! LOCATION! LOCATION! Between the trees and located on one of the most desirable streets in the Valmonte community of Palos Verdes Estates, you'll find this move-in ready single-level home. This enchanting property offers a serene retreat with 3 bedrooms, 2 baths, and a generous 1,896 square feet of living space on a sprawling 10,561 square foot flat lot. Step into this bright and airy home featuring a living room with a cozy fireplace, a den/office with built-in bookshelves, and a formal dining room complete with a charming 1936 built-in wine rack. The kitchen is warm and inviting with updated appliances and an adjacent breakfast nook, all centered around an open-air courtyard that brings the outdoors in. This unique design offers the feel of a treehouse, with views of the beautiful trees and the golf course right from your windows. The outdoor space is equally impressive with a spacious, tree-shaded backyard perfect for entertaining and a large, grassy area ideal for kids to play. The property boasts over a dozen eucalyptus trees, providing a tranquil, shaded environment, and a large patio area that offers ample room to expand. Situated in Valmonte, one of the most coveted neighborhoods, this home offers proximity to award-winning schools, hiking trails, and golf courses. It?s within walking distance to the beach and just a mile from Hollywood Riviera?s dining, shopping, and entertainment. The exclusive Grove section of Valmonte fosters a tight-knit community spirit, with traditions like the Fourth of July Block Party dating back to the 1920s. This property is not just a dream home but also a fantastic investment opportunity. The combination of its prime location, spacious lot, and potential for expansion makes it a rare find in today?s market. (< ~7 homes sell in the Grove per year.) Don't miss out on this chance to own a piece of paradise in Palos Verdes Estates on the market for the first time in nearly 30yrs. Schedule a viewing today and make this enchanting home your own!","Concrete","All Bedrooms Down, Dressing Area, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, See Remarks","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Peninsula","","","Joe","Alessi","VALESJOE","V7946","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2750000","False","Full Service","Thank you for showing! Call/Text Cliff Scherb 310-696-6648.  Please share contact info via V-Card to schedule an appointment.  Brokers open 6/4 11am-1pm Neighbors open house Friday 6/7 5-8:00pm. First Public Open House: Saturday and Sunday 6/1 & 6/2, 1-4pm. *Sellers have a specific price; come with highest and best offer which may be accepted at anytime. Please submit to Cliff@ScherbHomes.com  Pre approval and POF.","True","","","True","1896","Public Records","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Anita","","2805","","","Mid Century Modern","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","7539","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Available, Phone Available, Sewer Connected, Water Available","Canyon, Golf Course, Neighborhood, Panoramic, Trees/Woods","True","https://www.wellcomemat.com/mls/54fb0b2eeb141lm29","","","1936","90274","1040","PVR1*"
"","0.129","Garage was converted to a 5th bedroom but can be converted back. Seller is open to doing the conversion for the buyer. MLS square footage is based on a previously obtained appraisal report by the current owner. The plans on record at the Palos Verdes Homes Association & Art Jury indicate a square footage of 3,373. Broker does not guarantee the accuracy of the information provided, including square footage, lot size, permitted or un-permitted spaces, and/or bedroom/bathroom count. Buyer is advised to independently verify the accuracy of this information through personal inspection, building permits and/or with appropriate professionals. Seller will be happy to provide copies of the plans to any interested parties.","Dishwasher","True","164 - Valmonte","","False","7537032003","","","","","3","0","0","0","3","4","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","Preferred","Co-Agent Email","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","139","2795000","#ERR","06/27/2024 6:20:16 AM","","09/12/2024 3:47:58 PM","10/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","11/13/2024 12:42:13 PM","","","06/27/2024 12:00:00 AM","10/17/2024 12:00:00 AM","06/27/2024 6:34:44 AM","11/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","11/13/2024 12:00:00 AM","","","139","Double Door Entry, French Doors","","Dining Room","","","","","","","Living Room","True","Tile","","Central","True","Ceiling Fan(s)","True","True","","","","","","","33.797727","Inside","True","","","","2895000","","","3295000","#ERR","310-494-8222","","Afsheen@Dehlan.com","","Afsheen","","","Dehlan","","CLW-C113545","","","","","CLW-X83037","","Dehlan Group","310-494-8222","","Seller Reserved","-118.365275","48x105","","5618","","","","","","","24408929","","","2","","","","","","","","Driveway","True","","","60","","None","False","","868.01","Welcome to 78 Valmonte Plaza, an impeccably renovated home that's situated on a beautifully lush street in the highly sought after Valmonte neighborhood. This stunning 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom residence offers an unparalleled blend of comfort, functionality, and modern aesthetics. As you enter the home from the brick walkway, you are greeted by an inviting ambiance and array of contemporary finishes that exude sophistication and style while preserving the home's original charm. The main level features a beautifully restored living area that is characterized by high cathedral ceilings, an abundance of natural light, and a cozy fireplace with floor-to-ceiling stone making it a perfect setting for gathering with friends and family. The living room seamlessly connects to an L-shaped balcony through five sets of French doors overlooking a pastoral backdrop where horses can be regularly viewed passing by. An expansive dining room area boasting wood plank floors leads into a tastefully remodeled gourmet kitchen that is equipped with brand new stainless steel appliances, double ovens, a waterfall center island, shaker cabinets, and high end custom finishes. The uppermost level is solely occupied by an expansive 650 sq ft primary suite that is the focal point of the home. This lavish retreat is adorned by 14 ft beamed ceilings and dual balconies that open up to lush treetop views of the adjacent Valmonte Plaza Park. A spacious master bathroom acts as your own private oasis featuring a jetted freestanding tub, rainhead shower, double floating vanity, and generously sized skylight which provides for excellent natural lighting. Additionally, the primary suite is accompanied by approximately 200 sq ft of closet space, and a separate ensuite bonus room that can function as a variety of different uses such as a workout room, office, nursery, or double as an extra closet. Four generously proportioned guest bedrooms are situated throughout the middle and lower floors of the home, each offering ample privacy and their own unique feel. On the lowest level is a well configured second living area which is fully outfitted with upgraded fixtures like Soprano quartz, custom tile backsplash, and a built-in Thermador wine fridge. Retreat to the serene and private backyard that is perfectly suited for entertaining, soaking up the sun, or taking a relaxing dip in the above ground hot tub. Set within the award winning and prestigious Palos Verdes School District, the property is also ideally located just minutes from a variety of nearby amenities, such as Malaga Cove Plaza, hiking trails, the beach, a variety of great golf courses, as well as a host of shops and eateries. Truly a rare find in one of PVE's most treasured neighborhoods.","","Living Room, Primary Bathroom","","","","","","CLW-C143799","Michael","Pasqualone","CLW-C133489","CLW-X74052","","","Keller Williams Studio City","2795000","False","Full Service","Showing Instructions: Please call or text Afsheen at (310) 494-8222 with showing requests. Showing Information: Call LA 1,Text LA 1 ","","Above Ground","True","","3220","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Valmonte","","78","Plaza","","Mediterranean","","","","","Single Family Residence","","","Pasture","True","","","","1954","90274","1444","PVR1*"
