 Palos Verdes Estates. Known for being one of the most desirable neighborhoods in the South Bay, this area offers convenient access on and off the Peninsula. This delightful 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath home, with 1,867 SF, is set on a rare, oversized 12,339-square-foot lot on one of the most sought-after streets in the neighborhood. The property backs up to a serene bridle trail, perfect for peaceful walks, connecting you effortlessly to the Riviera or leading you down to Torrance Beach. As you approach, you're greeted by a spacious, flat grassy front yard. Step inside, and you'll be welcomed by a generous living room featuring a cozy fireplace on your left. Straight ahead, you?ll find a bright dining area and a beautiful kitchen with a charming breakfast nook. The home offers three generously sized bedrooms, including one that opens directly to the expansive backyard; the true highlight of this property. With plenty of room to spare, this backyard is ideal for adding a pool or expanding the living space either outward or upward. The long driveway leads to an oversized 2.5-car garage, offering endless possibilities for conversion into an office, ADU, or recreational space, all while maintaining ample parking.","Spanish Tile","All Bedrooms Down","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Chris","Adlam","VADLACHR","V8107","","","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","2800000","False","Full Service","Supra on the front door, GO DIRECT. Text Tina at 310-873-8462 for any questions","True","None","False","","1867","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via La Selva","","3229","","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Contract, Conventional","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","Cable Available, Electricity Available, Natural Gas Available, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Neighborhood","True","https://www.zillow.com/view-imx/67b077fd-bfae-4e39-b966-50f03bd006cb?wl=true&setAttribution=mls&initialViewType=pano","https://media.showing