pace that flows seamlessly into a formal dining room, perfect for hosting gatherings. The beamed ceilings add warmth and character, enhancing the home's sophisticated yet inviting ambiance. The expansive kitchen is a chef's dream, equipped with slab countertops, a Viking 6-burner range, two sinks, and a large peninsula that provides plenty of room for casual seating. The kitchen opens directly to the cozy family room, which boasts a fireplace, vaulted ceilings, and multiple skylights that flood the room with sunlight. This space is perfect for relaxing or entertaining, with easy access to the beautifully landscaped rear yard. The outdoor space is equally impressive, featuring a beautifully tiled patio with a pergola and a spacious grassy area, all meticulously landscaped and ready for outdoor enjoyment. Upstairs, the entire level is dedicated to the luxurious primary suite. The spacious bedroom overlooks the serene rear yard and has sliding glass doors open to a private deck. The spa-like en-suite bathroom is a sanctuary, featuring a soaking tub, an extra-large shower, dual sinks with a beautiful stone countertop, heated marble floors, and rich custom cabinetry. A walk-in closet adorned with glass-front cabinets connects the bedroom and bathroom, offering both style and functionality. The lower level houses two additional bedrooms, each thoughtfully designed with built-in cabinetry details, a cozy nook for a bed, and a charming built-in bench beneath the window. These bedrooms share a beautifully updated bathroom with designer tile, custom lighting, and high-end fixtures. On the lowest level, you'll find a home office, perfect for remote work or study, and an enviable laundry room with ample counter space, custom cabinetry, a sink, and hanging space for all your laundry needs. With direct access to the pristine garage, this meticulous home is move-in ready. Additional features include a tankless water heater, upgraded HVAC system, and a ring security system that ensures modern comfort and energy efficiency.","Tile","Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","OCBLACNAT","Spencer","Snyder","RSSNYDRAW","RSNB","","","The Agency","2800000","False","Full Service","Text Cari Corbalis for showing appointments:  310-704-4014","True","None","False","","3012","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","N","Palos Verdes","","3005","Drive","","Contemporary","Conventional","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Golf Course, Park/Greenbelt","True","","","","1976","90274","",""
