professional grade appliances.  The pretty powder room is conveniently down the hall.  Upstairs is the primary suite with a new spa like bath with dual sinks, soak tub and shower.  Three additional bedrooms and two more baths complete this level.  The lower level consists of a gym room and a fifth bedroom and bath both with access to the veranda.   The fab family room with fireplace opens up to the covered patio and wraparound sun deck with multiple seating areas, fire pit, bubbling jacuzzi and gorgeous grassy backyard.  A private path leads you under a trellised grape arbor, past a flowing fountain to a custom-built tree house.  Beyond is the perfect place to increase the size of your vineyard.  Cheers!","","Entry, Exercise Room, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Sun","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Kyle","Daniels","SDANIKYL","S5543","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2850000","False","Full Service","Please call Kurt Allen for instructions to show - 310-200-5280.","","Above Ground","True","","3696","Estimated","","CA","Closed","Three Or More ","","","Via Alondra","","4212","","","","Conventional","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","","Canyon","True","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=gS3VBDr14Xi","","","1960","90274","1545","PVR1*"
