countertops and stainless appliances, and opens directly to the warm, comfortable family room with a charming brick fireplace. A built-in breakfast booth is perfectly positioned for casual meals and morning coffee. French doors lead to a large brick deck and a spacious backyard complete with an outdoor fireplace.  The bonus room off the backyard is currently used as a gym.  Upstairs, a traditional staircase leads to four generous bedrooms and three full bathrooms. The luxurious primary suite offers a vaulted ceiling, its own fireplace, and a serene sitting room;  your perfect retreat. Just minutes from Palos Verdes Golf Club, Malaga Cove Plaza, and the beach, this classic Valmonte home offers the best of coastal living in one of the Peninsula?s most sought-after neighborhoods.","","Exercise Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Clifford","Scherb","SBSCHECLI","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","2900000","False","Full Service","TEXT Valerie:  310.704.5164","True","None","False","","3044","Plans","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via La Selva","","2552","","","Cape Cod","Cash to New Loan","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","","Golf Course, Neighborhood","True","","","","1954","90274","",""
"None","0.1856","This is a fantastic property and definitely worth showing your clients.  Square footage per the plans show 2503 sqft. while tax records show 2460 sqft. Common Q&A - There is direct access from the garage. Also, the sellers had plans approved through PVHA for a front balcony and new patio doors and patio.  Those plans are available to view. Please provide proof of funds/loan pre-approval with offer. Thanks for checking it out!","6 Burner Stove, Barbecue, Electric Oven, Microwave, Refrigerator","True","164 - Valmonte","Special Assessments","True","7539004005","Golf Course, Tennis Court(s), Horse Trails, Call for Rules","0","","False","3","1","","","2","4","1602","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Text Message","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","None","False","Los Angeles","26","2935000","#ERR","02/23/2024 11:23:06 AM","","","03/20/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/12/2024 6:34:19 PM","","","02/22/2024 12:00:00 AM","03/20/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/12/2024 6:34:07 PM","04/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","04/12/2024 12:00:00 AM","","Southwest","26","","False","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","Rain Gutters","Drywall Walls, Stucco, Wood Siding","Wood","True","","Cash to New Loan","Living Room","True","Vinyl","True","Central","True","Ceiling Fan(s), Open Floorplan, Stone Counters","True","True","Call listing agent","Call Listing Office, Supra","False","","","","33.803472","Dryer Included, In Garage, Washer Included","True","False","","CC And R's, Homeowners Association","2950000","","","2950000","#ERR","310.374.2100","","kyle@kyledanielsrealestate.com","","Kyle","310-378-1444","","Daniels","","SDANIKYL","","","","","S5543","310-375-9616","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-375-0583","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.389231","","4","8086","Gentle Sloping, Landscaped, Lawn, Lot 6500-9999, Sprinklers Timer, Up Slope from Street","Biking , Golf, Hiking , Watersports, Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB24037188","","2","2","2","1","Vacant","","","","","Driveway Up Slope From Street, Garage, Garage Faces Side, Garage - Two Door","True","Patio, Stone","True","7","","Private, Heated, Gas Heat, In Ground","True","","1172.59","Experience indoor-outdoor living at its best in this updated home with a resort-like backyard located just minutes from the beach in the Valmonte Grove.  With over $500,000 in recent updates including an upscale kitchen, open floor plan with 2 living areas, and an entertainer?s dream of a backyard with pool and spa, your friends and family will be inviting themselves over every chance they get.  The custom-built kitchen is the perfect place to entertain friends around the large central island with waterfall quartz counters, state-of-the-art appliances, or enjoy poolside dining on a warm afternoon.  Directly off the kitchen you?ll find two spacious living areas and a dining room that overlooks the pool.  Upstairs features 4 bedrooms including an oversized primary suite with vaulted ceilings and en-suite bath with dual vanities and both a walk-in shower and separate tub.  Enjoy late afternoon sunsets through the Eucalyptus trees of the main bedroom. Two of the upstairs bedrooms pick up views of the blue waters of the Pacific Ocean. The outside spacious front lawn and the surrounding yard is adorned with fruit trees, as well as an edible garden that melds perfectly with the manicured grounds.  There?s no better place to relax after a day at the beach than the perfectly designed backyard with a salt water heated pool and spa as well as a poolside fire pit and top of the line grill.  What?s more, this location offers the best of both Valmonte and The Beach with its greenery and canopy of trees, while being just a short bike ride to the sand, surf, shops and dining of the Riviera village and Malaga Cove Plaza.  Designed around an active lifestyle, you?ll have to choose between going surfing, hiking the nearby trails, running along the Esplanade, jumping on the bike for a ride along the beach, or playing a round of golf at the PV Golf Club.  With top-rated schools and easy access on and off The Hill, come see what the best of coastal living looks like in Palos Verdes Estates.","Concrete, Tile","All Bedrooms Up, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Brittny","Burford","STACKBRI","S5251","2.5","%","RE/MAX Estate Properties","2935000","False","Full Service","Contact Kyle for showing.  Brokers Open Tuesday 2/27 11-1","True","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","True","2503","Plans","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Anita","","2415","","","Traditional","Cash to New Loan","","6882","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","Ocean, Peek-A-Boo","True","","","Blinds, Double Pane Windows","1974","90274","1008","PVR1*"
