rge driveway.  The outdoor spaces include a lushly landscaped front yard with fire-pit, as well as a great side yard with mature fruit trees, and a back patio with built-in BBQ grill and entertaining areas.  Last, but not least, the secluded spa is perfect for escaping at the end of a long day.  Located across the street from the Palos Verdes Little League fields, it?s the epitome of the Valmonte lifestyle!","","Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nicole","Pletkovich","pvpletnic","v8460","","","Keller Williams Realty","2950000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","True","Private, Above Ground","True","","2436","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Alcance","","300","","","","Cash to New Loan","","7143","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1950","90274","1105","PVR1*"
