"","0.2853","https://app.disclosures.io/link/3215-Va-La-Selva-95mlh23x for disclosures and inspections","Dishwasher","True","164 - Valmonte","Unknown","True","7538009013","Other","0","","False","3","","","","3","4","1801","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","3103787747","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","SBUNNBRI","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","6","3222610","#ERR","07/27/2023 5:46:02 PM","","","08/02/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2023 12:04:41 PM","","","07/27/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/02/2023 12:00:00 AM","07/27/2023 2:38:19 PM","08/23/2023 12:00:00 AM","08/23/2023 12:00:00 AM","","","6","","True","Breakfast Counter / Bar, Dining Room","","","","","","Cash","Living Room","True","Brick, Wood","True","Central","True","High Ceilings","True","True","none","None","False","","","","33.803902","In Garage","True","False","","","3198000","","","3198000","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","","SCLAYCAR","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.375553","","16","12427","Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Level","Biking , Golf, Hiking ","","Assessor","","","SB23133606","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Patio","True","24","","None","False","","1172.71","Welcome to this exquisite house for sale in Valmonte, one of the most sought-after neighborhoods in Palos Verdes Estates. Located on one of the area?s best streets, this property boasts a unique combination of charm, space, and luxurious amenities. As you approach the home, you'll be greeted by an oversized double lot with a huge grassy front yard, ample outdoor activities space, fantastic curb appeal, a newer roof and driveway. A charming porch at the front of the house is a perfect spot to sit and enjoy the friendly neighborhood atmosphere.  Newly refinished hardwood floors that exude warmth and elegance are throughout the interior. Skylights scattered strategically fill the space with natural light, giving a bright and airy ambiance. Custom shutters add a touch of sophistication.  You'll find a beautifully designed home office featuring wainscoting details and large windows that provide a productive workspace. The spacious kitchen combines functionality with aesthetics, equipped with a farmhouse sink and glass-front cabinetry. It seamlessly opens up to a formal dining area and a family room with a cozy fireplace, adding warmth and comfort during cooler evenings. The family room's vaulted, beamed ceilings and charming French doors lead out to the backyard, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor flow and making it ideal for gatherings and entertaining. The large private rear yard is a true oasis, featuring a sports court and an additional lush grassy area, perfect for children to play and for entertaining guests. Step onto the covered patio, equipped with an outdoor kitchen, providing an ideal setting for al fresco dining while overlooking the mature landscaping that envelops the property. Adjacent to the main living area, there's an additional large family room thoughtfully set up as a media room, complete with custom bookcases, built-in speakers, and recessed lighting, providing the perfect setting for movie nights and relaxation. The primary suite is a private sanctuary featuring a large walk-in closet with custom organization, exposed wood ceilings, and direct access to the backyard. The en-suite bathroom offers a retreat with its spacious layout and upscale amenities. The Valmonte neighborhood is renowned for its excellent location, providing quick access to the beach and nearby off-hill locations. Residents enjoy a serene and upscale community while still being close to urban amenities, making this property an ideal place to call home.","Tile","All Bedrooms Down, Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Justin","Thomas","SBTHOMJUS","S6107","2.5","%","Beach City Brokers","3222610","False","Full Service","Text agent Cari Corbalis for showings 310-704-4014.  Open House July 29 & 30, 1-4pm","True","None","False","","2748","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via La Selva","","3215","","","Contemporary","Contract","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","None","False","https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=4jE4YcC4aqC","","","1952","90274","1051","PVR1YY"
