 heart of Valmonte. Ideally located on one of the most desirable streets in the area, this enchanting Spanish-style residence exudes charm and character at every turn. Nestled on a lush corner lot, this turnkey property offers an idyllic retreat with its beautifully landscaped surroundings and inviting living spaces. Step inside to discover a functional floor plan that seamlessly blends timeless architecture with modern comforts. The living spaces are bathed in natural light, highlighting the home?s distinctive details such as arched doorways, beamed ceilings, and custom tile work. Fireplaces in the living room, primary bedroom, and guest bedroom add to the warmth and coziness. Balconies off the two upstairs bedrooms offer stunning views of the mature landscaping, enhancing the property?s serene and inviting atmosphere. The detached garage and long driveway, located off the side of the property, allow parking for up to six cars. The private backyard features multiple entertaining spaces, perfect for gatherings and relaxation. A separate detached structure at the rear of the property provides versatile bonus space, ideal for use as a gym, office, or various other purposes. This is a must-see property.","Tile","Bonus Room, Entry, Exercise Room, Family Room, Galley Kitchen, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Office, See Remarks, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Dapplegray","Palos Verdes","Ridgecrest","","Sarah","Saypack","sbsaypsar","S5267","","","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","3275000","False","Full Service","Call/Text Justin @ 310-722-0517 to schedule a private showing, starting after brokers open on Tuesday July 30th.","True","None","False","","2750","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via La Selva","","3433","","","Spanish","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Submit","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","See Remarks