single-level floor plan (with garage and gym space below). The grand entry staircase, adorned with custom hand-made tiles and wrought iron railings, leads to a welcoming wraparound tiled balcony with sweeping city views. Step inside to soaring 12?14-foot ceilings, rich wood flooring and 8-foot solid wood doors. The heart of the home is an expansive great room, where custom beams, a statement tiled fireplace and abundant natural light from skylights set the tone for relaxed luxury. This space opens seamlessly to the kitchen outfitted with custom cabinetry, two generous islands and top-of-the-line appliances including a Thermador fridge and range, Bosch dishwasher, microwave drawer, Miele built-in coffee system, warming drawer, wine fridge and Grohe fixtures. Four generously sized en-suite bedrooms offer privacy and comfort, with large closets?three featuring walk-ins. The primary suite is a serene retreat with a custom-tiled fireplace, space for a sitting area or home gym and a spa-like bath featuring an oversized shower, soaking tub, makeup vanity and custom cabinetry. Designed for entertaining, the private gated backyard features an outdoor kitchen with built-in tiled barbecue with fridge and a casual bar area for dining. A cozy loggia with fireplace, 8-person spa and sparkling pool adorned with handcrafted tile make this backyard area a natural extension of the home. Additional highlights include a dual zone heat/AC system, a sound system throughout, alarm system, hidden wine cellar, separate formal dining room, Italian-style crank out windows and multiple French doors leading to the beautifully landscaped yard. With incredible privacy, proximity to the Valmonte Little League back gate, and one of the most desirable locations in the South Bay, this estate is truly a rare offering.","Tile","Bonus Room, Family Room, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","June","Shim","sbshimjun","SB1288550","","","Coldwell Banker Residen