"None","0.1811","This is a special home being offering for sale to the public for the first time.  If you have a client considering building new, this will save them 2-3 years of time and hassle and they can enjoy a great home in just weeks!  Buyer to perform due diligence; plans are available on file at the PVHA; and the seller will not be providing Completion and Compliance. Please contact Kyle Daniels with any questions or to set up a showing.","Built-In Range, Dishwasher, Refrigerator","True","164 - Valmonte","Special Assessments","True","7537008007","","0","","False","4","1","","1","2","4","6315","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Text Message","Agent Email","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","13","4000000","#ERR","04/30/2025 10:17:56 PM","","","05/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/17/2025 10:01:51 AM","","","04/30/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/14/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/17/2025 10:01:10 AM","06/17/2025 12:00:00 AM","06/17/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","13","","False","Dining Room","","Shingle Siding","Block, Wood","True","","Cash","Living Room, Outside","True","Wood","True","Central, Fireplace(s)","True","Quartz Counters","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.799868","Individual Room","True","False","","","4200000","","","4200000","#ERR","310.374.2100","","kyle@kyledanielsrealestate.com","","Kyle","310-378-1444","","Daniels","","SDANIKYL","","","","","S5543","310-375-9616","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-375-0583","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.362031","","7","7890","Lot 6500-9999","Storm Drains, Suburban","","Assessor","","","SB25095976","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Two Door","True","Front Porch","True","3","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","1259.45","Experience the best of Palos Verdes living in this dreamy Cape Cod home, perfectly designed for an active lifestyle and effortless entertaining. Imagine sunny afternoons by the pool, grilling in the outdoor kitchen, and cozy evenings gathered around the outdoor fireplace.   Elevated on a peaceful, tree-lined street in Valmonte, this two-story gem welcomes you with a charming Dutch door and opens to a light-filled interior featuring 9-foot ceilings and rich hardwood floors.  The spacious great room, complete with a cozy fireplace and custom built-ins, flows effortlessly into the masterfully updated entertainer's kitchen. Here, a large center island anchors the space, complemented by luxury fixtures and a dining area that overlooks the sparkling pool and private backyard. Direct access to the garage and a convenient pantry/storage room just off the laundry room add to the home's practicality.  Upstairs, you?ll find three light-filled bedrooms with airy vaulted ceilings, including a roomy primary suite. The luxurious primary bath is a true retreat, featuring dual vanities, a separate shower, and a soaking tub. A huge walk-in closet provides ample storage. Downstairs, a fourth bedroom with its own en-suite bathroom offers flexibility and opens directly to the yard. A dedicated office space off the entry provides a quiet area to work or study.   Located on a sought-after interior street, this home is within easy walking distance of VELA Preschool, the Little League Field, and the neighborhood playground. Enjoy the active Valmonte lifestyle with your neighbors at the PV Golf Club, the PV Tennis Club, or the PV Beach and Athletic Club.  If the outdoors is your thing, enjoy hiking on one of the local trails with spectacular views of the Los Angeles area and coast, or head to the beach for surfing and fun.  This exceptional property offers the ideal setting for someone seeking a blend of elegance, functionality, and quintessential Southern California living.","Shake","Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Primary Suite, Office, Walk-In Closet, Walk-In Pantry","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Silver Spur","Palos Verdes","Palos Verdes","","Chris","Adlam","VADLAC