ttached 2-car garage has a long driveway that leads to a cozy patio off the kitchen.  Like a precious heirloom, this is a special home.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Primary Bedroom, Walk-In Closet","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Nick","Burdiak","pvburdnic","V8107","2.5","%","Vista Sotheby's International Realty","4250000","False","Full Service","Please TEXT Valerie for an appointment:  310.704.5164","True","Private","True","","4036","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via Palomino","","3405","","","See Remarks","Cash to New Loan","","6883","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1936","90274","1055","PVR1*"
