3,910 square feet (0.32 acres), this home offers an unmatched level of California living. Featuring 5 bedrooms (one bedroom currently being used as an office), 5.5 bathrooms, and 3,925 square feet of living space - this home has it all! Each of the bedrooms features an en-suite bathroom, offering ultimate convenience and privacy. The downstairs guest suite, with its own en-suite bathroom, is accessible from the side yard, making it perfect for accommodating guests during pool days. As soon as you enter this home you are greeted by 10-foot ceilings throughout the lower level, offering an incredibly spacious floor plan including formal dining room, great room with gourmet kitchen and breakfast nook, plus living room with fireplace and a dedicated wet bar. The gourmet kitchen is a chef?s dream featuring an extraordinary 12 foot kitchen island with farmhouse sink, Thermador appliances including range with pot filler, refrigerator, freezer, speedoven, two Thermador dishwashers, plus an 18? Thermador wine fridge with 58 bottle capacity, a walk-in pantry, plus a 12 foot La Cantina pass through window overlooking the sprawling backyard. Step beyond the 16-foot La Cantina pocket doors into your own private entertainers paradise, complete with a 327-square-foot covered living space with outdoor fireplace. The saltwater pool includes an 8-foot baja shelf with seating ledge, an automatic pool cover, plus a 14 person spa with waterfall edge. Enjoy the evenings by the built-in firepit, creating unforgettable memories with family and friends. Highlights of this home include two laundry rooms, one on each level, dual-zone HVAC, Waterworks plumbing fixtures adorn the entire home, mudroom with dog wash, custom cabinetry throughout with various built-ins, peek-a-boo city light view from the front hallway and primary bathroom, skylights, Lutron lighting control in the main living spaces, Jeldwen windows and doors and much more. This Valmonte modern farmhouse is a true masterpiece that 