ce ball court.  A pathway meanders around the back of the lot connecting the garden planters with the pickle ball court, complete with lights and a back entrance into the oversized garage, used by the owners as kids headquarters for many summers of fun.  Sold in process.","","Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","SCHHANEI","Neil","Chhabria","SCHHANEI","SB1326590","2.5","%","Chhabria Real Estate Company","5100000","False","Full Service","Call","False","","","","3002","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Via La Selva","","3001","","","","Cash","","11235","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","","","","1957","90274","1047","PVR1YY"
"","0.4962","Main house is 3,299 sqft and pool house is 456 sqft based on sellers appraisal","","","164 - Valmonte","None","False","7538010014","","0","","False","7","2","","","5","5","","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","4","5200000","#ERR","03/07/2025 10:07:36 AM","","","03/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/11/2025 12:07:24 PM","","","03/07/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/11/2025 12:00:00 AM","03/07/2025 12:01:15 PM","04/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","04/10/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","4","","True","Dining Room, In Kitchen","","Stucco","","","","Conventional","Family Room, Living Room, Primary Bedroom","True","Wood","False","Central","True","","True","True","","None","False","","","","33.803717","Individual Room, See Remarks","True","False","","","4995000","","","4995000","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","","SBUNNBRI","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.38054","","6","21614","Back Yard, Front Yard, Secluded","Hiking ","Automatic Gate","Assessor","","","SB25050583","","3","3","","1","Owner","","","","","Garage - Three Door","True","Brick","True","33","","Private, Heated, In Ground, See Remarks","True","","1384.82","Behind private gates, a grand motor court welcomes you to this meticulously designed home in the Grove section of Valmonte. Situated on an expansive 21,500-square-foot lot and surrounded by majestic trees, this property is entirely flat and fully usable, offering a truly private experience. Originally built in 2007, this single-story home was meticulously built and blends classic charm with contemporary luxury, delivering an unparalleled living experience in this sought-after neighborhood. Inside, beamed ceilings, rich hardwood floors and designer fixtures add warmth and elegance, while bays of French doors seamlessly connect indoor and outdoor spaces. The 4-bedroom home ensures every bedroom has its own ensuite bath, offering ultimate comfort and privacy. A formal dining room, inviting family room and four fireplaces create a cozy yet refined atmosphere, perfect for both entertaining and everyday living. The elegant primary suite has a fireplace, a walk-in closet with custom built-ins and a bathroom with two vanities, soaking tub and steam shower. At the heart of the home is the sprawling outdoor courtyard, featuring a grand fireplace that extends the living space into the open air. The resort-style backyard is a private oasis, complete with a pool and spa that can be effortlessly controlled via your smartphone. An outdoor kitchen with a built-in grill and mini fridge makes alfresco dining and entertaining a breeze. Adding to the estate?s appeal is a separate guest quarters with kitchenette, seamlessly attached to a three-car garage, providing flexibility for extended stays, private retreat or home office. Modern amenities include dual laundry rooms, multiple air conditioning units, security system, Rachio irrigation system, Vantage outdoor lighting and a Sonos audio system throughout the property. This one-of-a-kind Valmonte estate offers an unparalleled lifestyle in one of the most coveted neighborhoods in Palos Verdes.","","Family Room, Laundry, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Charles","Fisher","SFISHCHA","sb1300260","","","Estate Properties","5200000","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt Austin for showings 310-938-9167","","Private, Heated, In Ground","True","","3755","Appraiser","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via La Selva","","2921","","","Spanish","Submit","","11235","","Single Family Residence","","","Golf Course","True","","","","2007","90274","1045","PVR1*"
"","0.2028","","","","164 - Valmonte","None","False","7537034001","","0","","False","6","1","","","5","5","6233","Palos Verdes Estates","#ERR","310-704-4014","","caricorbalis@gmail.com","","Cari","","","Corbalis","SCLAYCAR","","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","","","","","","","Agent Cell Ph","Agent Email","Co-Agent Cell Ph","","","","Central Air","True","Los Angeles","9","5209375","#ERR","05/16/2025 3:47:19 PM","","","05/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/30/2025 10:28:25 AM","","","05/16/2025 12:00:00 AM","05/25/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/28/2025 11:46:57 AM","08/29/2025 12:00:00 AM","08/29/2025 12:00:00 AM","","","9","","True","","","","","","","Conventional","Family Room, Primary Retreat","True","","True","Central","True","","True","True","none","See Remarks","False","","","","33.795702","Individual Room, Upper Level","True","False","","","5250000","","","5250000","#ERR","3109389167","","brittaustin04@gmail.com","3103781997","Brittney","","","Austin","","SBUNNBRI","","","","","S5267","310-545-0515","Vista Sotheby?s International Realty","310-546-7611","","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.365873","","1","8834","Corner Lot","Golf, Hiking , Stable(s)","","Assessor","","","SB25108877","","2","2","","1","Owner","","","","","","","","","1","","Private, Heated, Pool Cover, Waterfall","True","","1204.2","Situated on a sun-drenched corner lot in the coveted Valmonte neighborhood of Palos Verdes Estates, this home is a masterfully curated residence where modern luxury meets natural beauty. Completed in 2019, this design-forward home blends organic textures, curated finishes and thoughtful functionality across a spacious, light-filled layout. Surrounded by lush landscaping and an elevated design aesthetic by Liane Baumann Interiors, the property offers both privacy and presence. Inside, soaring ceilings?many pitched to add architectural interest?enhance the open, airy feel. Wide-plank European oak floors flow throughout, complemented by walnut cabinetry, Douglas Fir beams and a soft, natural palette. The heart of the home is an expansive great room anchored by a striking fireplace and seamless access to the outdoors via a massive Kolbe x La Cantina sliding door. The kitchen is outfitted with high-end Thermador appliances, a built-in coffee machine, an oversized Laminam topped island and a walk-in pantry?perfect for both everyday living and effortless entertaining. Each detail has been carefully considered?from Schumacher, Farrow & Ball and Serena & Lily wallpaper to Restoration Hardware lighting and Brizo fixtures. With 3 fireplaces (living, primary, and playroom), smart home Control4 wiring, ceiling speakers in nearly every room and hard-lined Ethernet throughout, this home is as smart as it is stylish. The outdoor spaces are an entertainer?s dream. A cedar deck surrounds the saltwater pool and spa, which features custom Kismet tile, waterfall, multi-color lighting and Pentair remote control. A passion fruit vine covered pergola with infrared heaters offers an elegant place for outdoor dining. The outdoor kitchen includes a built-in Blackstone griddle, gas grill, refrigerator drawers, glass front drink refrigeratior, outdoor beer system with European tap and under-mount LED lighting. Sunbrella-cushioned seating surrounds a gas fire pit, creating a year-round destination. Located just moments from local trails, golf, and Palos Verdes? top schools, this Valmonte gem is a rare opportunity to own a truly turnkey home with timeless appeal and unmatched craftsmanship.","","Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Neil","Chhabria","SCHHANEI","SB1326590","","","Chhabria Real Estate Company","5209375","False","Full Service","Call or text Britt for showings 310-938-9167","","","","","4326","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Via Campesina","","4005","","","","Submit","","6887","","Single Family Residence","","","Neighborhood","True","https://vimeo.com/10