rge bedroom that was once split into three bedrooms with three closets, and a finished downstairs room perfect for a home office or gym. Including the lower level, the home spans approximately 1,994 square feet.  Enjoy large patios in both the front and back?great for entertaining or future expansion. Best of all, this property sits on a quiet street with no city or HOA restrictions, making permitting quicker and simpler.  Bring your creativity and make this your forever home!  This property offers more than just a home?it?s a lifestyle. Located within the highly acclaimed, award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District, it?s perfect for families seeking top-tier education. Enjoy coastal living at its best?bike to the beach and to nearby restaurants and cafes, or explore the scenic trails just minutes away. Conveniently located near the Silver Spur shopping center, you'll have access to boutiques, grocery stores, and everyday essentials, all while being surrounded by the beauty and tranquility of the Peninsula.  Easy access to the 110 and 405 freeways makes commuting a breeze?reach major business hubs, Medical Centers and LAX in no time.  This neighborhood offers a community riding ring, tennis court, and miles of hiking trails.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Office","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Shawn","Nejad","VNEJASHA","V7804","","","Berkshire Hathaway HomeService","1544975","False","Full Service","Text agent to show 3105287480","","None","False","","1944","Taped","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sunnyridge","","27079","Road","","Ranch","Cash, Cash to New Loan","","17354","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","","","","1957","90274","4030","LCRA2L"
