eninsula. Property sold as-is. Discover Life on the Palos Verdes Peninsula! Set along the scenic hills of Palos Verdes, Eastvale Road offers the kind of lifestyle buyers dream of ? peaceful, private, and surrounded by natural beauty. From sunrise over the canyons to breathtaking sunsets over the City lights, every day here feels like a retreat. This neighborhood is known for its huge lots, this one in over 16,000 sq ft, quiet streets, and one-of-a-kind custom homes. Just minutes away, you?ll find award-winning Palos Verdes schools, scenic hiking and equestrian trails, and some of the most beautiful golf courses and beaches in Southern California. Shopping, dining, and easy access to the South Bay and Los Angeles are all close by, giving you the perfect balance of convenience and escape. Living on Eastvale Road means enjoying fresh ocean breezes, a strong sense of community, and the everyday luxury of coastal California livingAbout the  Area ? Palos Verdes Peninsula (Eastvale Road) The Palos Verdes Peninsula is one of Southern California?s most prestigious coastal communities, known for its dramatic ocean vistas, rolling hills, and tranquil residential neighborhoods. Eastvale Road is tucked within the sought-after Palos Verdes Peninsula area, offering a rare blend of privacy, natural beauty, and convenience.","","Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Katie","Yau","A38463","30365","","","Pinnacle Real Estate Group","1599000","False","Full Service","Please contact Doug Maupin @ (310)293-8563 or Matthew Maupin @ (310)344-2159. No showings while under contract.","True","","","","1675","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastvale","","27253","Road","","Ranch","Contract","","17354","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights","True","","","","1955","90274","4014","LCRA2L"
