ntry Club, and the renowned Jack Kramer Tennis Club, this home is ideally situated for both relaxation and recreation. Inside, you?ll find a spacious great room perfect for gatherings with tranquil views of the golf course, 4 generously sized bedrooms, and 2 full bathrooms. The kitchen and dining area open directly to the private backyard with a sparkling pool. It?s your forever home waiting for your special touches.","Composition","Great Room, Main Floor Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Claudia","Lee","p15086","PF5524","","","New Star Realty & Investment","1610000","False","Full Service","Text Rachel (310)872-6358 EASY TO SHOW","False","None","False","True","2388","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Encanto","","54","Drive","","Traditional","Cash, Cash to New Loan, Conventional","","25492","","Single Family Residence","","Sewer Connected","Golf Course, Neighborhood, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1960","90274","4245","RERA20000*"
