a peaceful canyon surrounded by beautiful mature trees and manicured landscaping. The outdoor setting invites you to enjoy nature at its finest, whether you're sipping coffee under the shade of a tree or tending to your garden beds.  Stroll down a winding path to the barn area, which is complete with corrals and turnouts?perfect for anyone dreaming of a relaxed country lifestyle. This special property provides space for animals like chickens, goats, and horses, offering the flexibility for hobby farming or equestrian activities. With direct access to miles of scenic riding and hiking trails, and just a short walk to the community riding ring. The community also features a tennis court. Despite its rural charm, the home is just minutes from everyday conveniences, offering quick access off the hill for commuters and sitting within the award-winning Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified School District.  Enjoy the best of both worlds?peaceful ranch living just moments away from shopping centers, popular restaurants, top-rated schools, and a short bike ride to the sandy shores of the South Bay. Whether you're riding horses in the morning or dining by the ocean in the evening, this home effortlessly blends tranquility and accessibility.  Inside, the layout is both functional and inviting. The main level includes two bedrooms, a full bathroom, a light-filled living room, a formal dining area, and country kitchen. Downstairs, discover a spacious primary suite with a private en-suite bath and a large family room that can serve as a cozy den, home office, or full primary retreat. Situated on a generous 21,692-square-foot lot, this exceptional property presents opportunity to own your very own ?mini ranch? in a truly special and sought-after location. Whether you're looking to embrace a more sustainable lifestyle, raise animals, entertain outdoors, or simply enjoy the beauty, this home has it all.","","Entry, Family Room, Kitchen, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Primary Suite","","