 sprawling ranch home exudes elegance and modern comfort. Arrive on a grand note, greeted by an expansive paved entrance adorned with polished stone veneers.  Lush flower beds with fresh landscaping flank the walkway, creating a burst of color and a welcoming ambiance.  Step inside through the pillared entry way and be greeted by the warmth of newer hardwood floors that flow seamlessly throughout the home.  Vaulted ceilings and strategically placed recessed lighting create a sense of spaciousness and airiness.  Unleash your inner culinary skills in the custom gourmet kitchen.  Featuring exquisite cabinetry and a massive island topping with stunning seafoam stone, the kitchen is a haven for both amateur cooks and seasoned chefs alike.  High-end stainless-steel appliances, guarantee a top-of-the-line cooking experience.  But that's not all - enjoy the peace of mind of incredible water filtration throughout the entire home.  Unwind and rejuvenate in the newly remodeled bathroom, complete with a luxurious steam shower that melts away the day's stress.  The primary suite boasts its own private, remodeled bathroom, offering a sanctuary of tranquility.  Step outside to the expansive backyard and side yards, perfect for hosting unforgettable gatherings, barbecuing or gathering around the firepit.  This vast space offers tremendous potential for adding or simply enjoying the freedom of ample room for outdoor activities.  This home is close to Rolling Hills Country Club and the Kramer Tennis Club.   Very close to the freeway for travel or work.  Minutes to restaurants or shopping....  This home is ideal for those who appreciate style, function, and the potential to create their dream space.  ADU Potential  (assessory dwelling unit)","Composition","Entry, Foyer, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Suite","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Chris","Davis","sbdavisch","S9298","","","Palm Realty Bou