562-275-3361","Lorri","562-682-9582","0","Quiett","000-0000","PQUIELOR","","0","562-682-9582","0","PB16603","","Vylla Home, Inc.","562-480-9884","0","Exclusive Right To Sell","-118.327311","","147","15702","Sloped Down, Horse Property, Horse Property Improved, Landscaped, Lot 10000-19999 Sqft, Park Nearby","Horse Trails","","Assessor","","","PW23118919","","2","4","","1","Owner","","","","Barn(s), Guest House, Guest House Detached, Storage, Workshop","Direct Garage Access","True","Deck","True","59","","None","False","Close Of Escrow","964.81","Dapplegray Lanes!!! Horse property in a prime location on a lovely, quiet, picturesque cul de sac in ?The Lanes,? a scenic, highly sought-after Rolling Hills Estates neighborhood that is known for its small-town neighborly feel and chill yet convenient location away from the traffic.  This is a great opportunity to transform a blank canvas into your dream home!  The main house has three bedrooms and three bathrooms, there is a studio guest house/ADU, a large workshop/loft space and a three-stall horse barn with a paddock that backs to miles of horse trails and is a short walk to the public arenas.  The house has great curb appeal and lovely front landscaping.  There is a formal living room and an expansive great room with high ceilings, huge windows, and a gorgeous view.  Both rooms have their own fireplaces. The kitchen has been remodeled with custom cabinets and quartz counters.  An adjacent dining area makes for easy entertaining.  There are three ample bedrooms and direct access to the garage.  A large backyard deck extends the living area and overlooks the fabulous view.  The studio home has a cute layout, kitchen and bathroom.  Above the barn is a large loft that was previously used as a woodworking studio but could easily be converted into an artist?s loft, office, playroom ? anything you desire.  The barn has three good sized stalls, including one in-and-out.  The paddock has a gate which opens directly to the miles and miles of city trails. This close-knit community is an easy commute to LA and OC and conveniently located near top-rated schools, shopping and an array of recreational activities, including tennis, golf, hiking trails, and parks.  Activities for July 4th included a mailbox decorating contest, parade, drill team performance and BBQ ? how cute is that?  Dapplegray Park offers three rings? large general-use, small dressage, and lunging?and there is lovely grassy picnic area.  At the end of Dapplegray Lane is a community center and another ring. Rolling Hills Estates provides an exceptional quality of life where residents share a love for horses and the outdoors. Don?t miss out on this great opportunity! Property recently appraised for $2 million.","Composition","All Bedrooms Down, Art Studio, Attic, Entry, Family Room, Great Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Loft, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Lorri","Quiett","PQUIELOR","PB16603","2.5","%","Vylla Home, Inc.","1700000","False","Full Service","Go direct.","True","None","False","","1762","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Sorrel","","24","Lane","","","Cash to New Loan","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","Electricity Connected, Natural Gas Connected, Sewer Connected, Water Connected","City Lights, Hills, Neighborhood, Park/Greenbelt, Trees/Woods","True","","","","1951","90274","4226","RERA2L"
