udes a living room with cozy fireplace, updated kitchen with granite countertops and custom cabinets plus an adjacent dining room. Open the french doors to the huge outdoor deck with a gorgeous pastoral view, overlooking your property where the possibilities are endless, with plenty of space for outdoor entertaining and more! Take a few steps down to the lower pad including a 2-stall barn, plus tack room and turnouts. Just a few more short steps to Dapplegray Park offers three rings? large general riding ring, small dressage, and lunging?plus a lovely grassy picnic area. At the end of Dapplegray Lane is a community center and another ring. Close escrow just in time for your family to experience Halloween in the Lanes, where the tree lined streets shut down so neighbors and friends can come together to celebrate a heartwarming display of old-fashioned fun of trick-or-treating. Don't miss your chance to be a part of this one-of-a-kind neighborhood where every day feels like a step back in time, and every Holiday is a magical community event!","","Kitchen, Living Room","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Ken","Conant","SCONAKEN","S4164","","","Re/Max Estate Properties","1862000","False","Full Service","Text Nicole @ 424-558-0476 to schedule. Must have scheduled appointment.","","","","","1919","Taped","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Sorrel","","22","Lane","","","Cash, Conventional","","14144","","Single Family Residence","","","None","False","https://22sorrel.com/idx","","","1947","90274","4226","RERA2L"
