led and is nestled on a quiet, friendly neighborhood in the heart of the Peninsula, offering a rare blend of rural serenity and everyday convenience. A tree-lined manicured garden entrance leads to an expansive driveway a two-car garage and plenty of room for recreational vehicles. Step through the inviting porch into a spacious, light-filled living room where gleaming wood floors, recessed lighting, and a custom-designed brick fireplace create an atmosphere of casual elegance. The living room seamlessly transitions to indoor /outdoor living as you enter the large viewing-entertaining deck. At the heart of the home is a remodeled kitchen, thoughtfully designed to open into the living, dining room. The kitchen features generous cabinetry, modern stainless steel appliances, and large counter space. The adjacent dining area is enhanced by a timeless wainscoting design and features serene garden views. The owner?s retreat is privately positioned away from the secondary bedrooms and offers a large private bath with walk-in shower. The two additional bedrooms are spacious, bright, and one features a ceiling fan. The newly remodeled guest bath is adorned beautifully and features a large walk-in shower. Step outside to discover a truly resort-like, park-style backyard with city and neighborhood views. Take notice of the cabana entertaining area, and open air deck as they create an idyllic setting for relaxation or hosting. A fenced lawn area opens to a private equestrian space complete with a walking loop for horses?an exceptional offering for equestrian enthusiasts. Additional highlights include central air, newer paint, access to the arena. All conveniently located to The Promenade, award-winning schools and many local eateries. An absolute must-see !!!","","Entry, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom, Primary Bedroom, Primary Suite, Retreat","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Danielle","Whitney Moore","SWHITNDA","S4726