re with one of the best climates on the Peninsula!  Spectacular views of city lights and the ocean can be seen from almost all of the rooms inside and the outside views are amazing.   Upon entering, you will be welcomed to a charming dining area and a cozy living room with a fireplace.  There is also a family room, perfect for entertaining, with breathtaking views of the ocean and city lights.  The galley style kitchen is spacious with granite counter tops and plenty of wood cabinets and counter space plus a dining area.   There is direct entry from the kitchen into the 3 car garage.  The 4 bedrooms are all a nice size with one of the bedrooms currently being used as a workout room.   The backyard is a wonderful paradise featuring beautiful landscaping, a covered patio with a built in bar, a freshly painted deck, storage shed, and an amazing pool. Plus abundant on-site additional parking/space for RV. An entertainers? delight. Don?t delay ? a rare find.  As mentioned before, the views, the views, the views, are incredible.  Award winning school district as well.  This fine home is in the Charming Westfield area which is like a world apart with a country atmosphere but provides easy access off the Peninsula. Westfield offers a family friendly setting with a community Tennis Court, Equestrian Riding Ring, Bridle and Hiking Trails. There are Community sponsored events/parties including at Halloween.  A warm and welcoming place to live. A true suburban oasis. Don?t miss this opportunity to make this home your own.","Shingle","Family Room, Kitchen, Laundry, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom, Primary Bathroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","Rancho Vista","Palos Verdes Peninsula","Miraleste","","Wahab","Balogun","SBBALOWAH","S4331","","","Century 21 Union Realty","1899000","False","Full Service","USE SHOWING TIME!!!","True","None","False","","2580","Assessor","","CA","Closed","One","","","Eastvale Road","","27363","","","","Cash to New Loan,