 feel the charm of a bygone era. The formal living room, with its cozy fireplace and expansive windows, frames breathtaking views of the city lights and distant mountains. Original wood beams, exposed brick, and built-in bookcases add character throughout, ready to inspire your vision.  The kitchen sits at the heart of the home, leading to a bonus room and formal dining area. Sliding doors open to a large patio, perfect for indoor-outdoor living. Imagine entertaining friends and family while overlooking the pool and spa, with room to breathe and enjoy the peaceful surroundings.  For equestrian enthusiasts, this property is a dream come true. With three box stalls with attached corrals, a tack room and hay barn, a private sand ring and direct trail access, you?re just steps away from miles of scenic riding trails that stretch across the peninsula.   Five bedrooms, including two primary suites (one upstairs, one down), and there?s room for everyone. The upper-level suite takes full advantage of panoramic views, offering a peaceful retreat.  Community perks include tennis courts, a riding ring, and miles of trails to explore the stunning coastal landscape. Just minutes from the beach, and with easy access to L.A., this property is a rare blend of location and lifestyle. Opportunities like this are rare. Imagine gentle ocean breezes, colorful peacocks roaming nearby, and endless potential to bring your vision to life. Make this Palos Verdes treasure your own?schedule your tour today before it?s gone!","","Entry, Family Room, Living Room, Main Floor Bedroom, Main Floor Primary Bedroom","","Palos Verdes Peninsula Unified","","","","","Oscar","Montani","SMONTOSC","S6486","","","Home Team Realty","1900000","False","Full Service","Use ShowingTime for all appointments.","True","","","","2676","Assessor","","CA","Closed","Two","","","Sunnyridge","","27255","Road","","","Cash to New Loan","","17208","","Single Family Residence","","","City Lights, Mountain(s), Panoramic","True"